window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2801,"title":"Chapter 2801 - Fleeing","paragraphs":["“Run!”","Everybody started running.","The tunnels began to collapse.","Chen Ziyun finally panicked and shouted, “Oh my god! The walls are falling down! Why is this happening?”","He had thought Feng Wu was joking.","Even Elder Wu looked rather nervous now.","Feng Wu was the calmest one. “Follow me. I’ll lead you out of the mine!”","Chen Ziyun glanced at her. Really?","He doubted it.","However, they didn’t have many options, and could only follow her instructions.","Led by Feng Wu, their retreat was rather methodical, but it wasn’t the case for the other people in the mine.","...","The people were divided into four groups, and Zuo Qingluan was on her own.","No one but Zuo Qingluan knew how she got out.","She was holding a jade pendant that held a flame.","She had carried the pendant for over a decade.","There had been an abnormal phenomenon when Feng Wu was born, which was why the entire city had been intrigued about her.","The same thing happened with Zuo Qingluan.","This jade pendant appeared when Feng Wu was born.","The midwife who delivered Feng Wu put it away.","When the Zuo family investigated Feng Wu, they found the midwife and obtained the pendant from her.","The pendant was usually white, but when activated, a tiny flaming phoenix would appear.","It had the power to destroy everything.","Zuo Qingluan had activated the pendant three times so far, and each time, the tiny phoenix would help her kill the person she wanted to kill.","She gripped the pendant and whispered, “I’m the only one with the True Phoenix Blood! My phoenix, bring down this mine!”","Sealed in the pendant was the power of a phoenix of ancient times. The energy surged at Zuo Qingluan’s command.","Boom!?","The sound of explosions and collapsing walls filled the mine.","Zuo Qingluan smirked.","She was sure she could kill Feng Wu today.","What about the others?","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t care less. It wasn’t their lucky day.","Unfortunately, Zuo Qingluan didn’t realize that the energy surge from the pendant decreased every time she activated it.","This was the third time, and there was already a crack in the pendant, which Zuo Qingluan hadn’t noticed.","What she didn’t know was that the pendant came from Feng Wu’s beautiful master and had been used to protect Feng Wu when she reincarnated into this world. Zuo Qingluan had stolen it.","Feng Wu didn’t know about the pendant, nor did she know why the mine collapse was happening so suddenly.","She frowned and quickly led the others toward the exit.","She knew formations.","And she was a Level 8 formation master.","She knew the layout of the entire mine as if the map was in her head.","Chen Ziyun followed Feng Wu.","He doubted her at first.","However, he became more amazed as they walked.","OMG!","Feng Wu really seemed to know the way!","She even avoided all the places that had collapsed!"]},{"number":2802,"title":"Chapter 2802 - Phoenix Pendant","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun noticed that Feng Wu was taking them along the safest paths.","He could hear the sound of the mine collapsing nearby, but nothing happened to the tunnel they were in.","He looked over his shoulder when they reached the next tunnel.","The one they had just walked through no longer existed.","Chen Ziyun felt a chill run down his spine.","What if...","If he hadn’t listened to Feng Wu and had picked up his pace, he would have been buried by now.","Chen Ziyun and Elder Wu looked at each other in astonishment.","It seemed that Feng Wu knew everything.","With Feng Wu leading the way, they had a relatively safe journey.","However, the other two groups weren’t as lucky.","...","The collapse wasn’t a one-off incident. It kept happening.","The eight-men group was led by Sun Yu.","When the collapse started, he immediately turned on his armband and asked for Elder Wu’s help.","“Elder Wu, Elder Wu! Are you there? We need help!”","However, he didn’t receive any reply.","It wasn’t that Elder Wu had abandoned them. Right now, he wasn’t within a 20km-radius.","Wang Xiao realized what was going on. “Elder Wu isn’t in the circle. He must have gone off to help Ziyun and Feng Wu!”","The elder was out of the armband’s reach.","Wang Xiao grew anxious.","Qiu Zeyu was even more anxious because he was terrified of death.","“It’s all Feng Wu’s fault!” Qiu Zeyu ground his teeth. “If it wasn’t for her, Ziyun would never have left the safe circle, and Elder Wu wouldn’t have left us to protect them! Elder Wu won’t know the danger we’re in now!”","Wang Xiao glanced at him.","Deep down, he felt that Qiu Zeyu was right. However, he was too responsible to blame the danger they were in on other people.","“No one knew this was going to happen.” Wang Xiao gave Qiu Zeyu a stern look. “Not Feng Wu, and not Elder Wu. Moreover, we don’t know if they’re still alive.”","Chu Qu nodded. “We’ll have to save ourselves.”","Hearing the mine collapse, Qiu Zeyu ground his teeth. “How? What should we do?!”","“Find Elder Mei!” Sun Yu made up his mind. “He must know the way out!”","“That’s right! There’s Elder Mei!” The others agreed with him.","The collapse was happening mainly around Feng Wu, and their area wasn’t as severely affected.","They soon found Elder Mei.","Elder Mei looked very displeased.","It had taken him forever to clear out this small area, and there was still much work to do.","He remembered clearly that a treasure was hidden in the mine.","It was spirit wine.","He was trying so hard to study the mine because he wanted to find the spirit wine and create a shortcut for the team members.","He and his fellow elders had made their breakthroughs this way, and it pained him to see the teenagers stuck at their levels.","But now...","More tunnels were collapsing.","The sound came from the direction where the spirit wine was buried.","Elder Mei was devastated.","“Elder Mei, is the mine collapsing?” Sun Yu asked."]},{"number":2803,"title":"Chapter 2803 - Run! (1)","paragraphs":["Elder Mei nodded solemnly. “Yes, it is.”","“Why is this happening?” Sun Yu grew anxious. “Do you know where Elder Wu is? What about Ziyun and Feng Wu?”","Elder Mei looked in the direction where most of the collapse was taking place.","Sun Yu paled.","Although Elder Mei didn’t say anything, the look on his face was the answer.","Elder Mei gritted his teeth. “You get out first! I’ll take a look over there!”","Sun Yu said, “We’ll go with you!”","Elder Mei said, “No! I don’t have the time to look after you!”","He then ran in the direction where he thought Elder Wu was.","However, he only made it a few steps before rocks began to fall.","The collapse had reached their area.","...","“Elder Mei!”","The impact threw him off balance.","The others rushed over and helped him to his feet.","However, more rocks fell from above.","Continue_reading on","“Elder Mei, do you think Elder Wu...”","Elder Mei climbed to a higher spot and looked into the distance. The area was in ruins.","Only he could climb that high because the students didn’t know formations.","Elder Mei was filled with sorrow.","When he climbed back down, his face was drained of blood and he looked ten years older.","“Elder Mei?!”","Everybody panicked when they saw his face.","Elder Mei said sadly, “They’ve been buried underneath. I don’t think the chance they survived is high...”","He took a deep breath and went on, “We’re in grave danger ourselves! We must get out as soon as possible!”","The team members couldn’t believe it. “Are we going to give up on them?”","Before Elder Mei could answer, Mr. Xu said sternly, “Do you think Elder Mei doesn’t want to save them? He can’t!","“The collapse started in their direction! One can only imagine what happened over there!","“Do you know how dangerous it’ll be to go in that direction now?","“To make it worse, we haven’t explored that area yet. Even Elder Mei doesn’t know the way!","“There are 80,000 tunnels. We can easily get lost and die there!","“Even if Elder Wu wasn’t buried, he won’t find his way out!”","The others lost hope when they heard this.","Meanwhile, more rocks were falling, and the rumbling was getting closer.","Mr. Xu turned pale. He turned to Elder Mei and waited for his decision.","Elder Mei remained silent.","Mr. Xu said anxiously, “Elder Mei, we still have so many students here. Staying here will get everybody killed!","“They’re all elite students of our school and valuable assets! We can’t afford to lose all of them!”","The team members glared at him.","“Ziyun isn’t dead!” Sun Yu retorted.","If he had known the way, he wouldn’t just be standing here.","Elder Mei finally made up his mind. “Let’s go.”","He had Mr. Xu lead the way.","They had explored this area, so Mr. Xu knew the way out.","No matter how reluctant Sun Yu and the others were, they didn’t have any choice.","They couldn’t stay here.","Because..."]},{"number":2804,"title":"Chapter 2804 - Run! (2)","paragraphs":["More rocks were falling on their heads, and the tunnels were collapsing more rapidly.","“Where’s Zuo Qingluan?” Elder Mei finally remembered the girl that had been following him around.","Mr. Xu looked around and realized he had lost Zuo Qingluan.","He then remembered something. “She said she was going to help Feng Wu...”","Elder Mei said, “Nonsense! Does she not know what her capability is like? What makes her think she can help other people?”","Mr. Xu didn’t know what to say.","Elder Mei said, “I’m afraid she’s been buried as well.”","The team didn’t like Zuo Qingluan all that much, so no one said anything when they heard the news.","Meanwhile, the rumbling was getting closer.","“Let’s go!” Mr. Xu said anxiously.","Sun Yu and the others took another look in that direction, gritted their teeth, and started moving toward the exit.","The collapse was close behind them.","They were racing against time.","......","If they lagged behind, they would be hit by the rocks and buried underneath.","It was the most dangerous thing they had ever experienced.","Mr. Xu ground his teeth.","What were these students hesitating for? That Sun Yu even wanted to save those people!","He believed he would be out of here by now if those students hadn’t delayed him.","He was complaining in his head, when Sun Yu shouted, “Isn’t this area 20km wide? Why haven’t we reached the exit?”","The sound of the collapse was so loud that Sun Yu had to shout at the top of his lungs.","Everybody was running as fast as they could, and what Sun Yu said made them realize that something was wrong.","Yes, at this speed, they should have covered the 20km by now. Why did the tunnels seem to never end? How long did they have to run?","Mr. Xu didn’t know what to say.","He was also dumbfounded.","That was right!","They should have covered the 20km in no time, but now...","Mr. Xu then realized something.","However, Sun Yu was the first to ask the question.","“Mr. Xu, you haven’t led us in the wrong direction, have you?”","Mr. Xu didn’t know what to say.","Because...","In fact...","He really had...","Mr. Xu’s face was livid. He gave Sun Yu a dirty look before turning to Elder Mei.","“Elder Mei, I...”","Elder Mei’s face was livid.","In a critical moment like this, Mr. Xu had led them in the wrong direction.","With a wave of his hand, Elder Mei led the others into a safer tunnel that had yet to collapse.","The collapse happened like dominos.","Elder Mei did some calculations and was stunned.","How had this happened?","The formation pattern he had figured out had changed significantly.","That was to say, the path he thought could lead them to the exit would no longer take them there.","Hm...","No wonder Mr. Xu ran in the wrong direction.","The formation had changed!","“Elder Mei?” Everybody looked at him anxiously.","He was their only hope.","However, Elder Mei had never appeared so troubled.","Everybody looked at one another nervously.","They knew it would be a matter of time before the collapse reached this tunnel.","Elder Mei said in a hoarse voice, “It won’t be easy to find the path now.”","Everybody was astonished."]},{"number":2805,"title":"Chapter 2805 - Can’t Find the Way","paragraphs":["Everybody stared at Elder Mei in astonishment.","What was that supposed to mean?","Mr. Xu asked the question for them. “Elder Mei, what do you mean the path is hard to find now?”","The collapse had stopped, but it was only temporary. They knew the next wave would start soon.","Elder Mei seemed troubled by the question.","He slowly said, “The formation in the Secret Essence Mine is beyond complicated. Solving it has been much harder than I expected.","“I thought the area I explored would remain safe, but when the formation changed, everything changed with it.”","Mr. Xu asked anxiously, “Is this formation forever changing?”","Elder Mei nodded.","“We’re finished...” Mr. Xu began to howl.","If the formation really did that, they would have no way to get out.","...","Sun Yu and his teammates panicked. “Why is this happening? I thought we were...”","Mr. Xu glared at them. “The formation has changed! It means the paths have changed with it! We need to find a new way out!”","Sun Yu was speechless.","The others were anxious as well.","“What should we do now?” They all looked at Mr. Xu and Elder Mei.","Mr. Xu said, “It took us days to find that path, but now...”","Boom!?","Something worse happened.","Their tunnel finally began to collapse.","Mr. Xu paled. “It’s coming! The tunnel is coming down! Elder Mei, what should we do? We’re going to be buried!”","Elder Mei’s face was drained of all color.","What should he do?","“I can find the way out if I have two more days, but now...”","Elder Mei turned in the direction of the noise.","The rumbling was getting closer and closer.","They didn’t have two minutes, let alone two days.","Elder Mei looked at them. “You have two minutes to write down your last words.”","Last words?","Sun Yu was almost in tears. “Last words? We’re about to fight Military College! Are we going to be wiped out?”","Everybody panicked.","Elder Mei waved at them. “Write down your last words, and people may dig out the papers later.”","He then started on his own.","Sun Yu suddenly smacked his forehead. “Wait! DIdn’t Feng Wu give us a little paper crane?”","“That’s right!” Wang Xiao nodded. “Feng Wu gave us a paper crane! She said it would lead us out of here!”","Mr. Xu found his words idiotic. “Do you seriously believe her?”","Elder Mei wanted to roll his eyes as well.","When one’s life was threatened, people would stop thinking straight and might even become delusional.","Let it be. They were going to die, anyway.","Sun Yu took out the paper crane.","The crane flapped its wings and flew forward.","“Little crane, can you take us out of here?” Sun Yu was full of hope.","Elder Mei rolled his eyes again.","Sun Yu grabbed his arm. “Let’s go. Maybe it really knows the way out.”","Elder Mei didn’t have any hope at all.","He found the whole thing nonsensical.","Wang Xiao took Elder Mei’s other arm. “Standing here will get us killed! Follow that bird, and maybe we still have a chance!”","The others followed the bird. Meanwhile, Mr. Xu was..."]},{"number":2806,"title":"Chapter 2806 - Agitation","paragraphs":["Mr. Xu was left behind.","“Wait...”","He grew anxious when the others ran off with the bird.","Although he didn’t think the crane was reliable, he didn’t want to stay here alone.","He quickly followed the others, running as fast as he could.","The crane led the way, flying a little bit faster than the speed of the collapse.","Sun Yu and Wang Xiao held Elder Mei’s arms and pushed him forward.","“Let go of me! Let go!”","Elder Mei shouted angrily.","However, Sun Yu and the others ignored his protests and moved as fast as they could.","Meanwhile, outside the Secret Essence Mine.","...","Gongsun Mu and his colleagues were rushing toward the mine.","They were panic-stricken when they sensed the danger.","“Why did it happen so suddenly? Everything was fine earlier!” Mr. Yang said anxiously.","Mr. Duan said, “The entire Dynasty Team is inside. If something happens, we’re going to...”","“Elder Mei is inside, too. We can’t lose him...”","Gongsun Mu worried about Feng Wu the most.","The crown prince had summoned him in person. Although he never mentioned Feng Wu, everything he said had been a hint that Gongsun Mu should protect the girl.","Therefore, Gongsun Mu had always known how well-connected Feng Wu was.","He found Zuo Qingluan’s petty tricks utterly ridiculous.","“Miss Qingluan is inside, too!” Mr. Wang shouted agitatedly. “She’s the crown prince’s fiancee! If something happens to her, our college is finished!”","Gongsun Mu gave him a stern look without another word.","The crown prince had only given him hints about protecting Feng Wu, and Zuo Qingluan’s name never came up. She wasn’t his fiancee! That girl must be delusional!","Gongsun Mu and the others arrived at the Secret Essence Mine.","The door was closed.","Gongsun Mu was stranded outside the door, and there was nothing he could do.","“What should we do now? Mr. Gongsun, what should we do?” Mr. Wang and the others were anxious.","Getting blamed for putting Zuo Qingluan in danger wasn’t the worst part. If the team lost the competition, the resources the teachers received would be reduced as well.","Their own benefits would be affected.","After the first explosion, the tunnels collapsed like dominos. The ground outside shook as well.","The ground shook so violently that the people outside were only able to remain standing because they were capable cultivators.","“Mr. Gongsun, the ground is caving in! It’s collapsing, too!” Mr. Wang shouted.","He was trying to say that since they couldn’t save the others, they might as well leave first.","Gongsun Mu shook his head. “You can leave if you want, but I’m not leaving!”","Mr. Wang turned to look at the other tutors.","The other tutors showed no intention to leave.","Mr. Wang stomped his feet. He now had to stay here, where they could be buried alive at any moment.","He muttered, “They must have been buried alive and are dead by now. There’s no point in standing here. We’ll only be killed, too! What a waste of energy!”","No one answered him.","The people inside were too important for Imperial College to lose.","The tutors had never been so serious, and their eyes were bloodshot red.","Mr. Wang was about to continue, when something happened."]},{"number":2807,"title":"Chapter 2807 - Come Out","paragraphs":["Somebody charged out of the door.","Everybody was thrilled when they saw who it was.","“Zuo Qingluan!”","“Miss Qingluan!”","Gongsun Mu and the others ran to her side in excitement.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t look well.","Her clothes were covered with dust, and there was blood on her face.","Gongsun Mu immediately asked, “What’s going on inside? Where are the others?”","All eyes were on Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan struggled to her feet, took a deep breath, and said gravely, “They, they...”","“What happened to them?” Everybody was anxious.","...","“Speak!”","Zuo Qingluan said, “It was all Feng Wu’s fault! If she had listened to Elder Mei and remained in the area she was supposed to, this mine would never have collapsed!”","Mr. Wang said, “What? Did Feng Wu start it? I told you already, that Feng Wu is trouble! Now you know I’m right!”","Gongsun Mu frowned and stared at Zuo Qingluan. “Where are the others?”","Continue -reading on","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth. “Feng Wu took everybody with her. I couldn’t stop them. They wouldn’t listen to me and went away with Feng Wu. They’ve all been buried down there! They’re all dead!”","She believed that everybody was dead, and she could make up whatever story she wanted.","Gongsun Mu’s head spun.","Everybody had been buried alive?","Including Feng Wu?","Gongsun Mu swayed and dropped to his knees.","“Mr. Gongsun!”","Everybody helped him to his feet.","It was such a hard blow. Although Zuo Qingluan had come out, Imperial College still couldn’t afford the loss.","Mr. Wang said, “At least His Royal Highness won’t blame us.”","He turned to Zuo Qingluan. “I’m so happy to see you. Otherwise, it would be the end of Imperial College!”","Zuo Qingluan smirked inwardly. Once Feng Wu was dead, she was all the empire had!","The crown prince would have to choose her.","She thought about how she was going to marry the crown prince, give him children, and become empress...","She could feel her heartbeat racing.","However, Gongsun Mu shouted, “No, His Royal Highness will make us pay! He will!”","Everybody gave him strange looks.","Zuo Qingluan had come out alive. Why would the crown prince be angry?","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan stared at Gongsun Mu.","She wondered if he knew something.","“Was Feng Wu buried? Are you sure she’s dead?” Gongsun Mu stared at Zuo Qingluan with bloodshot eyes.","Zuo Qingluan said coldly, “Yes, she’s dead. I saw it with my own eyes!","“And there was Elder Mei. He died trying to save her...”","“Did you watch them getting buried, too?” Mr. Yang asked.","Zuo Qingluan thought, “Those people are all dead, and no one can verify my words.” Therefore, she could slander Feng Wu however she wanted.","“Yes!” Zuo Qingluan said decisively."]},{"number":2808,"title":"Chapter 2808 - Alive","paragraphs":["Mr. Wang lost his temper when he heard that Elder Mei had died because he tried to save Feng Wu.","“That Feng Wu got so many people killed just because she thought she had a little talent!","“I warned you before. Someone should discipline her! To possess talent but no moral integrity will get people killed!","“It was all her fault! If she hadn’t wandered off, the others wouldn’t have been buried!","“Elder Mei was there, including the entire Dynasty Team!","“Feng Wu is going to ruin our college!”","Mr. Wang shouted at the top of his lungs.","Zuo Qingluan smiled viciously.","She loved it when Mr. Wang did all the work accusing Feng Wu.","In the Secret Essence Mine.","Elder Mei was astonished.","He had been furious at first.","The two students had disobeyed him.","......","However, his mouth had fallen open.","Because...","As they followed the paper crane, he started to recognize their surroundings.","The rumbling remained some distance behind them, and it almost felt like they were on the right track.","“Elder Mei, Elder Mei, we’re a little safer now. Please find the path!” Mr. Xu urged him.","Elder Mei didn’t say anything. He only stared at the crane that had been leading the way.","The paper crane...","Could it be...","“Elder Mei? Elder Mei?!”","Mr. Xu almost wanted to shake the old man by the shoulders.","Elder Mei woke up from his stupor and looked at the crane.","He sounded certain when he spoke again. “Follow the bird.”","“What?” Mr. Xu was dumbfounded.","Follow the crane?","“But it’s just something Feng Wu made as a joke!”","Mr. Xu thought Elder Mei was so shocked he had lost his mind.","He said, “Elder Mei, have you forgotten? Didn’t you say the paper crane was nonsense? We even tore up the one she gave us!”","Elder Mei was speechless.","Had he done something so stupid?","Gosh... He really had!","Elder Mei blushed and didn’t know what to say.","However, when his life was in danger, his dignity didn’t matter anymore.","Elder Mei shook his head and glanced at Mr. Xu. “No, it seems it’s not a joke.”","Mr. Xu said, “What?”","Elder Mei said, “It probably has Level 8 inscriptions on it.”","Mr. Xu said, “What did you say?”","When he recovered from the initial shock, he stared at Elder Mei and really thought the old man had lost it.","“Elder Mei, do you still remember how Feng Wu gave out the paper cranes? Apart from Zuo Qingluan, she gave a paper crane to each of us.","“Level 8 inscriptions may not be so rare in the Dongsang Kingdom, but here in the Junwu Empire, they’re priceless.","“Do you think Feng Wu would give us something so precious in passing?","“She was so casual about it! It was like she was giving out ordinary fruit!","“How can it be Level 8 inscriptions? I won’t believe it even if you kill me!” Mr. Xu said decisively.","Elder Mei didn’t believe it either because Feng Wu had been so off-handed about it when she gave out the paper cranes.","However..."]},{"number":2809,"title":"Chapter 2809 - Confrontation (1)","paragraphs":["Elder Mei didn’t believe it at first, but what the paper crane did was beyond his expectations.","He studied the paper crane and calmly said, “Let’s follow it first.”","Mr. Xu found the whole thing ridiculous.","Sun Yu looked from Elder Mei to Mr. Xu and suggested, “It’s not like we have any other options. Let’s just follow the bird. What if it works?”","They followed the bird after that.","Before long, they saw a spot of light up ahead.","Mr. Xu shouted excitedly, “Look! There’s light!”","The underground tunnels were pitch-black, and they had been using torches to move around.","The light meant one thing.","“Is the exit up ahead?” Sun Yu was equally excited.","Elder Mei was astonished, but deep down, he knew this was going to happen.","He looked at the paper crane.","Just then, the bird seemed to have used up its energy. It swayed and turned into a little ball of flame.","......","Before they could do anything, the bird turned into a wisp of smoke and disappeared.","Elder Mei rushed forward, trying to grab it, but the smoke vanished into thin air.","“Elder Mei, Elder Mei! We found our way out! We’re going to live!” Mr. Xu said excitedly.","Seeing that Elder Mei was still standing there, he grabbed the old man’s arm and dragged him out of the tunnel.","The people outside jumped when they charged out of the door.","Zuo Qingluan was the most astonished of them all.","Her face went livid when she saw Elder Mei and the others.","Gongsun Mu and the tutors were thrilled to see Elder Mei. They immediately gathered around him.","“Elder Mei!”","“You’re still alive!”","“Thank god!”","Gongsun Mu and the tutors had been devastated a few minutes ago, but now, they were ecstatic.","Some of them even burst into joyous tears.","Elder Mei was exhausted by all the running.","He looked pale and weak.","Gongsun Mu counted the people around him.","Elder Mei, Mr. Xu, Zuo Qingluan...","“We still have three people inside!” Gongsun Mu had been looking for Feng Wu.","However, no matter how many times he searched, he still couldn’t find Feng Wu anywhere, and he grew anxious. “Where’s Feng Wu? Where is she?!”","Sun Yu said sadly, “Feng Wu and Ziyun are in the same group. They’re...”","“Was she really buried inside?” Gongsun Mu panicked.","“Buried?” Sun Yu was confused. “Who said that?”","“She did!”","Everybody turned in Zuo Qingluan’s direction.","They all looked at her.","Gongsun Mu glared at Zuo Qingluan. “Didn’t you say you saw Feng Wu getting buried?”","Zuo Qingluan was speechless.","Sun Yu and the others were shocked. They stared at Zuo Qingluan and asked, “Did you see it?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t answer.","Sun Yu was even more anxious. “Answer me! Did you see them getting buried?”","“Sun Yu, do you not know?” Gongsun Mu was confused.","Sun Yu said, “How are we supposed to know? We weren’t together.","“Elder Wu split us into two groups. Feng Wu and Ziyun were in one group, and the eight of us were in another group. Ziyun was in danger, so Elder Wu went to help him.”"]},{"number":2810,"title":"Chapter 2810 - Confrontation (2)","paragraphs":["“Then the collapse started, so we went to Elder Mei and ran out of the mine with Mr. Xu.”","Gongsun Mu frowned. “That’s not what I heard. Miss Qingluan, didn’t you say you saw with your own eyes Elder Mei and the students getting buried down there?”","“That’s right!” Mr. Duan also turned to Zuo Qingluan. “Miss Qingluan, you did say that you were there when the others were buried.”","All the tutors had heard her say those words, so she had no excuse to make.","She began to panic.","She thought the others had all died, and nobody would challenge her. However, these people had come out alive!","Why didn’t they die?!","Sun Yu stared at Zuo Qingluan. “Miss Qingluan, I think you owe us an explanation.”","Zuo Qingluan glanced at Sun Yu. “What explanation?”","Sun Yu said, “Miss Zuo, just because you’re the vice chief doesn’t give you the right to make irresponsible claims.”","Zuo Qingluan stared at him. She couldn’t believe someone would talk to her that way.","Gongsun Mu also said, “Miss Zuo, I’d like an explanation, too!”","Zuo Qingluan snorted. “I saw Feng Wu getting buried. As for Elder Mei, I admit I made the wrong assumption. I thought they were all together.”","Sun Yu frowned. “We split up from the very beginning. How could we be together?”","Zuo Qingluan glared at him. “Are you questioning me now?!”","Please reading -on","She was still a vice chief, and Sun Yu didn’t dare ask too many questions, fearing that he might offend her.","Everybody found her explanation unsatisfactory, but they didn’t know what to accuse her of, so they stopped questioning her.","Moreover, Gongsun Mu cared more about Feng Wu.","“I don’t believe she’s dead! She’s going to come out alive!” He gritted his teeth. “I believe in miracles!”","Zuo Qingluan smirked.","The tunnels had probably all collapsed. How was Feng Wu going to come out?","Zuo Qingluan feigned a sad tone and pretended to be in tears. “She’s dead. I saw it with my own eyes. Mr. Gongsun, we should move somewhere safe.”","Mr. Wang said, “That’s right! It’s not safe here! The ground is still shaking, and we don’t know if the collapse will spread. Mr. Gongsun, we should leave!”","Gongsun Mu said, “You can go if you want. I don’t think she’s dead!”","Zuo Qingluan said, “But Elder Mei is exhausted...”","She had rushed to Elder Mei’s side as soon as he came out, asking about his condition. Unfortunately, Elder Mei didn’t even glance at her.","To her surprise, Elder Mei said, “I don’t think she’s dead either.”","WHAT?!","Everybody stared at Elder Mei.","The old man hadn’t liked Feng Wu all that much before, but now...","Zuo Qingluan didn’t like the sound of that at all."]},{"number":2811,"title":"Chapter 2811 - Astonishment","paragraphs":["She stared at Elder Mei, completely shocked.","She was much sharper than the others and could sense the change in his attitude.","It wasn’t a good sign.","She had invested so much in the old man. She did everything he asked and fawned on him.","Elder Mei had begun to warm up to her. However, she was gone for a little while, and Elder Mei had grown fond of Feng Wu!","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t accept it.","“Elder Mei, you...” Zuo Qingluan said in an aggrieved tone, “I’m sorry for your loss, but Feng Wu is...”","Hearing that, Elder Mei threw a dirty look at her.","Sun Yu smirked. “Feng Wu is the only reason we were able to get out. There’s no way she’s trapped inside.”","What did he mean?","Zuo Qingluan’s pupils contracted, and she stared at Sun Yu. “What did you say?”","Sun Yu said, “Feng Wu helped us get out!”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t believe him. She turned to Mr. Xu for an explanation.","Mr. Xu nodded. “The formation has completely changed, and we couldn’t find the safe passageway from earlier. We came out because we followed Feng Wu’s paper crane.”","“What paper crane?” Zuo Qingluan glared at him.","Please reading- on MYBOX N0VEL. COM","Mr. Xu said, “Just like the one you tore up earlier.”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Those words felt like a slap to her face.","“That little paper crane? It’s impossible!” Zuo Qingluan ground her teeth. “I don’t believe you!”","Sun Yu turned around and smirked.","“Suit yourself. Feng Wu led us out of the mine, and that’s a fact. I’m sure she’ll be able to get out,” Sun Yu said confidently.","“What do you mean?” Gongsun Mu was shocked.","Why was everybody telling him different things?","“You said you watched Feng Wu getting buried alive.” He turned to Zuo Qingluan.","He then turned to Sun Yu. “Did you say Feng Wu led you out?","“Which of you is telling the truth? Is Feng Wu alive or not?!”","Even Gongsun Mu was confused, let alone the other tutors.","Sun Yu said, “We were lost at first, and even Elder Mei couldn’t find the way. Luckily, we had a paper crane that Feng Wu gave us earlier, and it led us out of the tunnel.”","“How could a paper crane lead you out?” Somebody didn’t believe him.","Sun Yu said, “Feng Wu told us the paper crane had Level 8 inscriptions on it.”","“Don’t make me laugh! Level 8 inscriptions? Do you know what that means?” Mr. Wang smirked. “If that’s the case, show me!”","Sun Yu said, “It’s burnt to ash.”","Mr. Wang said, “So, you don’t have any evidence.”","Sun Yu said, “Elder Mei said so himself!”","Zuo Qingluan gave Mr. Wang a warning glance, and Mr. Wang kept questioning Sun Yu.","He said, “Elder Mei doesn’t talk much, but you can’t make up things like that...”","“He’s telling the truth,” Elder Mei suddenly said.","Everybody was shocked.","Level 8 inscriptions?","The paper crane really had Level 8 inscriptions!"]},{"number":2812,"title":"Chapter 2812 - Chased by the Collapse","paragraphs":["However, Level 8 inscriptions were so precious, and were only used in the central area of the school.","Feng Wu was a mere student. How could she possibly have that kind of instrument?","Who was she kidding?","Sun Yu added, “Feng Wu has a lot of them. She gave one to each of us.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Not me.”","Sun Yu said, “Yes, she left only you out.”","Zuo Qingluan almost exploded.","Mr. Wang said, “Didn’t you say the crane burnt to ash? You can say whatever you want.”","Seeing that Sun Yu wanted to bring up Elder Mei again, Mr. Wang cut him off. “I’ll only believe you if Feng Wu comes out alive.”","However, could Feng Wu come out alive?","Everybody stared at the exit.","Then...","Boom!?","The ground shook even more violently.","Rocks kept spilling out of the mine and almost landed on their heads.",".....","A rock hit Mr. Wang on the back, and he almost burst into tears.","“Mr. Gongsun, did you hear that? The collapse is coming in our direction. We should leave now!” Mr. Wang urged everybody.","“Feng Wu must be dead! She can’t survive this!”","Gongsun Mu couldn’t keep his balance either.","The cracks on the ground looked like spider webs.","Boom!?","The sound grew louder and louder.","Just then, dark clouds gathered in the sky, and it turned dark.","Whoosh!","“Look! The walls of the mine are cracking, too!” Mr. Wang almost jumped to his feet.","Everybody looked up.","He was right. There were cracks on the outer wall of the mind.","They were expanding as well.","The mine really was going to collapse.","The walls were over 30 meters high. If the walls fell on them, they would all be buried inside.","They had to leave.","Zuo Qingluan cherished her life more than anything else and was the first to run.","Mr. Wang followed her.","Mr. Yang and the others looked at one another before anxiously turning to Gongsun Mu.","Gongsun Mu was so worried that he felt sick.","He couldn’t run.","If Feng Wu really were inside, the crown prince would punish all of them.","When that happened, they would wish they were dead.","He would rather die here than run away.","“Run! All of you!” He decided to stay where he was.","Mr. Yang and the others anxiously looked at the shaking mine that could collapse at any moment.","“Go!” Gongsun Mu bellowed.","He stayed because he had to take full responsibility.","If he died with Feng Wu, maybe the crown prince would spare Imperial College.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and the other two were rushing as fast as they could through the mine.","If Little Phoenix were around, they wouldn’t be worried about a collapse of this size. The bird could sense everything and would know the safest route.","However, the bird was still cultivating now, and they were on their own.","Figuring out the right route wasn’t enough. They also had to avoid the places where the walls would cave in.","The collapse was right on their heels.","It was moving as fast as they were."]},{"number":2813,"title":"Chapter 2813 - Shadow Phoenix","paragraphs":["If Feng Wu were a little bit slower when she calculated the route, they would all die.","Chen Ziyun kept his eyes on Feng Wu and didn’t dare disturb her.","Even Elder Wu didn’t dare make a sound.","Feng Wu was too important to them now.","If she were a second too slow, they would all be dead.","Luckily, Feng Wu was a Level 8 formation master, and she knew this formation inside out. Therefore, she was able to choose the best route every single time.","She found it strange when she noticed a hint of a phoenix from the collapse that was on their heels.","It was the energy of the True Phoenix Blood.","Was it Zuo Qingluan?","Feng Wu frowned and stopped abruptly.","If it really was the effect of the True Phoenix Blood, would her Divine Phoenix Blood be able to stop it?","Seeing Feng Wu stop, Chen Ziyun thought he was going to have a heart attack.","“Feng Wu! God! Why are you standing there? Run!”","The collapse was almost upon them.","Feng Wu took out a dagger and slid it across her palm.","Blood oozed out.","Drops of blood flew out toward the collapsed site.","“Xiao Wu, what are you doing? Run!” Chen Ziyun grabbed Feng Wu and ran toward the exit.","Caught by surprise, Feng Wu was dragged away.","Seeing light up ahead, Chen Ziyun shouted in excitement, “It’s right ahead! Run!”","The collapse seemed to speed up behind them.","It was as if a beast had woken up deep in the mine.","Elder Wu grabbed Chen Ziyun, who grabbed Feng Wu in turn and picked up his speed.","With a whoosh, they rushed out of the mine.","The moment they were outside, the mine’s entrance collapsed.","Elder Wu saw Gongsun Mu kneeling on the ground, so he grabbed the latter with his free hand and ran away from the collapsing site.","Feng Wu felt dizzy from all the yanking, so she didn’t realize that there was a Shadow Phoenix in the collapsed mine.","The Shadow Phoenix had been trapped inside a jade pendant.","Flames spread out as if a phoenix was soaring in the sky.","Zuo Qingluan had put a drop of her blood on the pendant to wake up the Shadow Phoenix.","Enraged, the bird started the explosion that brought down the entire mine.","It was only a shadow, but it could destroy the whole mine with one sneeze.","If it recovered more strength and did more than sneeze...","The result would be terrifying!","The phoenix licked its beak.","It tasted like blood.","What?","The bird seemed confused.","The food tasted much better!","It had tasted that blood a long time ago.","It couldn’t understand why the food had suddenly become so tasty.","It wanted all its food to taste like this.","Somehow, the bird felt it was born to feed on things like that blood.","What it had eaten before was rubbish in comparison.","It threw a dirty look in Zuo Qingluan’s direction as it returned to the pendant.","What Zuo Qingluan didn’t know was...","Her True Phoenix Blood was far less potent than the Divine Phoenix Blood.","Now that the Shadow Phoenix had tasted Feng Wu’s blood, it would resist Zuo Qingluan’s blood when she tried to get the bird to do dirty deeds for her..."]},{"number":2814,"title":"Chapter 2814 - Zuo Qingluan Slips Away","paragraphs":["Boom!?","The mine finally collapsed.","Luckily, Elder Wu dragged everybody away before that.","“Feng Wu! Feng Wu!”","“Ziyun!”","“Elder Wu!”","Everybody rushed to their side and greeted them.","There were a few exceptions.","One of them was Zuo Qingluan.","It had never occurred to her that Feng Wu would come out alive.","She ground her teeth.","She had ordered the Shadow Phoenix to kill Feng Wu, no matter the cost.","The bird had disappointed her.","......","Recalling how she had said she saw Feng Wu getting buried, she felt mortified.","When the others weren’t looking, Zuo Qingluan slipped away.","Mr. Wang had been watching Zuo Qingluan and was surprised when he saw her leave.","Had she given up?","By the looks of it, the girl wasn’t as capable as she was said to be. He wondered if he was barking up the wrong tree.","Fearing the humiliation, Mr. Wang ran off as well.","Gongsun Mu was so excited to see Feng Wu that he burst into tears.","He grabbed her sleeves and examined her as if she were his granddaughter.","Elder Mei gave Feng Wu a long look and said, “Come with me.”","Feng Wu walked away with him.","The other people gathered together and exchanged stories about their adventures in the mine.","Hearing their conversation, Gongsun Mu frowned. “So, Zuo Qingluan was lying when she said she saw you all buried alive.”","Sun Yu said, “She wasn’t even with us. How could she see that?”","Chen Ziyun nodded. “That’s right. There was no way she could have seen us. Moreover, even if she had, why didn’t she try to save us? And how did she get out?”","Gongsun Mu and the other tutors found Chen Ziyun’s argument very reasonable.","They were going to question Zuo Qingluan, but realized she was no longer there.","“She disappeared quickly enough!” Gongsun Mu ground his teeth. He now realized that there was something off about Zuo Qingluan.","Sun Yu said, “We only got out because of Feng Wu’s paper crane!”","Chu Qu said, “That’s right! Elder Mei said the formation had changed, and he didn’t know the way anymore. We lost all hope. Luckily, we had Feng Wu’s crane on us, and that was how we got out!”","Chen Ziyun was surprised. “Was that how you got out? I didn’t think the paper crane would work!”","Chu Qu said, “That’s right. Elder Mei didn’t know what to do and actually asked us to write down our last words. The bird showed us the way. Ziyun, how did you get out?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Feng Wu led us out.”","Chu Qu was astonished. “Are you saying Feng Wu really knew her way around the mine? Is she really a Level 8 inscription master?”","“That’s impossible! She might know the way, but she can’t be a Level 8 inscription master! Even Elder Mei isn’t at that level yet.” Chen Ziyun shook his head."]},{"number":2815,"title":"Chapter 2815 - Spiritual King","paragraphs":["“Maybe someone gave her the paper cranes,” Qiu Zeyu said timidly.","Chen Ziyun said, “That’s right. That has to be it. That was why she was so generous with them.”","Everybody nodded.","They couldn’t accept the fact that Feng Wu was a Level 8 inscription master.","In their minds, all inscription masters were elderly people like Elder Mei.","“Ziyun!” Sun Yu suddenly cried out.","Everybody looked at him.","“What?” Chen Ziyun was perplexed.","“Ziyun, you feel different,” Sun Yu said curiously.","“I feel the same! Ziyun used to be just like us, but there’s something so formidable about his energy now.”","Gongsun Mu also looked at Chen Ziyun.","His eyes widened.","“You’re a Spiritual King now!”","......","A Spiritual King?","Everybody looked at Chen Ziyun in astonishment.","God knew how eagerly they wanted to defeat the Military Academy.","The Military Academy team had at least two Spiritual Kings, but the Imperial College had never had any before this. It was a great humiliation to Imperial College.","But now, Chen Ziyun was a Spiritual King.","“Really? Ziyun really is a Spiritual King now?”","“OMG! This is great news!”","“Ziyun, how did you do it? Teach us!”","All the other team members asked him for instructions, but Chen Ziyun couldn’t hear any of them.","He was in a trance-like state.","He tried to check his dantian but was too excited to control his spiritual essence properly.","He had wanted this so badly that when it actually happened, he didn’t know what to do.","It took him a while to regain control and examine himself.","He was relieved.","He had become a Spiritual King.","On this continent, only cultivators at the Spiritual King stage and above were considered to be the real masters.","The Spiritual King stage was a benchmark.","Above it were the rulers.","Below it were those who were ruled.","He had finally crossed the threshold and entered a new phase.","It was a great rise for both himself and the Chen family behind him.","He was going to make his family so proud.","Chen Ziyun almost burst into tears.","He took a deep breath and fought back the urge to cry.","He knew perfectly well how he had become a Spiritual King.","Elder Wu looked at him in satisfaction.","He also knew what had happened.","He was a witness.","He saw Feng Wu hand the spirit wine to Chen Ziyun, who drank it and made the breakthrough.","Without the spirit wine, it would be next to impossible to turn a Spiritual Lord into a Spiritual King.","With it, the process became so easy.","Elder Wu looked at the team and thought about the possibility of all of them becoming Spiritual Kings.","The idea thrilled him."]},{"number":2816,"title":"Chapter 2816 - Special Attention","paragraphs":["However, Elder Wu knew that wasn’t feasible.","The spirit wine would only work on someone like Chen Ziyun, who had reached the peak of the Spiritual Lord stage. It would be wasted on other cultivators.","Chen Ziyun looked in the direction Feng Wu had left with complicated feelings.","She said she would make him a Spiritual King, and she did it.","Nobody would believe such a promise, even if it came from the head of the college.","How was she able to do such things?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was with Elder Mei.","The old man stared at her for a long time, thinking the girl would be flustered. However, he was disappointed.","The girl stood straight and met his gaze.","She was so calm.","“Where did you get the paper cranes?” Elder Mei asked.","Feng Wu didn’t answer him.","“Who gave them to you? Who’s your master?” Elder Mei stared at her.","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “There are 103 loopholes in the eastern woods in the college. Would you rather stare at me than repair them?”","Elder Mei’s face darkened.","103 loopholes?","How did she know that?","That was the correct number!","Feng Wu walked away after that.","She didn’t need other people to recognize her achievements in formations and inscriptions.","Those skills could work wonders when it came to surprising her opponents.","Elder Mei didn’t try to stop her.","He watched the girl leave with a pensive look on his face.","Imperial College.","Feng Wu went back to her dormitory.","Room 2001.","Chaoge and Zi Ling had their own tasks to finish and were both away.","Ye Han had moved back.","She was lying comfortably in a lounge chair, reading a book while eating some fruit.","The door opened.","Ye Han frowned and looked in that direction.","She thought it was Zi Ling and was going to scold the girl.","However, she was dumbfounded when she saw Feng Wu come in.","Earlier in the Secret Essence Mine, Feng Wu had demonstrated her power, and even Shan Jingfei had been forced to go to Peace Grassland.","Ye Han scrambled to her feet, dropping the fruit in the process.","She no longer tried to antagonize Feng Wu, but she didn’t know if Feng Wu would want to take revenge.","It would be a piece of cake for Feng Wu.","She wanted to play nice and greet Feng Wu, but she was worried it would make her seem snobbish.","Moreover, what if Feng Wu ignored her and walked away?","So many thoughts flashed through Ye Han’s mind at that moment.","Feng Wu only glanced at her and casually said, “You’re reading.”","“Y- Yes...” Ye Han didn’t expect to hear Feng Wu greet her first, and was overwhelmed by what felt like special attention.","Feng Wu nodded at her and headed back to her own room.","She had fought non-stop in the Secret Essence Mine, which had cost her a lot of energy. She needed to take a break.","However, she only took a few steps before she stopped.","Ye Han eagerly waited for Feng Wu to leave."]},{"number":2817,"title":"Chapter 2817 - I’m a Spiritual King as Well","paragraphs":["Ye Han was relieved that Feng Wu was leaving, and was ready to go back to her room, when Feng Wu suddenly spoke to her.","She dropped her fruit again.","She looked at Feng Wu and was too scared to breathe.","Feng Wu sat down and patted the lounge chair. “Sit.”","Ye Han was alarmed.","Feng Wu smiled. “Since you don’t have much to do, why don’t you answer some questions for me?”","Before Ye Han could say anything, Feng Wu asked, “Have you heard of the Military Academy team?”","Ye Han was relieved.","It seemed Feng Wu wasn’t here to settle accounts with her.","“Of course I have. I was one of the cheerleaders when our team fought them last year. We lost so miserably.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why do you say that?”","Chen Ziyun only said they had lost, but he didn’t say how badly.","Ye Han knew Feng Wu had joined the Dynasty team, so she immediately knew why she wanted to know.","The two teams were going to compete again.","Feng Wu would probably be taking part.","She had to do some research beforehand.","Ye Han was happy to be useful. “If you ask me, you should stay out of this competition.”","Feng Wu shrugged.","Ye Han said, “If you have to take part, try to be the last fighter.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why?”","Ye Han said, “It will be a 5v5 competition. Each team will have five fighters, and the team with the last member standing wins.","“From what I’ve seen so far, the first ones to go on stage are beaten up pretty badly. The last one can choose to give in since our team will lose anyway. They won’t suffer from too many injuries.”","Feng Wu rolled her eyes. “Why are you so sure that we’ll lose?”","Ye Han was amazed, and she asked after a long while, “Do you want to hear the truth?”","Before, when she deemed Feng Wu to be her enemy, she found Feng Wu insufferable. However, now that her mindset had changed, she realized that she liked Feng Wu’s company.","She had never really hated Feng Wu. It was all because of her jealousy.","Feng Wu said, “Of course.”","Ye Han said, “In that case, our school is bound to lose.”","Feng Wu said, “Why do you say that?”","Ye Han said, “Everybody knows the Military Academy has two Spiritual Kings because they fought in the competition last year. They’re Sheng Changtian and Lu Haobei.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Ye Han said, “We received news today that another member of their team has become a Spiritual King. His name is Lu Qinghe.","“So, they already have three Spiritual Kings, but we have zero.”","Feng Wu said, “Chen Ziyun is a Spiritual King now.”","Ye Han was surprised. “Really?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Ye Han was happy for a brief moment before her shoulders slumped. “One Spiritual King won’t make any difference.”","Feng Wu smiled at her. “I’m a Spiritual King, too.”","Ye Han rolled her eyes at Feng Wu and wouldn’t believe her.","She became quite impatient."]},{"number":2818,"title":"Chapter 2818 - Sweet Revenge","paragraphs":["“The competition took place in the Military Academy last year, and it’s our turn this year, but I’m going to take leave and stay at home.”","Feng Wu asked, “Aren’t you going to watch?”","Ye Han shook her head. “We’re going to lose miserably. Why would I want to watch?”","Feng Wu said, “Why do you think we’re going to lose?”","“Who’s going to lose?”","Chaoge and Zi Ling came back at that moment.","Ye Han said grumpily, “Feng Wu says our team is going to win the competition this year.”","Chaoge and Zi Ling quickly ran into the room.","Zi Ling was pleasantly surprised. “Feng Wu, are we really going to win this year?”","Chaoge was very confident. “With Feng Wu around, there’s no way we’ll lose!”","The entire school knew Feng Wu had joined the seeded team.","Ye Han rolled her eyes at Feng Wu. “They have at least three Spiritual Kings, alright?”","Zi Ling covered her mouth. “At least three? What about...”","“We have one, at most,” Ye Han said without hesitation.","Zi Ling said, “That’s why so many people went to see their tutors and asked to go back home for a few days. They can’t face the defeat.”","Being a newer student, Zi Ling didn’t react as strongly as Ye Han, who had been here longer.","Ye Han said, “I’m leaving, too.”","Chaoge said, “I know Feng Wu is going to win!”","Feng Wu patted her. Chaoge was right. She was going to win.","Ye Han glanced at her in resignation. “Do you know why the seeded team is one man down and has to recruit Feng Wu? Do you know why that person is absent?","“His name is You Ming. In the competition last year, Lu Haobei severely injured him, and he’s still bedridden now.","“Lu Haobei is only the second-best fighter in their team. Sheng Changtian, their captain, is the most capable one!","“Chen Ziyun was defeated in three stances.","“That team completely crushed us last year, and it was a great humiliation.","“I heard they found a secret cultivation place this year and made great progress. How are we going to defeat them?”","Ye Han turned to Feng Wu. “I’ve told you everything you need to know. Listen to my advice. It’ll be humiliating, but you won’t be bedridden for a year.”","Feng Wu said, “Are you saying we should admit our defeat without trying?”","Ye Han said, “Do you think I like the Military Team? Do you know how arrogant they are?","“When they left last year, Sheng Changtian cut down the flag of Imperial College!","“It was the greatest humiliation!","“Who doesn’t want sweet revenge?","“But we can’t...","“We’re so much weaker than them. How are we supposed to win?”","Feng Wu had always thought Ye Han to be a snobbish person. However, the girl shook with indignation when she mentioned the flag.","She was angry at her school.","Although she might criticize the school herself, she wouldn’t let other people criticize or humiliate it."]},{"number":2819,"title":"Chapter 2819 - Sequence","paragraphs":["Ye Han stared at Feng Wu. “You can only imagine how much our students want to win this competition.","“The more they want it, the more scared they are!","“I do hope you can help our school to win, but you’re only a member of the second team.","“Do you know what that means? It means you’ll be sitting on the bench!","“You won’t get to fight in the actual competition.","“You’ll only be playing in the warmup match!","“Don’t be naive!","“Yes, you’re lucky, talented, and have been making insane progress, but this is a battle beyond your level! You’re not qualified to fight it!”","Ye Han was so agitated that she shouted the first words that came to her mind.","Chaoge lost her temper and stared at Ye Han. “Shut up!”","Feng Wu waved at Chaoge.","She turned to Ye Han and told her in a serious tone, “I’ll lead the Dynasty team and win our honor back. Trust me!”","Ye Han looked into her eyes.","What a pair of eyes!","They looked like bottomless pits, but they also made one feel very reassured, as if everything she said would become true.","For an instant, she really believed Feng Wu.","She then shook her head, thinking she must be crazy. How could Feng Wu, the weakest member of the team, lead the team to victory?","“I...” Ye Han hesitated. “Alright. I’ll stay as a cheerleader.”","Feng Wu smiled. “I think you’ll have to set up a team first.”","Other people probably thought the same as Ye Han and wouldn’t want to watch the competition.","Ye Han asked, “You know the game’s rules, don’t you?”","Feng Wu said, “No, I don’t.”","Ye Han wanted to smack her in the head.","How could she not know something so important?","Where did she get the confidence that she could help the team to win?","She couldn’t understand why she believed Feng Wu.","Ye Han pinched her nose. “Both sides have the main team and the backup team. In the competition, they’ll also fight their respective counterparts.","“The main teams will determine which side wins, but the backups won’t be sitting idly on the benches either.","“They’ll fight first. The winning team will decide the order of each main team’s members in the subsequent round.”","Feng Wu was surprised. “Is that so?”","Ye Han said, “Yes! That is to say, if your backup team loses, the other team will determine their own order as well as the order of Ziyun’s team. If they ask Chen Ziyun to fight first, then...","“We’ll lose miserably!","“Sheng Changtian is very likely to be their first player.","“If he defeats all five of our people, it’ll be a great humiliation for our school.","“If your team wins and gets to decide their order, you can have their weakest member play first. That way, even if we lose, we’ll defeat some of them first. It won’t be as humiliating...”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Did all the students in Imperial College think they were going to lose?"]},{"number":2820,"title":"Chapter 2820 - Give Away Your Spot","paragraphs":["Feng Wu thought Ye Han only felt that way because she wasn’t experienced enough.","However, when she met Gongsun Mu and talked to him about the competition, the old man didn’t want to talk about it and only told her to stay safe.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Did even Gongsun Mu think they were going to lose?","Feng Wu arrived at the training arena.","It was at the center of Imperial College.","The spiritual essence was the densest here.","She heard people talking before she went in.","“How about we focus all our strength on the backup team this time?”","It was Chu Qu.","Apart from Chen Ziyun, all the team members were there.","The competition was the most discussed subject at the moment.","The team members were talking about it as well.","Qiu Zeyu said, “We should put our best members in the backup team. That way, we’ll get to decide the order. Right?","“After that, we can arrange them in the order we like. We won’t lose as miserably as last year.","“Last year was so humiliating! Sheng Changtian defeated all five of us! It was a nightmare!”","Chu Qu said, “Put the best members in the backup team? Are you going to put Captain Chen and Sun Yu there? The Military Team will laugh at us! It won’t be any less humiliating!”","He was right.","Although the rules didn’t forbid the main players to fight in the backup team, it was common knowledge that they shouldn’t do it.","Wang Nian grew anxious. “You’ve turned down all our suggestions, so what should we do? Since when has Imperial College become so weak? This is so frustrating!”","Everybody felt the same way.","Before, Imperial College could always easily win the competition, but things had changed in the past two years.","Imperial College had never been humiliated like this before.","Everybody was as frustrated as Wang Nian was.","Feng Wu walked in at that moment.","She asked in a curious voice that everybody could hear, “I don’t understand. Why are you all focusing on how to lose less miserably?”","The others turned around and saw it was Feng Wu.","They all gave the newest member sympathetic looks.","“You’re new here, so you don’t know,” said Qiu Zeyu. “We don’t stand a chance. Knowing that, our only option is to lose gracefully.”","He then turned to the others. “Sun Yu alone won’t be enough. How about we let Ziyun join the backup team as well?","Chen Ziyun was the captain of the Dynasty Team, and Qiu Zeyu’s suggestion would be a great humiliation for him.","No one could bring themselves to talk to Chen Ziyun about it.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes again.","“As for us, I can withdraw from the competition. Feng Wu, you’re new and won’t be of much use. You should withdraw as well and give your place to Ziyun.”","Feng Wu felt like hitting someone."]},{"number":2821,"title":"Chapter 2821 - Associate Dean Chu Yun","paragraphs":["Feng Wu couldn’t stand all the ridiculous suggestions.","She was about to speak, when she heard some footsteps.","“Why is everybody here? What are you doing?” Chen Ziyun leaned on the doorframe with his arms crossed and looked curiously at his team members.","The boys looked at one another and didn’t dare bring up their suggestions to Chen Ziyun.","They didn’t know where to begin.","Everybody glanced at Qiu Zeyu.","After all, he was the captain of the backup team and had been the first to bring up the subject. He should be the one to break the news.","Qiu Zeyu was speechless.","However, he was confident in his suggestions because he thought he was helping the school.","He looked at Chen Ziyun and said solemnly, “Ziyun, we want to make a request.”","Chen Ziyun glanced at him from where he was leaning on the doorframe.","Qiu Zeyu said, “Ziyun, you should join the backup team. That’s the only way we can make sure we’ll win the first competition. That way, we won’t lose so miserably in the final game!”","“Screw you!” Chen Ziyun was furious.","Qiu Zeyu was dumbfounded. He was only suggesting it because he wanted to help the team.","“We have Feng Wu. I’m sure we’ll win!” Chen Ziyun was very confident.","After all, Feng Wu had some great treasure!","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Chen Ziyun.","Yes, she had the spirit wine. However, she had sent most of it back home as soon as she returned to the academy.","She only had less than a third left.","How could Feng Wu help them?","Everybody looked at Chen Ziyun in resignation.","Feng Wu was a talented fighter and might be a little bit stronger than Qiu Zeyu, but she couldn’t be as good as anybody on the main team.","The five members of the main team were Chen Ziyun, Sun Yu, Wang Xiao, Wang Nian and Li Shaochu. The backup team thought they were all Level 9 Spiritual Lords.","However, their captain had just announced his confidence in the girl.","Just then, someone called outside.","“The Military Academy’s people are here!” The messenger was Huo Shan, Chen Ziyun’s cousin.","That was fast.","Everybody frowned at Huo Shan.","“I thought they weren’t coming until three days later.” Chen Ziyun frowned. “Who are they?”","“Both teams and the tutor in charge. This year, the tutor is...”","Huo Shan paused before saying, “It’s Associate Dean Chu Yun.”","Chu Yun? The others opened their mouths but didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu glanced at them.","What was with those looks on their faces?","Who was Chu Yun?","Chen Ziyun frowned. “Since they’re there, let’s get the battle started. To the arena!”","The team members followed Chen Ziyun with conflicted feelings.","It was Associate Dean Chu Yun. She had only been a tutor when she was in Imperial College.","Feng Wu asked curiously, “Who’s that?”","Chen Ziyun didn’t answer, and Sun Yu said, “She used to be Mr. Gongsun Mu’s wife. Then... Anyway, don’t act weirdly when we see Gongsun Mu later.”","Feng Wu thought, “I don’t know how to act weirdly.”"]},{"number":2822,"title":"Chapter 2822 - Motivation","paragraphs":["Seeing how confused Feng Wu was, Sun Yu had to explain to her.","“Ms. Chu Yun used to be our tutor and Mr. Gongsun Mu’s wife. She then divorced Mr. Gongsun and married the head of the Military Academy within a month.”","Wang Xiao’s face darkened. “Everybody knows Ms. Chu Yun and the head had an affair before she dumped Mr. Gongsun.”","Wang Nian said, “That happened last year. Our team lost, our flag was cut down, and Ms. Chu Yun is a humiliation to both Mr. Gongsun Mu and our school!”","Li Shaochu said, “I thought she would at least have the decency to stop showing up here. However, she’s actually the tutor in charge this time. She’s crossed the line!”","Sun Yu said, “If we lose again...”","Everybody was frustrated.","They wanted to tear something apart.","They were already in a bad mood, and the news only made them feel worse. They felt like they were burning inside when they reached the arena.","Many students received the news as well.","Everybody was equally frustrated.","Some people went into the forest at the back of the school and vented their anger on the magical beasts.","Other people went to the cultivation rooms to avoid the embarrassing scene.","Most students followed the Dynasty Team to the arena.","When Chen Ziyun and his team arrived, Gongsun Mu was confronting Chu Yun.","Chu Yun was unbelievably arrogant.","Gongsun Mu said, “The competition won’t start for another three days. You’re early.”","Chu Yun sneered at him. “We’re only free today. After that, we won’t be here anymore. We have to compete today!”","Gongsun Mu was angry. “This isn’t a small matter! You can’t change the date as you like!”","Chu Yun said, “What can possibly change in three days? Are you going to have more Spiritual Kings?”","Her students laughed when they heard this.","Gongsun Mu was furious.","Chu Yun sneered at him again. “You’re always like this: Too careful and too stubborn. Don’t make me look down on you more than I already do!”","Gongsun Mu’s face went livid.","Chu Yun changed her tone and said indifferently, “We all know what your team is like. Just bring them here and get it over with. We’re in a hurry to get to Peace Grassland!”","Gongsun Mu couldn’t stand the humiliation to Imperial College.","Chu Yun waved her hand and said matter-of-factly, “You’re going to lose, anyway. What difference do three more days make? You can’t win.”","Chen Ziyun and his teammates clenched their fists and went scarlet red.","Gongsun Mu was so furious that he was shaking.","Feng Wu glanced at Chu Yun.","What an arrogant woman!","She cheated on Gongsun Mu with the head of the Military Academy, but she sounded like she hadn’t done anything wrong. The humiliation she gave Gongsun Mu and Imperial College was unbelievable.","She also understood that Chu Yun had done it on purpose."]},{"number":2823,"title":"Chapter 2823 - Start Now","paragraphs":["She was deliberately trying to enrage Imperial College.","It seemed she was serious about moving up the date of the competition.","Why were they so eager to go to Peace Grassland? Had something happened?","If that was the case, Imperial College should have heard about it as well. Therefore, a great opportunity must be waiting for the Military Academy in the grassland.","Feng Wu seemed unperturbed, but she made a mental note of it.","“So be it! We’ll have the competition today! You don’t scare us!”","Someone spoke on behalf of the Dynasty Team.","Feng Wu turned around and saw it was Wang Xiao.","He was indeed an impulsive teenager.","“Wang Xiao, it’s you. Long time no see.” A person walked out of the Military Team and smiled at Wang Xiao.","Wang Xiao’s face went livid.","“He’s Lu Haobei. He gave us hell last year,” Chu Qu whispered in Feng Wu’s ear.","When Feng Wu looked up, Wang Xiao and Lu Haobei were shouting at each other.","The Military Team was arrogant and bossy.","The Dynasty Team was frustrated and eager for revenge.","Moreover, many of their classmates were watching.","The Dynasty Team became even angrier.","“Fine! Let’s do it today!”","After consulting the elders, Gongsun Mu agreed.","Everybody fell silent.","The winner this year would be determined earlier than usual.","Gongsun Mu stared at Chu Yun. “The junior teams will compete first, followed by the varsity teams. So we’ll need two days...”","Chu Yun cut him off with a wave of her hand. “Why two days? One competition will be enough. You can decide the order of our players.”","How arrogant!","Gongsun Mu and his colleagues all turned livid.","Gongsun Mu and Chu Yun used to be husband and wife, but she was treating him like this while everybody was watching.","Gongsun Mu forced himself to calm down. “The rule says two games, and we must follow the rules.”","“Whatever.” Chu Yun smirked. “You’re going to lose, anyway. If you want to lose twice in a row, so be it.”","She rolled her eyes as she spoke.","She used to be an arrogant tutor when she worked in Imperial College. However, she had never been so obvious about it.","She now looked like a scoundrel who had realized her ambition.","Gongsun Mu said, “The junior teams will compete today, and the varsity teams tomorrow.”","Chu Yun wouldn’t have it.","She said impatiently, “I told you already, my team is in a hurry to get to Peace Grassland, and we don’t have that kind of time. Let’s finish it today. All teams will compete today.”","She sounded so confident that the people of the Imperial College were infuriated.","“Sir, let’s do it!” somebody shouted.","Although everybody knew they weren’t the Military School’s match, they didn’t care about that now."]},{"number":2824,"title":"Chapter 2824 - What About Feng Wu?","paragraphs":["Sun Yu and the others all rushed to Gongsun Mu’s side indignantly and asked him to start the competition.","Gongsun Mu didn’t know what to say.","Because the junior team would compete first, Sheng Changtian patted Lan Xuefeng’s shoulder. “Good luck.”","The varsity team left after that.","Their competition was in the evening, and they weren’t worried about their junior team. They were going to use the time to walk around the campus.","That was how arrogant they were.","Lan Xuefeng nodded. Imperial College’s junior team was so weak that he could defeat it with his eyes closed.","Because Chu Yun was the tutor in charge of the teams, she had to stay here, although she knew her team would undoubtedly win this competition.","“The game will start soon,” said Gongsun Mu. “The team leaders should hand in the players’ names in five minutes.”","That was to prevent any team from changing players after the competition started.","The names had to be handed in beforehand.","Feng Wu hadn’t said anything.","She recognized two out of the five members of the other team. They had met before.","Some students had arrived to watch the competition.","Feng Wu saw Ye Han.","Shao Xiao, Wang Zhi, Ling Hao, Cheng Fang and many of her new friends were all here to cheer her on.","They were shaking with anger when they heard the humiliation from the other team. They wanted to run up to the stage and slap those people.","They cursed Chu Yun with everything they could think of.","Ling Hao said, “Look! Look! Aren’t the members of their junior team the five people we ran into in the Secret Essence Mine?”","Ye Han nodded. “That’s right! It’s them! They were surrounded by Spirit Stone Worms! Why aren’t they dead?!","“If they had died, they wouldn’t have come here to humiliate us like this! I don’t want to see them at all!”","They could criticize their own school, but they wouldn’t let any outsider say a bad word about it.","Feng Wu wanted to roll her eyes when she saw the five people.","The Military Academy wasn’t as impressive as it was said to be.","On the other side, Qiu Zeyu was putting down the names of the players.","Qiu Zeyu said, “Chu Qu, Li Zhan, Zhao Si, and I will play. Wang Xiao, would you like to join us? Without you, we’ll have a very difficult time.”","That was an understatement. They would have no hope of winning at all.","Wang Xiao hesitated.","He was a member of the varsity team. Fighting for the junior team was quite embarrassing.","Qiu Zeyu said, “Yes, it’s embarrassing. However, if all five of us are defeated, it’ll be even more humiliating!”","Wang Xiao said, “Alright, then.”","Qiu Zeyu said, “Great!”","He then started filling in the names.","“Wait.” Chen Ziyun found Qiu Zeyu’s decision rather foolish. “What about Feng Wu?”","Feng Wu herself wanted to ask the same question.","Qiu Zeyu said, “Well, Feng Wu is new.”","Chen Ziyun stared at him.","Qiu Zeyu said, “ Ahem... ?Well, she hasn’t completed her paperwork yet, so she’s not an official member. We won’t want the Military Academy to find out about it, do we?”"]},{"number":2825,"title":"Chapter 2825 - New Captain","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun took out a piece of paper and shook it in front of Qiu Zeyu.","It had been signed by Zuo Qingluan herself.","He had been gone for a while because he went to look for her to sign the form.","Zuo Qingluan must have deliberately hidden away because she had been very difficult to locate. In the end, Elder Wu gave Chen Ziyun a hand and made her sign it.","Chen Ziyun didn’t tell the others what he had gone through. He only stared at Qiu Zeyu.","Qiu Zeyu pretended to be pleasantly surprised. “What? Does she have all the paperwork now? So, she’s an official member!","“But...” Qiu Zeyu seemed troubled. “She’s only just joined us and hasn’t been trained. I don’t think she knows the rules. Won’t it be too risky to let her compete?”","He was looking for every excuse to stop Feng Wu.","He knew she was better than him because he hadn’t been able to fight back when she dragged him away.","Because of that, he didn’t want to give Feng Wu any more chances to show her talent.","Chen Ziyun saw through him and was full of disdain.","Was Qiu Zeyu trying to give them trouble now?","Now wasn’t the time for internal strife!","Qiu Zeyu didn’t know who Feng Wu’s patron was, which was why he dared to play such tricks.","Chen Ziyun glanced at Qiu Zeyu, and the look gave Qiu Zeyu the creeps.","What was going on?","“You’re no longer the captain of the junior team,” said Chen Ziyun.","WHAT?!","Qiu Zeyu stared at him in disbelief.","“Captain!” he shouted.","Chen Ziyun ignored him and turned to Feng Wu, “You’ll be the new captain.”","Feng Wu knew how critical the situation was, so she nodded. “No problem.”","Qiu Zeyu was furious and shouted, “I object!”","Chen Ziyun didn’t even look at him. “I wasn’t asking for your opinion.”","Qiu Zeyu was furious.","“Fine! So be it! Since no one wants my opinion, you don’t need me anymore! I quit! I’m leaving the junior team!”","After that, he ripped off his team uniform and threw it on the ground.","No one noticed them at first because they had been talking in low voices.","Now that Qiu Zeyu had raised his voice, everybody was looking at them.","Gongsun Mu and Chu Yun were both on the stage close by.","Gongsun Mu frowned at Chen Ziyun.","Chu Yun glanced at the team and chuckled. “What’s going on with Imperial College? Are you making changes now? The captain of your junior team has just been dismissed, and he’s leaving the team. Gongsun Mu, is that how you’ve been teaching your students? They’re so divided.”","Gongsun Mu felt as if he had been slapped.","Chen Ziyun was staring at Qiu Zeyu. “The competition is about to start. Are you sure you want to do this?”","Of course Qiu Zeyu knew that. He thought the team couldn’t do without him. They wouldn’t value him as much after the competition, and he wouldn’t be able to change Chen Ziyun’s mind then.","At that thought, Qiu Zeyu smirked. “If you remove me from my position, I’ll quit!”"]},{"number":2826,"title":"Chapter 2826 - Competition (1)","paragraphs":["Qiu Zeyu thought his threat would work because they didn’t have backup players. He thought Chen Ziyun would beg him to stay.","To his surprise, Feng Wu spoke first.","She said, “If you want to ruin your future, you’re welcome to do so. The door’s right there. You can leave now.”","Qiu Zeyu went scarlet in the face.","However, he didn’t have another choice after what he said earlier.","Qiu Zeyu glared at Chen Ziyun. “Fine! I hope you won’t regret your decision!”","He then marched toward the door.","“Ziyun...” Wang Xiao gave Chen Ziyun a pleading look.","But Chen Ziyun ignored him.","The others were looking at Chen Ziyun as well.","It was evident that Qiu Zeyu didn’t want Feng Wu to compete. However, they were one member short. What should they do?","Sun Yu said grumpily, “Doesn’t he know how important today is? There’s no time for his little tricks! We can do without him! We’ll borrow someone from the varsity team! So what if it’s a little embarrassing?”","Feng Wu shook her head. “That won’t be necessary.”","What?","The others all gave her strange looks.","Feng Wu was the reason this was happening in the first place.","If it had happened to another person, they would have been so flustered by now. Feng Wu, on the other hand, was as confident as ever.","“We’re short...” Sun Yu tried to persuade her.","Wang Xiao’s face darkened. “I’ll do it.”","Feng Wu repeated, “That won’t be necessary.”","Wang Xiao was so furious that he stared at Feng Wu. “I know you’re pretty, and people like you, but you’re crossing the line! It’s not the time to be so capricious!”","Qiu Zeyu and Wang Xiao were good friends, so Wang Xiao couldn’t help but take Qiu Zeyu’s side.","Feng Wu only glanced at him.","Wang Xiao thought Feng Wu was going to quarrel with him, but she didn’t.","Her bright eyes seemed to be able to see through everything. She looked at him as if he was an idiot.","She didn’t seem angry.","She seemed perplexed.","It was as if she didn’t understand why he was so angry.","Wang Xiao didn’t know what to say.","Gongsun Mu’s voice rang out at that moment. “You can hand in the names now.”","Qiu Zeyu had written down the names already.","So Feng Wu grabbed a pen, crossed out Qiu Zeyu’s name and added hers at the bottom.","That was it.","Gongsun Mu and Chu Yun received the name lists at the same time.","Gongsun Mu read it aloud first.","“The Dynasty Team players are Chu Qu, Li Zhan, Zhao Si and Feng Wu.”","Gongsun Mu gave Feng Wu a questioning look.","Chen Ziyun went up on stage and whispered something in his ear.","“Nonsense!” Gongsun Mu said angrily.","However, the seats were half-full, and the Military Academy was watching. Gongsun Mu would be embarrassing Chen Ziyun if he scolded the boy now.","He could only wait until later.","He gave Chen Ziyun a stern look, but Chen Ziyun grinned. “Don’t worry. Xiao Wu is very talented.”","Chen Ziyun left the stage after that, and Gongsun Mu’s face was livid."]},{"number":2827,"title":"Chapter 2827 - Competition (2)","paragraphs":["Next to Gongsun Mu was Chu Yun, and they had a complicated relationship.","“What’s going on? I heard...” Chu Yun said in a mocking tone.","Gongsun Mu ignored her and turned to look at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu nodded. “We can do it.”","What choice did Gongsun Mu have?”","He could only say, “Those will be our four players.”","WHAT?!","The students in the audience were astonished.","Not many had come to watch because they all thought their school was going to lose. Even so, 30% of the seats were filled.","All the Imperial College students stared at Gongsun Mu in bewilderment.","Wasn’t it a 5v5 competition?","Each side should have five players, and the team with the last member standing would win.","Imperial College was likely to lose.","If that was the case, why did they only have four players?","“What’s going on? Why is this happening?”","“Are we giving up?”","“We don’t have to be so proud!”","...","Everybody was displeased.","Someone said, “I saw Qiu Zeyu leave. He’s the captain of the junior team, isn’t he?”","“I heard Feng Wu made him leave because she’s the new captain, according to when the names were announced.”","“Feng Wu? Who’s she?”","“She’s the new student who’s been making all that insane progress!”","“No matter how capable she is, she’s still a new student! Why is she qualified to be a team member or participate in the competition? What makes her qualified to be the captain? I can’t believe it!”","“That’s right! This is so important! If Feng Wu didn’t do something, Qiu Zeyu would never have left!”","...","Many people started condemning Feng Wu.","A person next to Ye Han was saying similar things, and Ye Han jumped to her feet in frustration.","“What are you talking about?! Feng Wu is so talented! Of course she’s qualified to be a team member!”","The girl next to her was frightened by her reaction.","The girl was from Class B and knew her classmates didn’t like Feng Wu. Almost the entire class was against Feng Wu.","Disliking Feng Wu became politically correct.","That was why she blurted out those words.","To her surprise, Ye Han had switched sides.","She remembered Ye Han as one of the people who had hated Feng Wu.","“Why are you...” The girl was scared of Ye Han.","Ye Han said aggressively, “Feng Wu is amazing! Just wait and see. You’ll be convinced!”","The girl cringed a little, rose to her feet and went to sit somewhere further away from Ye Han.","She wondered how Feng Wu was going to convince her.","There were many students here, and most of them had heard of Feng Wu’s name before or had even had dealings with her.","That was especially the case with Class E students.","They had spent the most time with Feng Wu because she started her days in the academy as a Class E student.","Sun Jingyu, Mu Qianqian, Pei Si and many others had seen how talented she was.","At first, there were the anti-fans, the fans, and the neutral party. However, almost all of them turned into Feng Wu’s fans in the end."]},{"number":2828,"title":"Chapter 2828 - Competition (3)","paragraphs":["Hearing that Feng Wu was going to be in the competition, all her fans showed up.","That was why a third of the seats were occupied. Without the fans, there would be very few audience members.","They all tried to explain to the others how amazing Feng Wu was.","However, Feng Wu had skipped Classes C and D, so most students didn’t know her well. They didn’t understand why Class E thought so highly of her.","How good could she be?","If she got along well with the Class E students, she couldn’t be all that capable.","Otherwise, she would be so proud and would never socialize with Class E.","They decided that Feng Wu had taken away Qiu Zeyu’s role in a critical moment like this to buy herself popularity, which only showed how much of a schemer she was.","The other students found such a girl terrifying.","Hence, they disliked Feng Wu even more.","The Class E students were frustrated but didn’t know what to do.","They tried to explain how excellent Feng Wu was, but they couldn’t give any detailed descriptions of her capability because it was beyond their knowledge.","Would Feng Wu win? They couldn’t say for sure either.","Ye Han wasn’t sure either, but it didn’t stop her from singing Feng Wu’s praises.","After Imperial College announced their players, Chu Yun announced theirs as well.","The Military Academy’s players were Lian Xiao, Lou Mo, Ma Hao, Wang Ze and their captain, Lan Xuefeng.","Chu Yun played a little trick.","Seeing that Imperial College announced its captain last, she also announced Lan Xuefeng’s name.","Gongsun Mu gave her a knowing look.","Chu Yun said confidently, “I’m leaving in fifteen minutes.”","Gongsun Mu snorted. “You can’t leave during the competition.”","Chu Yun smiled. “It’ll be over by then.”","Gongsun Mu’s face turned livid.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She almost felt sorry for Gongsun Mu.","Chu Yun was so arrogant that Feng Wu wanted to see the woman be humiliated.","Chu Yun happened to glance at Feng Wu at that moment, and she sneered at the girl.","That woman!","Feng Wu snorted. She extended her right arm and raised her thumb at Chu Yun.","Chu Yun smiled, thinking the girl was going to surrender.","However, the smile immediately froze on her face.","Feng Wu had turned her hand and aimed her thumb at the ground.","Was that a provocation? Chu Yun glared at Feng Wu.","Chu Yun was a fierce woman. Almost all her students in Imperial College and the Military Academy were scared of her. No one had disrespected her like this before.","She made a mental note of Feng Wu’s name.","Chu Qu was walking up to the stage.","Chu Yun glanced at Lian Xiao and suddenly asked, “Can you defeat all four of them?”","Lian Xiao had made some great progress and was very confident in himself.","He was excited to be the first player. “I’ll try!”","“You’ll try?” Chu Yun frowned."]},{"number":2829,"title":"Chapter 2829 - Competition (4)","paragraphs":["“Yes! Of course!” Lian Xiao immediately changed his answer. “I’ll defeat all four of them!”","Chu Yun was glad to hear the answer and patted him on the shoulder. “Go ahead.”","“Yes!” Lian Xiao clenched his fists in excitement.","If he could defeat all four opponents, Chu Yun would give him special treatment in Peace Grassland, and his progress would be even faster!","The Military Academy was used to looking down on Imperial College.","Lian Xiao didn’t even try to lower his voice. He shouted out his answer.","All the audience and the Dynasty Team wanted to slap him.","One against four?","He had to be dreaming!","Chu Qu was so furious he was speechless.","That was such a humiliation!","Lian Xiao went up on the stage, and Chu Qu made his move before Lian Xiao could stand still.","It was the first battle, and everybody held their breaths and watched with full attention.","Feeling indignant, Chu Qu spared no effort and made some very aggressive moves.","Although Lian Xiao was playing on the away team, he was much more capable than Chu Qu and could easily avoid his attacks.","He started winning after three stances.","Feng Wu shook her head. “Chu Qu is going to lose.”","Wang Xiao smirked. “Nonsense. Chu Qu hasn’t shown his full strength yet. He...”","However, Lian Xiao kicked Chu Qu in the stomach before Wang Xiao could finish, and Chu Qu stumbled back.","Lian Xiao took the opportunity to kick Chu Qu several times in a row.","Chu Qu’s face went scarlet.","He didn’t want to lose.","However, he had reached the edge of the arena.","No matter how reluctant he was, he was still kicked out of the arena and fell to the ground.","“No!”","With blood on his lips, Chu Qu was so angry that he wished he could fight again.","However, the kicks he received had severely injured his abdomen. He could barely stand, let alone fight.","Zhao Si rushed to his side and helped him walk back to their team.","The audience was dead silent.","It happened so fast.","They had thought that even if Chu Qu lost, he could at least injure his opponent.","However, Chu Qu was badly injured, but his opponent was unscratched.","Lian Xiao said arrogantly, “Who’s next?”","Li Zhan gritted his teeth. “I am!”","He went up on the stage.","He wasn’t any better than Chu Qu.","However, he was more careful than Chu Qu and managed to stay in the game a little longer.","But it didn’t make much of a difference.","In the end, he was kicked off the stage, just like Chu Qu.","The other students thought their hearts had stopped beating.","That was crazy!","How could that happen?!","Li Zhan had lost so fast!","The junior team only had four players, and two had lost. The competition hadn’t started for more than two minutes!","OMG!","Everybody was so frustrated that they wanted to leave.","It was terrible to watch their own team getting butchered at home.","Wang Xiao was equally displeased.","“Li Zhan injured Lian Xiao, but it was only a minor injury. Lian Xiao may win the next round, too!”","Nobody spoke.","They all knew Wang Xiao was right."]},{"number":2830,"title":"Chapter 2830 - Competition (5)","paragraphs":["“Why is Lian Xiao so capable? Is he really going to defeat all our four?” Sun Yu was furious.","If the names hadn’t been announced, he would be going on the stage now.","Wang Xiao smirked. “That may actually happen! We’ve never been humiliated like this before!”","He then gave Feng Wu a dirty look. “If Qiu Zeyu hadn’t been chased away, this would never have happened!”","By then, no one believed they had a chance to win.","All they hoped for was not to lose too miserably.","Feng Wu glanced at Wang Xiao. “Are you referring to me?”","Wang Xiao snorted. “You know what I mean!”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yes. I know myself very well.”","Wang Xiao turned around in frustration and wouldn’t speak to her.","“I’ll go next!” Zhao Si said solemnly. “I’ll defeat Lian Xiao even if it costs me my life!”","Wang Xiao nodded.","Feng Wu frowned. “No one’s going to die. Just do your best. I haven’t competed yet.”","However, her teammates didn’t trust her.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","He had been leaning on a column with his arms crossed the whole time.","He knew how capable Feng Wu was.","The junior team couldn’t possibly lose.","However, Wang Xiao and the other idiots...","Chen Ziyun deliberately remained silent. He wanted to see how surprised the others would be when they saw Feng Wu fight.","He snorted a little.","Wang Xiao looked back at Chen Ziyun, who was half-hidden in the shadows, and was disappointed. He believed Chen Ziyun was infatuated with Feng Wu’s pretty face.","By then, Zhao Si was already on the stage.","Lian Xiao rubbed his chest where Lian Xiao had injured him. It didn’t matter. It was only a minor injury.","Seeing Zhao Si, Lian Xiao raised his chin and glanced at him sideways. “Are you going to give up, or should I kick you off the stage?”","That was so arrogant!","Zhao Si and all the other Imperial College students were furious.","They wanted to kill Lian Xiao.","Zhao Si gritted his teeth. “You’re going off the stage this time!”","Lian Xiao said, “Really? Show me what you’ve got, then.”","He immediately charged at Zhao Si.","Feng Wu studied his stances.","He was indeed one of the best students of the Military Academy.","He had been doing well in the Secret Essence Mine, and his moves were even better now.","He exerted his full power with each stance.","His fists seemed to weigh ten thousand kilograms.","Thump, thump, thump!","Although his chest was injured, Lian Xiao’s punches got even fiercer.","Zhao Si couldn’t begin to describe the pressure and pain he was in, but he wouldn’t give in.","His legs were broken.","His wrists were broken.","He was kicked in the chest.","...","Zhao Si gritted his teeth and wouldn’t give in.","Lian Xiao dragged him to the edge of the stage, but he wrapped his arms around Lian Xiao’s legs and wouldn’t let go.","Lian Xiao felt a chill run down his spine.","The audience was so nervous that they didn’t dare breathe."]},{"number":2831,"title":"Chapter 2831 - Competition (6)","paragraphs":["Zhao Si grabbed Lian Xiao’s legs and wouldn’t let go.","Lian Xiao snapped his fingers, trying to loosen his grip and throw him off the stage.","It didn’t work.","Even with his fingers broken, Zhao Si still wouldn’t let go.","How incredible!","He was so stubborn!","Lian Xiao started punching him.","Zhao Si spat out mouthfuls of blood, but he still wouldn’t let go.","He only knew one thing.","He couldn’t lose!","He couldn’t let Lian Xiao defeat all four of them!","The audience had risen to their feet. They were astonished by Zhao Si’s persistence.","“Stop.” Feng Wu frowned. “Zhao Si, you’ve lost. Come off the stage.”","Lian Xiao was relieved.","His opponent was so stubborn that he didn’t know what to do.","Zhao Si glanced at Feng Wu and shook his head.","He wouldn’t give in.","He had a mission.","Feng Wu went up on the stage and whispered in Zhao Si’s ear. “Don’t worry. I’ll defeat all five of them. Trust me!”","Zhao Si saw the look in Feng Wu’s eyes and stopped resisting.","He was finally drained of energy.","Something snapped in his head.","He fell into Feng Wu’s arms and passed out.","Feng Wu handed him to Li Zhan, rose to her feet, and stared at Lian Xiao.","The audience was crestfallen.","They thought they were going to lose.","No matter how talented Feng Wu was, she had only just joined the team.","The other three were all her seniors. Even they had lost so miserably – what would happen to Feng Wu?","“Can she even withstand one blow?” somebody asked.","No one answered.","Deep down, they thought the same.","“Gongsun Mu, I thought your team would improve after a year. I see they’ve become even weaker!","“Lian Xiao is the weakest member in our team,” Chu Yun said in satisfaction. “He’s not even the best student on the junior team.","“If he defeats all four students, your school will lose all its reputation.","“How about you ask me nicely? Maybe I’ll show some mercy and let Lian Xiao spare one of your players.","“I was so unlucky when I was with you, but my luck turned around after I left you. Gongsun Mu, you’re such a loser.”","Chu Yun was so pleased.","If she had a tail, she would be wagging it now.","Feng Wu heard her, and she glanced at the woman.","Chu Yun met Feng Wu’s gaze, her expression harboring some malicious intentions.","“You’re quite a nice-looking girl. If you give up now, I’ll let you study at the Military Academy. How would you like that?” Chu Yun asked in a matter-of-fact tone, because she was so sure that Feng Wu would say yes.","She wasn’t usually like this, but she was so excited to defeat her old employer that she had forgotten herself.","She wanted to say whatever came to her mind."]},{"number":2832,"title":"Chapter 2832 - Competition (7)","paragraphs":["She smiled at Feng Wu and waited for a yes.","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Would she...","The students were so worried.","Feng Wu beamed at Chu Yun. “Screw you!”","Chu Yun felt as if she had just been slapped.","The smile froze on her face.","The audience was speechless.","So were Feng Wu’s teammates.","Gongsun Mu didn’t know what to say.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","She cursed!","The most beautiful girl had just smiled and used profanity. It was the most astonishing thing many people had ever seen.","Chen Ziyun couldn’t believe his ears.","He buried his face in his hands and thought, “Oh no, if the crown prince finds out what his girl said, will he kill me?”","Meanwhile, Lian Xiao was staring at Feng Wu.","He even forgot to blink.","“I’m Feng Wu, the captain of the junior team. Good luck.” Feng Wu was ready for battle.","However, Lian Xiao was still dumbfounded.","His mind had gone blank.","It was her!","How could she be the captain of the junior team?","He should have looked more closely at that team!","Lian Xiao wanted to slap himself.","How could he be so stupid?","How could he brag that he could defeat all four of them?","No...","“Are you a student?” Lian Xiao’s voice trembled.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Lian Xiao said, “And you’re the captain?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Chu Yun stared at Lian Xiao. “Kick her off the stage!”","She was furious at what Feng Wu had said to her.","However...","Lian Xiao bowed at Feng Wu and said, “I’m so sorry. I’ve lost.”","He turned to walk off the stage after that.","Chu Yun was utterly confused.","Apart from Feng Wu, everybody was equally confused.","They had no idea what was going on.","Everybody was asking questions.","“What happened?”","“Isn’t Lian Xiao very capable? He said he was going to defeat all four of our players! Why did he just admit defeat?”","“Is it because Feng Wu is so pretty?”","“What’s that supposed to mean? Are you saying Feng Wu only has a pretty face?”","Everybody was discussing it avidly, but they all looked cheerful because the other player had just admitted defeat.","Chu Yun was infuriated.","She grabbed Lian Xiao when he walked past her.","“What was that for?!” She glared at him.","Lian Xiao smiled bitterly. “I lost.”","“No, you didn’t!” Chu Yun bellowed. “You didn’t even fight her!”","Lian Xiao shook his head.","Of course he didn’t fight her. If he did, he would be dead.","“Go back there and fight her!” Chu Yun wanted to drag Lian Xiao back onto the stage.","Lian Xiao’s face went white.","“I can’t, Ms. Chu! I’m not her match!” Lian Xiao said anxiously."]},{"number":2833,"title":"Chapter 2833 - Competition (8)","paragraphs":["Chu Yun stared at Lian Xiao. “You’ve met her before.”","Lian Xiao nodded.","Chu Yun asked, “Did she defeat you?”","Lian Xiao said, “No, she saved us.”","He wanted to point out that Feng Wu had saved more than just him, but Chu Yun didn’t hear him.","She only asked, “Are you really not going to fight?”","Lian Xiao said, “No, not even if you kill me! I’m not her match.”","He still remembered Feng Wu’s red dress and flashing sword. She was so powerful that he had turned into her fan.","Since her team still had four more players, Chu Yun didn’t insist.","She cut Lian Xiao loose.","Lian Xiao immediately ran back to his seat.","“Lou Mo, it’s your turn,” said Chu Yun.","Lou Mo didn’t want to fight.","He had spotted Feng Wu before Lian Xiao did.","He was dumbfounded when he saw her face.","What the heck?!","Wasn’t their savior’s name Zuo Qingluan?","As it turned out, their savior was Feng Wu and the captain of the junior team!","Lou Mo wanted to cry.","Even if she weren’t their savior, he still wouldn’t fight her. He remembered the way Feng Wu killed countless Spirit Stone Worms with a single strike.","“Lou Mo!” Chu Yun stared at Lou Mo and urged him.","Lou Mo looked at his teammates.","Ma Hao, his best friend, seemed to be studying the pattern on the back of the chair.","No one wanted to get into trouble.","“Lou Mo!” Chu Yun was furious.","She thought, “What’s going on? Are they like this because that girl is too pretty?”","Seeing that Chu Yun wanted to drag him onto the stage, Lou Mo had no choice but to enter the arena.","He walked as slowly as he could.","Chu Yun grabbed his shoulder when he walked past her. “Defeat her!”","Lou Mo didn’t know what to say. It was an impossible task!","He gave Chu Yun an indescribable look.","He rushed to Feng Wu’s side before Chu Yun could react.","Lou Mo did the same thing as Lian Xiao.","He bowed at Feng Wu. “I give up, my savior.”","After that, he ran back to his seat.","He even ran off the stage from Imperial College’s side because he didn’t want to get scolded by Chu Yun.","Chu Yun wanted to kill him.","He had given up!","Another one!","She didn’t know what the boys were thinking.","Meanwhile, the audience was equally dumbfounded.","“What’s that about?”","“Am I blind, or has the Military Academy gone mad? Two of them gave up without fighting.”","“Is her pretty face so useful?”","They were so confused.","Members of the Dynasty Team were also perplexed.","What the heck?!","Wang Xiao was almost too surprised to speak. “How did she do that?!”","Li Zhan said, “Our opponents are very powerful.”","Sun Yu said, “Did he just call Feng Wu his savior?”","“Is that it? Feng Wu helped them before, so they don’t want to fight her.”"]},{"number":2834,"title":"Chapter 2834 - Competition (9)","paragraphs":["Li Zhan said, “This is great! They’re two men down, and we won’t lose so miserably.”","Chen Ziyun shook his head. “Can’t you be a little more ambitious?”","Wang Xiao looked at his captain. “For example?”","Chen Ziyun said, “For example, why can’t we win this battle?”","Wang Xiao didn’t know what to say.","“Captain Chen, please wake up!” Wang Xiao pointed at the stage with a trembling finger. “Can’t you see what’s going on?","“They’re doing us a favor!","“They called Feng Wu their savior, which means she helped them before.","“Because of that, they want to return the favor and don’t want to embarrass Feng Wu. That’s why they gave up!","“Do you think they’ll keep doing that? Do you think they’ll keep letting her win?","“Even if they want to, the other team members won’t let them!","“She couldn’t have helped all five of them!","“Just wait and see! She’ll be crying in a moment! They’re going to kick her off the stage!”","Wang Xiao was very certain.","However, Ma Hao, the third player, disappointed Wang Xiao.","“My savior, I give up.” Ma Hao bowed to Feng Wu and ran off.","Chu Yun was speechless.","Wang Xiao didn’t know what to say.","The rest of the crowd was equally silent.","The fourth was Wang Ze.","He replicated what his teammates did and happily ran off the stage.","He seemed so relieved.","To say everybody was astonished was an understatement.","Four players!","Four players had thanked Feng Wu, and Lan Xuefeng, their captain, was the only player left.","Dynasty Team looked at Lan Xuefeng expectantly.","They thought he would do the same.","Chu Yun was furious.","She had thought her team would win.","She never thought they would lose!","However, things had turned out quite the opposite.","It was awful!","Chu Yun looked at the girl on the stage.","Feng Wu stood there in an indifferent manner, as if she deserved those players’ thanks. Chu Yun couldn’t believe it!","She turned around and stared at Lan Xuefeng. “If you give up, I’ll make your life a living hell!”","Lan Xuefeng smiled bitterly.","He only had two choices.","He could let Feng Wu kill him.","Or Chu Yun would do it.","Lan Xuefeng took a deep breath and walked onto the stage.","“He’s here!”","The audience was so nervous, especially Ye Han, Sun Jingyu and the other students who knew Feng Wu well.","“I heard Lan Xuefeng is quite capable! He’s good enough to go to the varsity team, but he didn’t!”","“Do you think he’ll give up like the others?”","“I hope so!”","They all hoped Lan Xuefeng would admit his defeat without fighting.","However...","They were taken by surprise.","Lan Xuefeng walked up to Feng Wu and smiled bitterly. “My savior, it’s nice to see you again.”"]},{"number":2835,"title":"Chapter 2835 - Competition (10)","paragraphs":["His savior...","“Did you hear that? He called her his savior!” Ye Han almost jumped to her feet.","The last four players who had called Feng Wu that had all given up.","Everybody stared at Lan Xuefeng with twinkling eyes.","Feng Wu nodded with an expressionless face.","Lan Xuefeng shook his head. “I’m sorry about this. Ladies first.”","What?","The audience let out surprised cries.","Feng Wu was doomed...","He didn’t give up!","Why did he want to fight her?","Why wasn’t he admitting defeat?","“What did I tell you? They did that on purpose!” Wang Xiao smirked. “The other four players gave up first to return the favor, then their captain will defeat Feng Wu!","“You celebrated too early! We all knew how this would end!”","Nobody could respond.","They all thought Lan Xuefeng was much better than Feng Wu.","Chen Ziyun was the only one who knew the truth, but he wouldn’t say anything.","“Even if Feng Wu loses, it’s still much better than before, isn’t it?” Sun Yu snapped. “They could have defeated all four of us with one player! Feng Wu eliminated four players, right?”","He was right, but the team members still wished they could win.","They didn’t dare watch the battle.","Because...","They didn’t want to see their team lose.","Right at that moment!","Thump!","There was a loud noise.","Something heavy landed on the ground.","It was a person!","“Lan Xuefeng has crossed the line! Feng Wu is a girl and his savior! How could he fling her away like that?!”","Everybody looked up to see how badly Feng Wu had been injured.","What they saw were the astonished looks on the faces of Chu Yun, Gongsun Mu, and everybody else.","...","Feng Wu was still on the stage!","Her clothes were as neat as ever, and there wasn’t a scratch on her!","Who fell off the stage?","Everybody looked in that direction.","Somebody was lying on the ground.","They saw his face.","“Lan Xuefeng?”","“Captain Lan Xuefeng?”","“He was thrown off the stage!”","“It wasn’t Feng Wu!”","“What’s going on? Am I seeing things?”","“No, you saw correctly. Feng Wu kicked Lan Xuefeng, and he flew off the stage before falling on the ground.”","...","Everybody fell silent.","They were trying to digest the information.","Chu Yun jumped to her feet. “That’s not fair! She’s cheating!”","She charged at Feng Wu and tried to grab her.","Feng Wu smirked.","If this woman wanted a battle, she would give her one!","However, somebody blocked Chu Yun’s way before Feng Wu could make a move.","Gongsun Mu shielded Feng Wu behind him and blocked Chu Yun’s attack.","Thump! Thump! Thump!"]},{"number":2836,"title":"Chapter 2836 - Competition (11)","paragraphs":["“Stop!” A voice stopped the fighting.","“If you’re so desperate to fight, why don’t you go to Peace Grassland?!”","Elder Wu suddenly showed up and scolded Gongsun Mu and Chu Yun.","Gongsun Mu backed off silently.","Chu Yun wouldn’t have it.","“The students used to be so decent when I was here! They’re cheating now!”","Elder Wu was displeased. He didn’t like this woman, who had cheated on her husband before abandoning him.","He asked, “Who cheated? How did they do it? What makes you think they cheated?”","The three questions rendered Chu Yun speechless.","She was certain Feng Wu had cheated.","Otherwise, why would her students let her win?","But how had Feng Wu cheated?","She couldn’t tell Elder Wu that Feng Wu had cheated by using her pretty face.","That would sound ridiculous.","Seeing that Chu Yun couldn’t give an answer, Elder Wu frowned. “If you don’t have any evidence, you’re slandering other people. Chu Yun, you’re still the same after so many years!”","Chu Yun flinched a little.","She couldn’t help but feel intimidated by Elder Wu. Back when she taught in Imperial College, Elder Wu had been her direct superior.","Elder Wu turned to Gongsun Mu. “Is the competition over?”","“Yes.” Gongsun Mu woke up from his reverie.","He was still perplexed by the result.","“Why haven’t you made the announcement?” Elder Wu rolled his eyes at Gongsun Mu.","“Yes! Right!” Gongsun Mu was reminded of what he needed to do.","He cleared his throat and announced, “Imperial College has won the junior team competition!”","The audience was perplexed for a few moments before they realized what they had heard.","“We won!”","“I can’t believe it! We won!”","“I thought that one player was going to defeat all four of ours, but we won the competition!”","“OMG!”","...","After the initial astonishment, the audience applauded.","Only one-third of the seats were occupied, but the clapping was louder than a full house.","The students were flushed with excitement.","Someone stood at the back.","It was Qiu Zeyu.","He never left.","He headed for the exit after falling out with his team.","He thought Feng Wu would give in, but she didn’t.","He thought Chen Ziyun would ask him to return, but Chen Ziyun didn’t.","He then hoped the other team members would say something, but that never happened either.","Qiu Zeyu hadn’t wanted to leave like that.","He doubled back before he had even gone a few hundred meters.","He stood behind all the seats and wanted to watch his team lose.","He wanted to see everybody blame Feng Wu.","He wanted to see Chen Ziyun regret his decision.","He had imagined how Feng Wu would beg him to come back, but reality slapped him in the face.","Weren’t all the students from the Military Academy supposed to be geniuses?","Why did this happen?","How could they be so weak?","How could they lose?","Qiu Zeyu was so angry he almost fainted."]},{"number":2837,"title":"Chapter 2837 - Competition (12)","paragraphs":["Nobody paid any attention to Qiu Zeyu. They were all looking at Feng Wu, their hero.","She was already stunning, and now, she had won a great honor for Imperial College. Her popularity among the students soared to a new height.","At the very least, all the spectators here were impressed.","After they left the arena, they all shared the exciting news with their friends.","At the same time...","Only a few people were left in the arena.","They were the team members from both schools.","There was also Chu Yun, Gongsun Mu and Elder Wu.","Chu Yun’s face was livid.","She glared at Feng Wu so hard that she wanted to poke holes in the girl.","Feng Wu wasn’t intimidated at all. She even smiled at Chu Yun.","Chu Yun felt like punching the wall.","She turned to Gongsun Mu. “Those were only the junior teams! The main competition will be tonight!”","Gongsun Mu nodded indifferently.","Chu Yun glared at her team. “Let’s go!”","Chu Yun had planned to stay on campus with the team, but given what had happened, she would rather stay in a tent than stay here.","She didn’t stop until they reached the mountain at the back of the school.","She glared at Lan Xuefeng. “Why did you let her win? You can tell me the real reason now!”","Lan Xuefeng clutched his chest and smiled bitterly. “I didn’t.”","“How dare you lie to me?!” Chu Yun wanted to slap him.","Lan Xuefeng closed his eyes and repeated, “I didn’t. She didn’t need such a favor either.”","Lian Xiao looked at Chu Yun. “Haven’t you realized how capable our fairy is?”","Their fairy?","Chu Yun was infuriated by the way Lian Xiao addressed the girl.","She scolded him. “What fairy? Use her proper name!”","Lian Xiao said, “Feng Wu didn’t just save our captain. She saved all of us.”","Lian Xiao nodded when he saw how shocked Chu Yun was. “We were surrounded by Spirit Stone Worms in the Secret Essence Mine, and they were going to kill us. Then the f... I mean, Feng Wu suddenly appeared, killed all the worms, and saved us.”","Chu Yun’s face darkened. Lan Xuefeng had mentioned that before.","“Didn’t you say it was Zuo Qingluan, the owner of the True Phoenix Blood, who saved you?” Chu Yun frowned.","Lian Xiao shook his head. “That was what we thought at first. After all, we were told there were no Spiritual Kings among the Imperial College students. So, when we heard Zuo Qingluan’s name, we thought she was our savior.","“We only knew it was Feng Wu when we saw her on the stage today,” Lian Xiao said in a tender tone.","She was his goddess!","Chu Yun didn’t like the look in Lian Xiao’s eyes when he said Feng Wu’s name.","She turned to Lan Xuefeng and wanted to tell Lan Xuefeng to discipline his teammate.","However...","She saw the same look on Lan Xuefeng’s face.","Chu Yun was astonished."]},{"number":2838,"title":"Chapter 2838 - Competition (13)","paragraphs":["When she looked at the other three team members, she saw the same looks on their faces.","“You... You...” Chu Yun was furious.","Although these five students weren’t the most capable in the Military Academy, they had great potential. She was so disappointed.","“Are you all in love with her?” Chu Yun’s face was livid.","They didn’t deny it.","Chu Yun bellowed, “How dare Feng Wu seduce my students? I’ll kill her!”","Lan Xuefeng and the other four boys grew anxious.","“You can’t do that!” Lan Xuefeng blocked Chu Yun’s way.","Chu Yun was even angrier. “If you all like her, she’ll create a wedge between you! None of you can have her!”","Lan Xuefeng smiled bitterly. “Why do you think we’re good enough for her?”","Chu Yun said, “What do you mean?”","Lian Xiao said, “She’s too good for us.”","Chu Yun said, “What?!”","The other three boys said, “We fancy her the way one would fancy a fairy. We only want to admire her from afar. We’ve never wanted more than that.”","Chu Yun was dumbfounded.","“What’s that supposed to mean? Admire her from afar? Who does she think she is?”","Lian Xiao looked into her eyes and said sternly, “Ms. Chu, there’s something I’ve been meaning to tell you, and it’s been bugging me and affecting my cultivation, so I’m going to say it.”","Chu Yun was perplexed.","Lian Xiao said, “I like her and consider her my goddess. That’s my own choice and my business. I don’t like it when other people tell me what to do.”","Chu Yun wanted to say something, when Lian Xiao added, “Especially when they say it’s for my own good.”","Chu Yun felt like she had been slapped.","After being humiliated by Feng Wu, she was humiliated once more, and by her own students!","Lan Xuefeng nodded. “She’s my goddess, and I won’t let anyone criticize her!”","The other three boys stared at Chu Yun and nodded solemnly as well.","Chu Yun was astonished.","She couldn’t understand what was happening.","If she had been born in Feng Wu’s previous life, she might have found these boys’ behavior familiar; fans would do anything to defend their idols.","She said hurriedly, “You’re still too young to understand! I’m only trying to help you!”","Lan Xuefeng and the others looked at one another, and all seemed bored.","Seeing that the boys wouldn’t talk to her, Chu Yun got even angrier. “No matter how much you like her, you shouldn’t have let her win! This is such an important competition!”","“Ms. Chu Yun!” Lan Xuefeng raised his voice. “I don’t know if you didn’t hear us or you’re pretending you didn’t. Let me say it again: We didn’t let her win! She didn’t need that!","“She’s very capable! She’s at least a Spiritual King!","“The five of us can’t defeat her together, let alone in a 1v1 battle!","“She didn’t attack us, and that was very kind of her. Do you understand now?”","Everybody fell silent after Lan Xuefeng gave that little speech."]},{"number":2839,"title":"Chapter 2839 - Competition (14)","paragraphs":["Chu Yun stood there, dumbfounded.","She had heard Lan Xuefeng earlier, but hadn’t wanted to accept the truth.","Now that Lan Xuefeng was forcing her to accept reality, she was furious.","“What’s going on?” someone interjected.","It was a familiar voice.","They turned around and saw that it was the varsity team.","Sheng Changtian’s face was livid.","Behind him were his four teammates.","They quickly walked over and stepped between Chu Yun and Lan Xuefeng.","Sheng Changtian looked from Chu Yun to Lan Xuefeng, and his face turned dark.","“What did you do?” His eyes were filled with fury.","Chu Yun snorted and didn’t answer.","Sheng Changtian turned to Lan Xuefeng. “Answer me! How did you lose a battle that we should have won?!”","The two teams had arrived together.","During the junior team competition, the varsity team went to walk around the campus, as if they were looking for something.","They thought their junior team was so much better than Imperial College’s, and would definitely win the competition.","However, they received the news when they were still walking around.","The Military Academy’s team had lost the competition.","What?!","Sheng Changtian couldn’t believe his ears, and had come back in a hurry.","“You really lost, then?” Sheng Changtian glared at Lan Xuefeng.","Lan Xuefeng found Sheng Changtian scarier than Chu Yun.","So, he nodded silently.","Sheng Changtian said, “Why did you lose?”","Lan Xuefeng said, “She’s better than me.”","Sheng Changtian frowned and stared at him.","Lan Xuefeng nodded. “Feng Wu is a Spiritual King.”","Sheng Changtian asked, “Who’s that?”","He had never heard of that name before.","He turned around and looked at his four teammates.","Lv Haobei, Lu Qinghe, Tang Mingjiang and Xun Jinyuan looked at one another before turning to Sheng Changtian and shaking their heads. They didn’t know who that was either.","Lan Xuefeng smiled bitterly.","If Feng Wu hadn’t saved them, they wouldn’t have noticed her either.","“She’s really good,” said Lan Xuefeng. “She may be even better than Captain Sheng.”","Lv Haobei laughed.","He glanced at Lan Xuefeng. “Have you forgotten which team you’re in? No wonder Ms. Chu is so angry.”","Lan Xuefeng didn’t know what to say. He had seen Feng Wu fight – anyone who did would know how terrifying her swordplay was.","“What technique does she use?” Sheng Changtian asked.","Lan Xuefeng still remembered the elegant way Feng Wu moved, and he blurted out, “She doesn’t have any technique. She only uses one stance from the beginning to the end.”","He was telling the truth, but the proud Sheng Changtian wouldn’t believe him.","“That’s enough. She’s just a Spiritual King, and you’re making her sound more than she actually is.” Sheng Changtian and the others thought Lan Xuefeng only said that because he wasn’t a Spiritual King himself and didn’t know what Spiritual Kings were like.","They thought he would find all Spiritual Kings unfathomably powerful."]},{"number":2840,"title":"Chapter 2840 - Competition (15)","paragraphs":["Sheng Changtian said to Chu Yun, “It’s just a battle between the junior teams. It’s no big deal. We can defeat them in the varsity team battle.”","Chu Yun thought the same and was relieved.","“Let’s get something to eat.”","While the group from the Military Academy calmed down, Imperial College was still feeling overjoyed.","In the arena.","“Feng Wu! Feng Wu! You’re amazing!”","Chu Qu ran around Feng Wu like a puppy.","He was so thrilled that he couldn’t stop smiling.","“Feng Wu, how can you be so amazing?","“They must have all been stunned by your beauty!”","Chu Qu almost couldn’t form a coherent sentence.","The other team members were more sensible than he was and knew it had nothing to do with Feng Wu’s beauty.","“Did you meet them before?” Sun Yu asked curiously.","Feng Wu nodded.","Sun Yu said, “They called you their savior. Did you help them?”","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Sun Yu asked, “When? Why don’t we know about it?”","Feng Wu said, “It was in the Secret Essence Mine.”","She then added, “They were surrounded by Spirit Stone Worms and were almost killed. I killed the worms for them and gave them a paper crane.”","“You really saved their lives!” Chu Qu stared at her in amazement. “Would they have died if you hadn’t helped them?”","Feng Wu said, “Yes, they would have.”","Chu Qu said, “Are you saying you can defeat all five of them?”","Feng Wu said matter-of-factly, “Yes, I can.”","She sounded very serious.","And the crowd was speechless.","It was only then that they realized how capable she was.","“What’s your level now?” Chu Qu asked tentatively.","“I’m a Spiritual King.” Feng Wu didn’t try to hide it.","“Ssss!”","Everyone sucked in their breaths.","A Spiritual King?","Feng Wu was a Spiritual King!","If that was the case, of course she could defeat Lan Xuefeng and his four teammates.","“OMG!”","“Feng Wu, are you even human?”","“How long has it been since you joined the academy? You’ve only just risen to Class B!”","“Didn’t you just join our team?”","“You’re already one of the two Spiritual Kings we have!”","“That is to say, you’re the second-best player on the team!”","Her teammates were shocked by this piece of information.","However, they were soon ecstatic!","Chu Qu couldn’t control his excitement, and said whatever was on his mind.","“Do you remember how Qiu Zeyu left us at a critical moment?”","The others had forgotten about Qiu Zeyu until Chu Qu brought him up.","What they didn’t know was that Qiu Zeyu was standing behind them in the doorway.","He was trying to figure out how to quietly sneak back in and beg Chen Ziyun to forgive him. However, he heard his name before he stepped into the room.","He didn’t know if he should walk in or leave, so he just stood there.","He wanted to know what his teammates thought of him.","Everybody was busy condemning him at that moment.","“Do you remember how Feng Wu suppressed Qiu Zeyu? That means Qiu Zeyu knows how capable Feng Wu is!” Sun Yu was the first to realize what had happened."]},{"number":2841,"title":"Chapter 2841 - Competition (16)","paragraphs":["Chu Qu said, “Yes! I remember that! I thought Qiu Zeyu didn’t want to fight a girl, but I realize now that he’s not generous like that! If he could, he would have hit Feng Wu back!”","Sun Yu said, “That’s right! That means Qiu Zeyu already knew then that Feng Wu is better than he is. However, he tried to stop Feng Wu from participating in the competition!”","Everybody tried to recall what happened.","Sun Yu was right!","Qiu Zeyu tried to use the incomplete registration form as an excuse, but Chen Ziyun exposed his little trick. Qiu Zeyu then tried to exclude Feng Wu by saying she didn’t know the rules. All in all, he hadn’t wanted Feng Wu in the competition.","Sun Yu ground his teeth. “Doesn’t he know what we’re facing? The Military Academy has been winning all this time. Does Qiu Zeyu have no idea how frustrated we’ve been?!”","Chu Qu said, “I’m sure he does.”","Sun Yu said, “If he does, why did he try to stop Feng Wu from fighting in the competition?”","Chu Qu asked, “Why?”","Sun Yu said, “Because he’s jealous! He knew if he let Feng Wu compete, she would demonstrate her power, and everybody would be amazed. As the captain, he would feel humiliated! He might even lose his position! That’s why he tried to stop Feng Wu!”","Qiu Zeyu broke into a cold sweat when he heard this.","How...","How could they have guessed it so correctly?","That was exactly what he had been thinking!","Hearing Sun Yu and Chu Qu’s conversation, Wang Xiao felt his cheeks burn. He didn’t dare look at Feng Wu.","Meanwhile, the other team members started criticizing Qiu Zeyu as well.","“How could Qiu Zeyu do that? Did he think he could suppress a genius like Feng Wu?”","“More importantly, doesn’t he know what we’re facing now? All he cares about is his personal gain! He isn’t a team player at all!”","“He even blackmailed us before the competition and forced us to fight five opponents with four players!”","“If we didn’t have Feng Wu, we would be crying our eyes out now!”","“Where’s Qiu Zeyu? I want to punch him in the face!”","...","Qiu Zeyu was speechless.","Wang Xiao, who had been on Qiu Zeyu’s side, was speechless as well.","He didn’t dare look in Feng Wu’s direction and wanted to stay unnoticed.","Qiu Zeyu took a step back and hid outside. He didn’t dare look up, fearing that the others would beat him if they caught him.","The subject soon changed after they were done criticizing Qiu Zeyu.","“Wait! We now have two Spiritual Kings on our team, right?” Sun Yu was thrilled. “Ziyun and Feng Wu are both Spiritual Kings!”","Everybody nodded.","Sun Yu said, “We were feeling so defeated before because they have three Spiritual Kings while we had zero, but we have two now!”","Everybody was reminded of the good news.","Yes! That was right!","Sun Yu’s eyes were twinkling. “Right? Right? We have two now! 2v3. I think we have a chance!”"]},{"number":2842,"title":"Chapter 2842 - Competition (17)","paragraphs":["“Holy crap! You’re getting me excited!” Wang Nian, a member of the varsity team, patted Sun Yu on the shoulder. “We may actually win!”","Everybody was excited.","Their original plan had been to give all they could to win the junior team competition.","Now that they had won, they became hopeful about the varsity team competition.","“Let’s think about it!” Sun Yu said excitedly. “We’ve defeated their junior team and won the right to determine the order of their players. How should we arrange them so that we can win the 2v3 competition?”","Everybody was lost in thought.","Feng Wu suddenly said, “Who told you it’s 2v3?”","Her question made everybody jump.","Chu Qu was terrified. “Feng Wu, you can’t back out now! You’re going to give us a heart attack!”","The others were as frightened as Chu Qu was.","They were so worried that she wouldn’t take part.","Feng Wu chuckled when she saw their behavior. “I didn’t mean that.”","Chu Qu asked, “Then why did you say it wouldn’t be 2v3? They have three Spiritual Kings!”","Feng Wu said, “I mean it’s 3v3.”","“What?” Everybody was shocked.","Sun Yu asked, “Is there a hidden Spiritual King among us? Who? Tell us!”","Feng Wu grinned at him. “It’s you.”","Sun Yu was speechless.","Feng Wu only smiled.","Sun Yu rolled his eyes at her. “Xiao Wu, please don’t make fun of me. I’d love to be a Spiritual King, but I’m not!","“Do you know how hard Ziyun worked to become one? Do you know how long it took?","“He gave everything he got.","“It still took him three years to become a Spiritual King!","“As for me?”","Sun Yu pointed at himself and smiled bitterly. “It’ll take me at least three more years to become a Spiritual King if I’m ever going to become one at all. Maybe I’ll never get there. A Level 9 Spiritual Lord sounds so close to a Spiritual King, but the actual gap is enormous!”","Feng Wu only smiled at him.","The look gave Sun Yu the creeps, and he wondered what Feng Wu was getting at.","Chen Ziyun came in and threw an arm over Sun Yu’s shoulders. “If Xiao Wu says you’re a Spiritual King, you’re going to be a Spiritual King.”","Sun Yu didn’t understand.","He looked at Chen Ziyun in bewilderment.","Feng Wu took a small vial from her sleeve and handed it to Sun Yu.","Sun Yu took it, still confused.","Before he had time to react, Chen Ziyun removed the cap and poured the content into Sun Yu’s mouth.","Sun Yu was forced to drink it.","“What’s this taste?” Sun Yu frowned. “That’s awful. Why does it taste like piss?”","Feng Wu wanted to laugh.","The liquid had been brewed in that pit, so the taste was unavoidable.","“It’s the taste of a Spiritual King.” Feng Wu smiled mysteriously.","Sun Yu didn’t believe her.","The others also thought she was joking, and no one took her seriously.","“I’m starving,” Feng Wu said.","“Xiao Wu, let’s get something to eat!”"]},{"number":2843,"title":"Chapter 2843 - Competition (18)","paragraphs":["Feng Wu was accepted by the team after the competition, and they began to think of her as a part of the team.","“Xiao Wu will gain at least 10,000 points from this competition! You should treat us to lunch!” Chu Qu suggested.","“10,000 points?” Feng Wu was perplexed. “I didn’t know we could gain points.”","Chu Qu said, “Of course we can! The school will reward us for winning a competition like this. You’re the main reason for our victory, so you’ll get at least 10,000!”","Feng Wu asked, “What can I do with these points?”","Chu Qu said, “There are so many options! You can use it on cultivation, weapons, techniques, and even pay for a meal at Star Cloud Tower!”","Feng Wu asked, “What’s Star Cloud Tower?”","Chu Qu stared at her. “Seriously? You don’t know what Star Cloud Tower is? Haven’t you been there before?”","Sun Yu couldn’t feel the effect of the spirit wine even though his spiritual essence was going through a drastic change inside him.","He still thought Feng Wu was making fun of him and had completely forgotten about what he had drunk.","He patted Chu Qu on the shoulder and said grumpily, “It’s only been a couple of months since Xiao Wu joined our school, and she only came to our team a few days ago. It’s not surprising that she doesn’t know what Star Cloud Tower is. That place is open to Class A students only.”","He then turned to Feng Wu. “Star Cloud Tower is a special place. The food ingredients there all come from magical beasts. They’re very rich in spiritual essence and can greatly benefit your cultivation.","“Only tutors and Class A students are qualified to eat there.”","Feng Wu said, “If Class A students can go there all the time, you wouldn’t be so excited.”","Sun Yu chuckled. “Xiao Wu, you’re so clever. That’s right. We wouldn’t find it so rare if we could go there whenever we want.","“However, the mysterious chef in Star Cloud Tower will only prepare one feast every month. The food will be very peculiar, but it’ll do wonders for your cultivation. You’ll suddenly feel enlightened about things that baffled you before.","“Everybody says the mysterious chef is an extremely capable cultivator, but no one has ever seen the person.”","Feng Wu said, “Sounds like a floor-sweeping monk.”","Sun Yu was confused. “Sweeping the floor? That’s not what the chef does. He disappears as soon as he finishes cooking.”","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","Chen Ziyun said, “I heard the mysterious chef is Master Linghu’s personal cook. He takes a day off every month to cook here, and waits for the right cultivator to come along.”","Master Linghu? Feng Wu’s eyes lit up.","The others screamed. “Master Linghu? OMG! Are you talking about THE Master Linghu?”","Chen Ziyun nodded. “I only heard Mr. Gongsun mention it once. He wouldn’t say more and only said we should spend our points on that meal whenever we can, or we would regret it for the rest of our lives.”","“Is that so? That meal is rarer than in legend!”","Feng Wu said, “Let’s go. We’ll book seats for today.”","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","A booking? That wasn’t an option!","Chen Ziyun smiled bitterly. “Let’s go, then. Maybe we’ll get lucky.”"]},{"number":2844,"title":"Chapter 2844 - Competition (19)","paragraphs":["They quickly headed for Star Cloud Tower.","The tower had two levels.","The ground floor was the lobby filled with dozens of tables. It wasn’t difficult to get a seat here.","There was only one table on the second floor.","It was reserved for the mysterious chef who only came here once a month.","Although Star Cloud Tower was in Imperial College, the owner wasn’t a member of the college and didn’t follow the college’s commands.","However, the tower had a good relationship with Imperial College.","The owner was called Ji Xingyun, who was a beautiful woman in her twenties.","She greeted Chen Ziyun and his team with a smile.","“Captain Chen, to what do I owe this honor?” Ji Xingyun got along well with Chen Ziyun and spoke to him in a casual manner.","Chen Ziyun came here every month for a seat on the second floor and was quite familiar with this place.","“Miss Ji, you have to reserve a good number for us.” Chen Ziyun chuckled.","Ji Xingyun said, “You don’t have to tell me that. I always give you a good number, but you really don’t have much luck. You’ve only eaten that meal once, right?”","Chen Ziyun rubbed his nose with an awkward smile.","Feng Wu observed Ji Xingyun curiously.","Ji Xingyun also noticed the stunning girl in the red dress.","Her eyes lit up, and she beamed at Feng Wu. “What a pretty girl! You’re the legendary Feng Wu, aren’t you?”","Feng Wu greeted her politely.","She liked this young woman with a bright smile.","“Do you know her?” Chen Ziyun asked curiously.","“I do know about things outside this tower, alright? The whole school has been talking about your competition today. We might not have known Feng Wu’s name before, but after that glorious battle, everybody knows her name!”","“The glorious battle?” Chen Ziyun rubbed his chin.","Ji Xingyun said, “She saved the whole team at a critical moment and won back your dignity. If that’s not a glorious battle, what is?”","She couldn’t say enough good things about Feng Wu.","She genuinely liked this stunning teenage girl.","Ji Xingyun then handed a number plate to Chen Ziyun. “The result will come out in five minutes. Take this. I think this should give you a bit more luck.”","She then lowered her voice. “Master Taihe may be a little sensitive to this number.”","Master Taihe was the name of the chef.","His rule was only the chosen one could eat his food.","That was why he only came here once a month and would only cook one table full of food. Rather than choose the highest bidder or the most talented, he would give the opportunity to the person chosen by fate.","Every team in the waiting area would have a number plate. Master Taihe would randomly pick one after he finished cooking.","The team with that number would eat the food.","Master Taihe was still cooking now, and the result would be announced in five minutes.","Feng Wu and her team saw countless people in the waiting area.","At least hundreds of teams were trying their luck.","They heard footsteps at the door."]},{"number":2845,"title":"Chapter 2845 - Competition (20)","paragraphs":["The footsteps sounded familiar.","Feng Wu involuntarily turned her head and saw some familiar faces.","Chu Yun led the way, and was followed by members of her varsity and junior teams, led by Sheng Changtian and Lan Xuefeng respectively.","What a coincidence.","Sun Yu followed Feng Wu’s eyes and almost exploded when he saw those people.","“Why are they here?” Sun Yu said angrily.","What?","Everybody else turned their heads.","They all rose to their feet when they saw who those people were.","Chu Yun noticed them when they all stood up.","The two sides didn’t really speak to each other, and Chu Yun was going to ignore Dynasty Team as well.","However...","Sheng Changtian walked toward his opponents.","His four team members seemed equally interested and followed him.","Chu Yun frowned but couldn’t stop them, so she had to follow her students.","Soon, Sheng Changtian stopped in front of Chen Ziyun and stared at the latter.","Chen Ziyun wasn’t intimidated. He stood ramrod straight and stared back at Sheng Changtian.","The two sides were at daggers drawn.","Sheng Changtian suddenly raised his eyebrow and smiled. “Ziyun, it’s been a while.”","Chen Ziyun only stared at him and didn’t say a word.","Sheng Changtian was still smiling, as if he was confident enough to rule the world.","He said, “I’m one year older than you, but for a while, you were always one step ahead of me. You joined Imperial College one year before I went to the Military Academy.","“You were always one level higher than I was.","“I was a Level 7 Spiritual Lord when you were at Level 8.","“You were at Level 9 when I became a Level 8.","“You were always a little quicker than me, and I thought I would be slower than you for the rest of my life.","“I never thought you would be stuck at the Spiritual Lord stage for so long.","“Finally, I’m one step ahead of you.","“I’ll be a step ahead of you all the time.","“Chen Ziyun, you’ll always be inferior to me.”","Sheng Changtian smiled at Chen Ziyun. “You’ll feel the same jealousy I did for the rest of your life.”","Chen Ziyun stared at Sheng Changtian without saying a word.","Feng Wu glanced at Sheng Changtian and said indifferently, “You must be blind.”","She didn’t try to be polite.","Given Sheng Changtian’s status, not many people dared to speak to him like that.","He was a little taken aback.","He then saw the girl in a red dress to the right of Chen Ziyun.","What a stunning girl.","“Are you Miss Feng Wu?”","Sheng Changtian was a shrewd man who always kept a poker face. People around him always felt a chill run down their spines.","Chen Ziyun stepped forward and stared at Sheng Changtian. “This is between us. Don’t get other people involved.”","Sheng Changtian chuckled. “Is it?”","Chen Ziyun reminded him. “You can’t afford to offend her.”","Chen Ziyun laughed. “Chen Ziyun, you don’t know me at all.”"]},{"number":2846,"title":"Chapter 2846 - Competition (21)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun looked at Sheng Changtian and suddenly wanted to laugh.","Spiritual Kings were incredible, but Sheng Changtian was nothing compared with the crown prince.","How dare he try to flirt with Feng Wu?","“What was that?” Sheng Changtian wasn’t affected. He put on a look that he thought looked condescending.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say. The man seemed to be trying to mimic Jun Linyuan.","She couldn’t help but get that feeling.","Feng Wu glared back at him. “Are you blind?”","Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to say.","Ever since he made a name for himself in the Military Academy, no one had ever treated him like this.","Before Sheng Changtian could say anything, Lu Qinghe frowned. “Young lady, do you know who you’re talking to?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “A blind man.”","Ahem...?","Ji Xingyun couldn’t help but burst out laughing.","Sheng Changtian glanced at her, so she cleared her throat. “Everybody, if you’re here to eat, there’s still a table over there. Please take your seats.”","Chu Yun knew Ji Xingyun, so she said, “We’ll wait for Master Taihe.”","“I see.” Ji Xingyun nodded. “In that case, you’ll have to get in line.”","Chu Yun knew the rules, so they took the number plate and sat down.","Sheng Changtian kept glancing at Feng Wu.","Lu Qinghe looked at Sheng Changtian and whispered, “Boss, do you have a crush on the girl?”","Sheng Changtian didn’t deny it. He nodded and said, “She’s good-looking enough for me.”","He didn’t try to keep his voice down, so everybody heard him.","Even Feng Wu’s team heard him.","Chen Ziyun couldn’t believe it.","Feng Wu?","Did he just say Feng Wu was good enough for him?","“You must be dreaming. You’ve got to be as great as the crown prince to go out with Xiao Wu.” Chen Ziyun rolled his eyes at him.","Sheng Changtian found Chen Ziyun’s words idiotic.","The crown prince? As in Jun Linyuan? That was very bold of Chen Ziyun, bringing him up like that.","Sheng Changtian smirked. “You must have a death wish.”","Chen Ziyun rolled his eyes.","Death wish?","This man didn’t know what he was talking about.","“You’re going to get yourself killed, and you won’t know how it happens,” Chen Ziyun said provocatively.","Sheng Changtian said, “I’ll say the same to you, but I know how you’re going to die: His Royal Highness will kill you.”","Feng Wu found their conversation very boring.","Sheng Changtian was displeased when he saw that Chen Ziyun couldn’t be bothered to talk to him.","He had compared himself with Chen Ziyun since they were little.","Before, his parents used to motivate him by using Chen Ziyun’s achievements.","Later, when Sheng Changtian became stronger, he felt he could get back at Chen Ziyun.","Defeating Chen Ziyun was his fundamental motivation for getting stronger.","That was why he cut down Imperial College’s flag after the Military Academy’s team won the competition the year before.","He had thought it was already kind enough of him not to stomp on the flag.","He couldn’t stand the fact that Chen Ziyun wouldn’t even look at him.","He glanced at Chen Ziyun and smirked. “Do you know about His Royal Highness’s relationship with the Military Academy?”","Chen Ziyun looked rather bored."]},{"number":2847,"title":"Chapter 2847 - Competition (22)","paragraphs":["“I don’t know about the relationship between the Military Academy and His Royal Highness. I only know that he’s very close to our Imperial College.”","Sheng Changtian smirked. “Guess what? His Royal Highness is our school’s honorary chief now!”","Chen Ziyun said, “What?”","Sheng Changtian said, “One more thing: His Royal Highness is also the Military Team’s chief commander!”","Northern Feng General was undoubtedly the most senior general in Peace Grassland.","Apart from hundreds of thousands of soldiers, he also led two special troops.","Both troops consisted of the most capable warriors.","They had to be at least Spiritual Kings.","During the battle against the Dongsang Kingdom, all participants would fight opponents of their own levels.","That rule had been agreed upon by both countries.","Otherwise, one advanced cultivator could annihilate a group of ordinary soldiers. That wouldn’t be fair.","The two special troops were the Military Team and Dynasty Team.","Dynasty Team’s current chief commander was the mysterious elder of Imperial College — the one that no one had seen before.","Jun Linyuan was the Military Team’s chief commander now?","It was Chen Ziyun’s first time hearing about it, and he was shocked. “His Royal Highness graduated from Imperial College...”","Sheng Changtian chuckled. “Given His Royal Highness’s level, do you think he’ll be confined by where he graduated from? He’s the crown prince and our future emperor! He can do whatever he wants!”","He then gave Chen Ziyun an arrogant glance. “Do you know His Royal Highness is recruiting guards?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Is that so? Why haven’t I heard about it?”","Sheng Changtian gloated. “Only Spiritual Kings will be considered as candidates. You’re not qualified.”","Chen Ziyun said, “I don’t think being a Spiritual King will be enough to be His Royal Highness’s guard.”","Sheng Changtian said, “They’re only recruiting junior guards. Do you think you’ll start as the crown prince’s personal guard? You’ll have to go through a lot of training and multiple selections before you can become a senior guard. Only then will you be close to His Royal Highness. This process will take at least ten years.”","Sheng Changtian clenched his fists. “I’m sure I’ll pass the test!”","Chen Ziyun looked from Sheng Changtian to Feng Wu.","The look gave Feng Wu the creeps.","“What?” she snapped.","Chen Ziyun’s eyes suddenly lit up.","He realized that if he used Feng Wu as his shortcut, he might soon exceed Sheng Changtian!","Sheng Changtian was displeased when he saw that Chen Ziyun wasn’t discouraged.","He was showing off, but Chen Ziyun wasn’t jealous. Instead, it gave Chen Ziyun some motivation.","“Chen Ziyun, don’t you have something to say?” Sheng Changtian stared at his archenemy.","Chen Ziyun said, “What? About His Royal Highness’s guard? Of course, I want to become one.”","Sheng Changtian glanced at Chen Ziyun and found his claim ridiculous.","After getting satisfaction from showing off in front of Chen Ziyun, Sheng Changtian couldn’t be bothered to speak to him anymore. He stared at Feng Wu but was lost in thought."]},{"number":2848,"title":"Chapter 2848 - Competition (23)","paragraphs":["He thought, “Did I speak too much? I’m supposed to be an impressive cultivator. His Royal Highness never says too much, and it only makes him more mysterious!”","Hence, Sheng Changtian stopped talking, but he didn’t look away from Feng Wu.","She was so pretty, and he found her very attractive.","Sheng Changtian let his imagination run wild. He even thought about marrying Feng Wu and having children and grandchildren with her. The idea only excited him more.","“She’s the one!” Sheng Changtian made up his mind.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu saw Chu Yun walking to the back of the tower.","Feng Wu frowned and wondered where she was going.","She followed Chu Yun.","She then saw Chu Yun knocking on a door.","That door normally wouldn’t open, but it was open now.","Feng Wu also noticed that there was a rhythm to Chu Yun’s knocking: three long taps followed by a short one.","Chu Yun then waved her number plate at the person who answered the door.","Feng Wu recognized the person.","It was Yuanbao, the little monk who served Master Linghu!","Yuanbao had visited Feng Wu before and led her to Master Linghu. What was he doing here?","Right...","Feng Wu remembered that just like Yuanbao, Master Taihe was from the Wandering Temple. It wasn’t surprising that Yuanbao was here.","What surprised Feng Wu was that Chu Yun was cheating.","She couldn’t stand it.","Feng Wu was going to try her luck this time.","Seeing that Chu Yun was coming toward her, Feng Wu hid behind some shelves.","Chu Yun was probably feeling guilty about her conduct, so she left as soon as possible.","Feng Wu smiled when she saw Chu Yun leave.","If her opponent decided to try using her connections instead of luck, she would do the same.","She knocked on the door with the same rhythm.","Yuanbao lost his patience.","He shouted from the other side, “Stop this! Haven’t I told you already? I’ll let you eat the food for that favor we owe you! Why are you...”","He opened the door and saw someone he didn’t expect.","Feng Wu smiled at him.","“Sister Feng Wu! I missed you so much!”","...","Chu Yun came back with a gloating smile on her face.","Chu Qu happened to lead Gongsun Mu into the room at that moment.","Since the other team had Chu Yun, Dynasty Team decided they should have a tutor here as well. However, no one thought about Zuo Qingluan.","Chen Ziyun and his team had been ignoring Zuo Qingluan since the incident in the Secret Essence Mine.","Of course, the other students didn’t know what had happened and still thought of her as a vice-chief.","When Gongsun Mu saw Chu Yun, he frowned and asked, “Did you go to the back room just then?”","Chu Yun glanced at him. “What? Do I have to ask for your permission to go to the bathroom?”","Gongsun Mu looked away and ignored her.","Chu Qu said, “We’re going to try our luck today. With Xiao Wu here, maybe Master Taihe will pick us.”","Gongsun Mu shook his head and asked Ji Xingyun, “How many number plates are there today?”","“76,” Ji Xingyun said briskly."]},{"number":2849,"title":"Chapter 2849 - Competition (24)","paragraphs":["Gongsun Mu looked at this team. “Are you going to try your luck? That’s one in 76!”","The others shrugged.","Gongsun Mu said, “Today is your competition. As your vice-chief, I should give you a gift for this special occasion.","“Master Taihe owes me a big favor. He has agreed to cook me a meal to return that favor. I’m going to use that opportunity today.”","Did that mean that they didn’t need to try their luck today?","Dynasty Team cheered loudly.","The Military Team was displeased.","However, Chu Yun smiled at Gongsun Mu. “Aren’t you a little too late to do that?”","“What do you mean?” Gongsun Mu stared at Chu Yun.","Chu Yun only went on smiling.","“Have you used it already?!” Gongsun Mu’s eyes widened.","Chu Yun still wouldn’t say anything.","Gongsun Mu’s face went livid. “You’ve crossed the line! I saved him, not you!”","Chu Yun shrugged. “So? I’ve used it already.”","Gongsun Mu shouted, “You!”","Both teams were watching them.","They seemed to realize what was going on.","Master Taihe seemed to owe the two of them a favor, but Chu Yun used that opportunity for herself.","She glanced at Gongsun Mu, knowing that there was nothing he could do.","Sheng Changtian and his team members gloated and kept giving Dynasty Team provoking looks.","Chen Ziyun and his team were furious.","Even someone as mild-mannered as Gongsun Mu was furious.","Chen Ziyun stared at Ji Xingyun. “Does that mean our number plate is useless?”","Ji Xingyun hadn’t seen that coming either.","It was very rare for Master Taihe to owe other people a favor.","This was the second time he had used his feast to return a favor.","Ji Xingyun gave Chen Ziyun an apologetic look. “I’m so sorry. I didn’t know this was going to happen...”","Other Imperial College students waiting in the room were infuriated as well.","They had all planned to give the opportunity to Dynasty Team if they were chosen. Maybe that one meal would increase their cultivation level.","Of the 76 numbers, only one number belonged to their opponent, but they still lost.","They couldn’t accept it!","Sheng Changtian was elated to see the angry faces.","He smiled at Chen Ziyun. “Chen Ziyun, you’ve lost to me in every possible way. You’re not a Spiritual King and you can’t eat Master Taihe’s food even when we’re in your territory.”","Chen Ziyun ground his teeth in frustration.","Sheng Changtian was right. They were in his territory, but he had lost.","Feng Wu glanced at Sheng Changtian. “Are you really that blind? My captain is a Spiritual King. Can’t you see that?”","WHAT?!","A Spiritual King?","To detect another person’s cultivation level, one needed to activate their spiritual essence."]},{"number":2850,"title":"Chapter 2850 - Competition (25)","paragraphs":["Sheng Changtian never thought much of Chen Ziyun, so he had never checked the latter’s cultivation level.","He finally did so.","Feng Wu was right!","“You’re a Spiritual King, too!” Sheng Changtian stared at Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun glanced at him. “Why are you so surprised?”","Sheng Changtian couldn’t believe Chen Ziyun’s tone.","However, Sheng Changtian managed to pull himself together almost immediately.","He glanced at Chen Ziyun and smirked. “You should have been a Spiritual King a long time ago. What took you so long? Why are you so proud?”","Chen Ziyun didn’t like his tone at all.","Sheng Changtian shook his head. “Your team only has one Spiritual King. That won’t bother us.”","Feng Wu stared at Sheng Changtian and wondered if something was wrong with his eyes.","“Right! I forgot!” Sheng Changtian smacked his forehead. “Little Feng Wu here is a Spiritual King, too. How impressive.”","“You don’t get to call her Little Feng Wu!” All eight members of the Dynasty Team shouted at him in unison.","Their stern tone almost made Sheng Changtian jump.","He frowned at them. It almost felt like they were defending their own sister. Since when were the students of Imperial College so united?","The Military Team was surprised when they heard that both Chen Ziyun and Feng Wu were Spiritual Kings, but they weren’t surprised for long.","They had at least three Spiritual Kings, and believed that they would win. Those two Spiritual Kings would only affect the process but not the result.","...","However, the other students were astonished.","WHAT?!","Their team had two Spiritual Kings now!","Did that mean they still had a chance?","The news soon spread.","All the students of Imperial College were thrilled.","“Holy crap! Feng Wu is a Spiritual King!”","“OMG! I can’t believe she was in the same class as me a few days ago! My classmate is a Spiritual King!”","“I treated her as my enemy! I said things behind her back! I did those things to a Spiritual King! I’m doomed!”","Class E students cheered at the top of their lungs.","So did the students of Classes D, C, and B.","As for Class A, the students were used to Feng Wu’s unbelievable rate of progress.","They just wished she could graduate as soon as possible and stop shocking ordinary people on a daily basis!","They used to think they were elites and geniuses, but when Feng Wu arrived, they felt like idiots.","They didn’t find it surprising that Chen Ziyun was a Spiritual King.","Unlike Feng Wu, Chen Ziyun made progress at the same speed as other ordinary students.","However —","“Does that mean we have a chance to defeat the Military Academy?”","“That’s right. Two against three! I think we have a chance!”","“Let’s watch the competition! I want to cheer for our team!”"]},{"number":2851,"title":"Chapter 2851 - Competition (26)","paragraphs":["Ji Xingyun came out at that moment.","Sheng Changtian sneered at Chen Ziyun before turning to his team members. “Let’s get ready to go in.”","“Great!” The others were all excited.","They were in Imperial College.","However, they had taken Dynasty Team’s opportunity in their territory. It felt so satisfying.","They couldn’t begin to describe that feeling.","“Let’s eat!” Lv Haobei and the others all gloated.","Chu Yun gave Gongsun Mu a provoking glance and felt utterly fantastic.","All the Imperial College students on the ground floor had stopped eating. Their faces turned livid.","They all felt humiliated.","This was so frustrating!","They all wanted Ji Xingyun to tell them that Chen Ziyun’s team could go in.","Unfortunately, that wasn’t going to happen.","Chu Yun had told everybody she had asked the master to return the favor.","“This is unbelievable!”","Chen Ziyun ground his teeth and clenched his fists.","“You’re going to pay for this!” He glared at Sheng Changtian.","Sheng Changtian laughed.","“We’re going to pay? How? When?”","“You don’t need to show us the way. I know where it is.” Chu Yun smiled at Ji Xingyun.","Ji Xingyun felt conflicted.","She raised an arm and blocked Chu Yun’s way.","“What?” Chu Yun frowned at Ji Xingyun.","Ji Xingyun smiled. “I’m sorry, but you can’t go in.”","Chu Yun smirked. “Then who can?”","Ji Xingyun pointed at Feng Wu. “Them.”","What?","The entire room fell silent.","For a moment, everybody forgot to breathe.","After that, they sucked in their breaths.","Chen Ziyun was the first to react.","“Us?” Chen Ziyun pointed at himself. “Are you sure?”","Ji Xingyun nodded with a smile. “Yes, that’s what I’ve been told.”","Chu Yun finally realized what was happening and stared at Ji Xingyun. “No! That’s not possible!”","Ji Xingyun shrugged. “That’s the truth.”","Chu Yun glared at her. “That can’t be! You’re lying! This can’t be happening! That’s the only explanation!”","Ji Xingyun frowned.","She was very easy-going, but as the owner of Star Cloud Tower, she had her temper as well.","She stared at Chu Yun. “You don’t get to talk to me in that tone. You’re not welcome here. Get out!”","Ji Xingyun knew what Chu Yun had done and found her behavior despicable. She had no problem scolding this woman.","Chu Yun stared at Ji Xingyun in disbelief.","How dare the owner of a restaurant shout at her?","She was the assistant dean of the Military Academy!","Ji Xingyun smirked. “I don’t care what your job title is in the Military Academy! It means nothing here in Imperial College! If you want to give me a speech, become the vice-chief of Imperial College first!"]},{"number":2852,"title":"Chapter 2852 - Competition (27)","paragraphs":["Chu Yun was so frustrated that she shook from head to toe.","Feng Wu clapped her hands.","That was very well said. She liked Sister Xingyun a lot.","“Fine!” Chu Yun sneered at Gongsun Mu. “That’s so nice of Imperial College! You cheated in the competition, and you didn’t even try to hide it! Gongsun Mu, is that how you teach your students? If you won’t discipline her, I’ll do it for you!”","Chu Yun was going to take action, when she heard an impatient voice.","Yuanbao came into the room.","The little boy walked in with a big frown on his face. He was annoyed.","Master Linghu always stayed in the temple, and Yuanbao represented him in the secular world.","It wasn’t common knowledge, but the tutors of both schools knew it.","Chu Yun and Gongsun Mu were both surprised by Yuanbao’s arrival. They both lowered their heads but stole glances at the boy.","Chen Ziyun and the other students weren’t senior enough to know who Yuanbao was, so they were still eyeing him curiously.","Gongsun Mu and Chu Yun scolded them. “Lower your heads!”","What?","Chen Ziyun and the other students were all confused. Gongsun Mu was seldom so stern, and it only showed how much the boy had startled him.","They all did as they were told and lowered their heads.","Both Chen Ziyun and Sheng Changtian’s teams did so.","Yuanbao walked up to them.","His words were directed to Chu Yun only.","“Shut up! How dare you raise your voice here?!” Yuanbao’s tone was very domineering.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She only remembered Yuanbao as the lovely shy boy who always enjoyed good food. She almost couldn’t recognize him now.","She then looked at Chu Yun.","The woman lowered her head and let Yuanbao scold her.","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She realized once more how much ordinary people respected Master Linghu.","Even the arrogant Chu Yun bowed her head to Master Linghu’s little messenger.","Yuanbao stared at Chu Yun. “I’ve decided to give the meal to Sister Xiaowu. Do you have a problem with that?”","Sister Xiaowu?","Was he referring to...","Everybody glanced at Feng Wu.","Only Chu Yun could describe how she felt. Her face turned scarlet red at the boy’s words, but she still had to squeeze out a smile. “No, of course not.”","Yuanbao snorted, threw a dirty look at Chu Yun, then ran to Feng Wu’s side.","He looked up at her with eyes filled with admiration.","He tugged at her clothes. “Sister Xiaowu, the master needs me, so I’ll be off. I’ve saved the table for you. No other team can touch it!”","Feng Wu rubbed his little bald head. “That’s great. Thank you, my dear Yuanbao.”","“You’re welcome.” Unlike his harsh tone when he scolded Chu Yun, Yuanbao was a lovely boy when he spoke to Feng Wu. He gave Feng Wu one last look before he reluctantly took his leave.","Once he was gone, the others raised their heads and looked at one another in wonder."]},{"number":2853,"title":"Chapter 2853 - Competition (28)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun wanted to ask questions, but he chuckled instead when he sensed Sheng Changtian’s stare.","“Xiaowu, let’s go inside. The meal belongs to us now.” Chen Ziyun glanced at Sheng Changtian in satisfaction. “Apparently, that favor wasn’t as useful as it seemed.”","Sheng Changtian recalled how he had shown off earlier, only to be stopped at the door. His face turned bright red.","Of course, the greatest humiliation was felt by Chu Yun.","She stared at Feng Wu from behind, and there was a malicious look in her eyes.","She hated Feng Wu.","However, she feared the girl as well.","What was Feng Wu’s relationship with Yuanbao?","It wouldn’t be too complicated if she were just Yuanbao’s good friend. However, things would be very complicated if Master Linghu was involved.","Feng Wu and her team smiled at Chu Yun when they walked past her.","Chu Yun was astonished.","They were provoking her!","And there were also Imperial College students around them.","They looked at the Military College students as if they were a joke. They pointed at the Military Team and laughed among themselves.","As if that wasn’t enough, they also stole glances at the team.","They made it so obvious!","Chu Yun and Sheng Changtian didn’t react to their behavior, but the rest of the team wasn’t as unperturbed as they were. They flushed red.","Chu Yun sneered at Gongsun Mu. “Do you think you’ve won?","“Do I have to remind you that we’re in the middle of a competition? This meal means nothing!","“I was going to make it easy for you, but now... You’ll be sorry for what you’ve done!","“Let’s go!”","Chu Yun led the team away after she threatened the others.","Her words affected the students, but not as much as before.","Imperial College had won the junior team competition and the meal. Both times, it happened because of Feng Wu.","Her team doted on her now.","Everybody loved her.","Needless to say, Master Taihe’s dishes were delicious and effective.","After they ate, Feng Wu told them to go to the arena immediately.","Everybody was perplexed.","Sun Yu said, “We still have two hours before the final competition. Why don’t we go back to our own arena and take a break?”","“No.” Feng Wu was very adamant. “To the arena! Now!”","Everybody was confused.","However, Feng Wu was the most beloved team member now, and everybody listened to her.","All eight of them went to the arena.","The indoor arena could fit 10,000 spectators.","The competition would start in two hours, but people were already coming in.","From the high platform, one could see all of the audience.","10% of the seats were occupied.","Although it wasn’t their home game, the Military College would still send a lot of students here to watch the final competition.","Imperial College was on the left, and the Military College was on the right. It was clear-cut.","Just then —"]},{"number":2854,"title":"Chapter 2854 - Competition (29)","paragraphs":["Just then, Chu Qu put his hands on his lower abdomen.","“My dantian feels warm.”","“So does mine!”","“Why does it feel like I’m making a breakthrough?”","The others exchanged bewildered looks.","It wasn’t just one of them; at least six people clutched their stomachs and said that it felt like they were about to make breakthroughs.","Feng Wu grinned. “Do it, then. I’ll guard you all. Make the breakthrough.”","Chu Qu looked at her in wonder. “Is this the effect of Master Taihe’s food?”","The others stared at her in amazement as well.","That was amazing!","This shouldn’t be happening!","Other students had eaten the food before. The meal was offered once a month.","Although everybody praised the effect, it had never been on this scale. The reaction came too soon.","Chen Ziyun gave Feng Wu a knowing look.","She had gone into the kitchen earlier; that had to be the reason.","If the girl said she had nothing to do with it, he wouldn’t believe her.","At that thought, he raised an eyebrow at Feng Wu and gave her a meaningful look.","Feng Wu had nothing to say.","The audience was amazed when they saw the team members suddenly sit down and start cultivating.","They were indeed the best students of Imperial College. They only had a little time left before the competition, but they were still trying to cultivate. How amazing!","Wait!","Ye Han, who was sitting in the audience, widened her eyes.","Shao Xiao glanced at her. “What?”","Ye Han said, “Did you notice that? Chu Qu made a breakthrough just then! I felt it!”","Shao Xiao sensed Chu Qu’s spiritual essence and nodded in amazement. “Yes! I feel it, too! He hasn’t reached the next level, but he’s half a level higher than before!”","“What? Sh*t!” Ye Han was so thrilled that she blurted out, “Look at Li Zhan! Wasn’t he severely injured before? He looks perfectly alright now!","“He has advanced as well! The spiritual essence around him is different from the others!”","Shao Xiao tried to sense it as well.","Ye Han was right!","“Li Zhan isn’t the only one! Zhao Si is doing it, too!” Shao Xiao was so excited that he was almost in tears. “Why are they making such rapid progress?”","Ye Han said, “Rumor is that they went to eat Master Taihe’s monthly feast.”","Shao Xiao said, “So, that food is really as amazing as they say!”","Ye Han and Shao Xiao looked at each other.","Ling Hao and the others were thrilled as well.","“We’ll go there every month from now on. I’m sure we’ll get lucky one day!”","Many people thought the same way.","It seemed Master Taihe would have a lot more customers for a long time.","That news couldn’t be kept a secret.","The Military Academy soon caught wind of it.","Imperial College had given the Military Academy students their own rooms.","Right now, they were all sitting in their rooms in seclusion.","It wasn’t for their cultivation.","Everybody knew cultivation was a lengthy process and couldn’t be rushed.","They were only sitting there to calm their minds."]},{"number":2855,"title":"Chapter 2855 - Competition (30)","paragraphs":["Just then, someone ran into their area to look for Chu Yun.","It was Qiu Zeyu.","He used to be Chu Yun’s student and knew her well.","“Do you want to talk to me?” Chu Yun had a good impression of Qiu Zeyu.","Qiu Zeyu looked at Chu Yun and said earnestly, “I suggest you go to the arena now.”","Chu Yun was perplexed. “Why?”","Qiu Zeyu had never been so serious before.","“You’ll regret it later if you don’t go now. I’ve said what I’m here to say. It’s up to you. That’s all I can do for you.”","He was going to leave after that.","Chu Yun frowned and stopped him. “Why are you helping us?”","Qiu Zeyu didn’t speak.","Chu Yun said, “You’re a student of Imperial College. Why do you want to help us?”","It was a competition between the two schools.","It would affect the honor and future of both schools.","Qiu Zeyu was from Imperial College. Why would he do the Military Academy such a favor?","Qiu Zeyu stopped, turned his head, and looked at Chu Yun with eyes filled with hatred.","Even Chu Yun jumped at that look.","It seemed that Qiu Zeyu hated Imperial College to the bone.","However, that look reassured Chu Yun.","She went inside and roused the students.","“Let’s go to the arena. Something’s happening.”","The students were all perplexed.","Chu Yun didn’t know exactly what was going on, but Qiu Zeyu had come all the way to tell her, so it had to be something big.","“You’ll see when you get there.” Chu Yun led the way.","Had something happened in the arena that would stop the competition from taking place today?","She didn’t want that to happen. They were in a hurry to get to Peace Grassland.","Everybody was anxious.","They arrived at the arena in no time.","Seeing Gongsun Mu standing there, Chu Yun walked up to him and asked, “Can we have the competition on time or not?”","Gongsun Mu was watching Sun Yu in astonishment, and completely ignored Chu Yun.","Chu Yun was displeased, thinking Gongsun Mu was ignoring her on purpose.","“Gongsun Mu!” she shouted.","Gongsun Mu was startled. He frowned when he turned around and saw Chu Yun.","“Be quiet,” said Gongsun Mu.","However, Chu Yun was furious. She was about to lose her temper, when she saw something.","She noticed Sun Yu.","Then, she was shocked.","OMG!","She couldn’t believe her eyes.","That couldn’t be happening!","What did she see?","She saw spiritual essence wrapping around Sun Yu like a cocoon.","He was absorbing this web of spiritual essence.","Chu Yun had been there before. She knew perfectly well that once he finished absorbing the spiritual essence, he would become a Spiritual King!","A Spiritual King!","Chu Yun panicked."]},{"number":2856,"title":"Chapter 2856 - Competition (31)","paragraphs":["Imperial College already had two Spiritual Kings. If he made the breakthrough, they would have three!","The Military Academy only had three Spiritual Kings.","That was the only reason they thought they would win.","Were they going to lose that advantage?","No!","Chu Yun wouldn’t allow Imperial College to have a third Spiritual King.","She was going to sabotage the breakthrough, when she heard a cold voice in her ears.","“Chu Yun, remember: This is Imperial College.”","The voice sounded like it was from hell. It sent a chill down her spine.","She was the only one who could hear it.","This was the technique of sending a message to one specific person.","Only a Spiritual King or above knew this technique.","Chu Yun shuddered.","She already knew who was warning her.","It was Elder Wu.","Chu Yun realized he was right.","She was in Imperial College’s territory. How could she tamper with anything?","If they had been in the Military Academy... Chu Yun sighed.","Meanwhile, the Military Academy students were cursing in their minds.","“Sh*t!”","“Why is Sun Yu...”","“How...”","Sheng Changtian and Lv Haobei exchanged a complicated look.","They had thought they would definitely win, but things wouldn’t be so easy now.","Lv Haobei remained confident.","He said casually, “They’re all new Spiritual Kings. Their levels aren’t stable, and they haven’t learned any cultivation techniques yet. They won’t be our match.”","Lu Qinghe agreed.","There was no need to worry.","They were still a much better team.","The Military Academy was definitely going to win!","However...","Sheng Changtian frowned when he looked at the other students.","Wait!","Sun Yu wasn’t the only one.","All the Imperial College students had improved to some extent.","Sheng Changtian had detected their cultivation level earlier when they were in Star Cloud Tower, so he knew what they were like before.","“They’ve all made some progress!” Sheng Changtian was a little flustered.","He could understand if only a couple of them made progress. However, it was a big deal if all of them did it.","“It’s been less than an hour, and they’ve all improved by at least half a level. What’s going on?” Sheng Changtian ground his teeth.","If a team could make improvements together... That was a terrifying idea.","Lu Qinghe smacked his head.","“Shit! Is it because of Master Taihe?","“Didn’t they say eating Master Taihe’s food might help improve a person’s cultivation?","“They ate it, and they’ve all become better!”","Lu Qinghe and the others were so jealous.","That feast should have been theirs.","That opportunity should have been theirs!","Jealousy and rage almost drove them crazy.","Sheng Changtian reacted in time and noticed their unstable mood.","He said, “Calm down, all of you!”","The whole team immediately quieted down.","Sheng Changtian said, “Do you know why they’re not cultivating inside? Do you know why they’re taking the risk to cultivate on stage?”"]},{"number":2857,"title":"Chapter 2857 - Competition (32)","paragraphs":["The others all looked at him.","Lu Qinghe was the first to realize it. “Sh*t! They’re doing it on purpose! Who came up with that idea? How sly!”","Everybody looked at him.","Lu Qinghe said, “They’re deliberately cultivating here to distract us and boost their confidence. It’s such a clever move!”","Sheng Changtian, Lv Haobei, and Lu Qinghe were Spiritual Kings. Tang Mingjiang and Xun Jinyuan were Level 9 Spiritual Lords.","The Imperial College students were cheering loudly for Sun Yu’s breakthrough. Sheng Changtian looked from them to their own seats.","Because of their arrogance, their seats were still empty.","He suddenly had a bad feeling.","He couldn’t pinpoint it, but he felt uneasy.","He turned to his team. “Let’s summarize our opponents. Chen Ziyun, Feng Wu and Sun Yu are new Spiritual Kings. Li Shaochu is a peak Level 9 Spiritual Lord, and Wang Nian and Wang Xiao are advanced Level 9 Spiritual Lords.”","However, Lu Qinghe glanced at Dynasty Team and said quietly, “Wang Nian just became a peak Level 9 Spiritual Lord.”","Sheng Changtian didn’t know what to say.","Their opponents had just become stronger again.","Was Imperial College going to win this year?!","Sheng Changtian took a deep breath. “Let’s see what we’ve got.”","“Lv Haobei, Lu Qinghe and I are Spiritual Kings. Tang Mingjiang and Xun Jinyuan are peak Level 9 Spiritual Lords.","“We and our opponents have exactly the same levels. We both have three Spiritual Kings and two peak Level 9 Spiritual Lords, but we have a better chance because we made the breakthroughs earlier than they did. We’ve mastered the cultivation techniques for a longer time.”","“Captain.” Lu Qinghe smiled bitterly. “That may not be the case.”","“Do you want to say this is an away game for us?” Sheng Changtian frowned. “I’m sure we can overcome that disadvantage.”","Lu Qinghe reminded him, “We lost the junior game.”","Sheng Changtian’s face darkened.","That was right. That meant Imperial College would determine the sequence of their five players.","“Shit!” Sheng Changtian had forgotten about that fact, which was why he had been so proud. The idea was a hard blow to his confidence.","Sheng Changtian gave Lan Xuefeng a dirty look. How could they have lost that competition?!","Lu Qinghe said, “Captain, glaring at Lan Xuefeng won’t change anything. Since Feng Wu is a Spiritual King, our junior team couldn’t have won.”","Tang Mingjiang was displeased. “Isn’t she ashamed of fighting for the junior team? She’s a Spiritual King!”","Lu Qinghe said, “I asked around. That Miss Feng Wu only finished the paperwork to join the team today.”","The others were speechless.","Lu Qinghe smiled bitterly. “Even some of her team members questioned her qualifications to join them, so there was no way they would have put her on the varsity team. We also thought that she was a weakling at first.”","The others were speechless.","Lu Qinghe glanced at Chu Yun. “Miss Chu insisted that Feng Wu only won because Lan Xuefeng let her.”","The others were speechless.","That was so embarrassing.","“Forget about Feng Wu.” Sheng Changtian frowned. “We must win this competition. I’ll use that thing if I don’t have any other choice.”"]},{"number":2858,"title":"Chapter 2858 - Competition (33)","paragraphs":["All his team members knew what he meant.","They all knew that method, but because they had thought they would win, they never expected to use it.","However, Feng Wu and her team were leaving them no other choice.","Sheng Changtian smirked. “Feng Wu is too proud. She probably has yet to show all her cards.”","Lv Haobei also sneered. “She’ll pay for her pride.”","Lu Qinghe said, “Being a Spiritual King has made her so arrogant. We’ll teach her a lesson.”","Tang Mingjiang and Xun Jinyuan smiled smugly.","Meanwhile —","Feng Wu’s team was still feeling excited.","Chen Ziyun looked from Feng Wu to the other team members and said casually, “Isn’t that spirit wine so precious to you? Why did you put it in our food?”","Feng Wu said, “Did I? Do you have evidence?”","Chen Ziyun didn’t.","He was intrigued. She had done a good thing. Why wouldn’t she tell anybody?","Why stay anonymous?","Feng Wu wanted to shake her head. Of course she wanted to remain anonymous. Letting the others know would only create endless trouble.","There were so many tutors and students in Imperial College. They could all come to her to ask for some spirit wine. If they only wanted a drop, would she give it to them or not?","Therefore, she didn’t give it to Elder Wu.","However, she secretly helped her team.","Chu Qu was the first to finish cultivating.","He ran to Feng Wu in excitement. “Xiao Wu, Xiao Wu, I’ve improved! I’m a Level 9 Spiritual Lord, too!”","Feng Wu pointed at Sun Yu.","“Holy crap!” Chu Qu saw that Sun Yu had become a Spiritual King.","He then realized that all his teammates had made great progress.","He said, “Master Taihe’s food is so powerful!”","They were making progress as a group.","Dynasty Team had never felt so good.","“They’re staring at us.” Chu Qu glanced at Sheng Changtian’s team and smirked. “He’s glaring at me. He’s such a bad loser.”","By then, everybody had finished cultivating. They were all in high spirits, and nothing could wipe the smiles off their faces.","Feng Wu and Chen Ziyun went to the side to discuss the sequence for the other team, and the other members were left on stage.","“From now on, we’re going to the Star Cloud Tower every month to see Master Taihe!”","The others all nodded.","“Do you really think our progress was because of Master Taihe?” Wang Nian asked tentatively.","“Is it not?” The others were intrigued.","“I thought it was Master Taihe, too, but I heard Captain Chen talking to Xiao Wu just then. She added something to the dishes, which is why we all made progress!”","“What did she add?”","“I think it was the legendary spirit wine.”","“Holy sh*t! Spirit wine? I heard about it from my tutor. She said everybody used to make fast progress when the school had a lot of spirit wine. No one got stuck at the Spiritual King stage. However, the spirit wine ran out.”"]},{"number":2859,"title":"Chapter 2859 - Jun... (1)","paragraphs":["“Other people might think the spirit wine has run out, but Elder Wu mentioned that Xiao Wu found a bottle of spirit wine in the Secret Essence Mine!”","“What? She was almost buried alive, and she was still able to bring out a bottle of spirit wine?”","“Yes! Elder Wu tried to ask her for some, but she wouldn’t give him any.","“But she added some to the dishes we ate.","“How did Sun Yu become a Spiritual King? How did we all make progress? It’s all because of Xiao Wu!”","Wow!","After that, everybody knew what had happened.","Feng Wu was the reason they had all made progress in their cultivation.","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu!”","Everybody ran to her side.","Feng Wu had just figured out the sequence for the other team with Chen Ziyun.","The spirit wine was supposed to be a secret, so they couldn’t thank Feng Wu openly.","However, they still felt they should say something.","Both the spirit wine and Master Taihe’s dishes had come from Feng Wu. No one could deny that.","They all looked at Feng Wu but didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu knew what they were thinking. She glanced at them and said, “You’re going to jump over a cliff if you can’t win this battle!”","“Yes, of course!” Everybody nodded.","Sun Yu stared at Feng Wu in excitement.","He had made the greatest progress of all of them and had become a Spiritual King.","Without Feng Wu’s help, he might never have become one in his lifetime.","“I won’t allow anyone to disrespect you in the future!” Sun Yu said solemnly. “If they do, I’ll kill them, along with anyone who tries to spread rumors about you!”","Feng Wu didn’t know how to react.","Just then, she saw people coming into the arena.","And more kept coming.","There hadn’t been that many people during the junior team competition.","Not only was the auditorium full, the judges had arrived.","Chen Ziyun knew Feng Wu didn’t know most people here, so he explained to her, “The Military Academy students all sit in the area on the left. They’re here to support their team. Because it’s an away game for them, they take up only about one-third of the seats.","“The area on the right belongs to our school. They didn’t want to watch us at first, but the seats are all occupied now. I think they have some confidence in us.","“Look there.” Chen Ziyun pointed at the judges. “The two seats in the middle belong to the two people with the highest authority from the two schools during this competition.","“Elder Wu will represent our school.","“That elderly man represents the Military Academy. He’s Gongshu Hongzhu, a major general in the army. His status in the Military Academy is the same as Elder Wu in our school.","“Next to Elder Wu is Mr. Gongsun Mu, and next to Major General Gongshu is Miss Chu Yun.","“We’re still waiting for one more person.”","Feng Wu asked, “Who?”","“The chief judge.” Chen Ziyun gave Feng Wu a meaningful look. “His Royal Highness, the sixth brother of His Majesty, has been the judge for as long as I can remember. This year is no exception.”","“His Royal Highness?” Feng Wu asked. “Is he the one who is away all the time and lives like a wandering ranger?”"]},{"number":2860,"title":"Chapter 2860 - Jun... (2)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun said, “Yes. Not only is His Royal Highness a capable man, he’s strict and impartial. He’s been our judge all these years and has never missed any competition. When he comes...”","Just then, they hear noise outside.","It was a hubbub of excited voices.","“I think His Royal Highness is here.” Chen Ziyun smiled.","But he was perplexed.","His Royal Highness was an ordinary-looking middle-aged man. He didn’t look like a royal member, and the energy he gave off reminded one of a sharp sword. People usually stayed away from him.","Why was there so much noise?","It wasn’t like he was the crown prince.","Just then, he heard an excited voice.","“His Royal Highness, the crown prince is here!”","What?","Everybody was astonished.","His Royal Highness?","Jun Linyuan?","Seriously?!","Soon, a teenager walked into the arena.","Wrapped in a black robe, his perfect figure reminded one of a pine tree.","He had smooth skin and deep-set features.","As he walked, his energy seemed to spread to the entire arena.","Everybody felt a chill run down their spines.","Feng Wu frowned a little when she saw Jun Linyuan.","What was he doing here?","Why did he come?","Feng Wu asked Chen Ziyun, “Isn’t it supposed to be the crown prince’s uncle?”","Chen Ziyun was equally perplexed, but he reacted quickly. “Since the crown prince is here, is it possible that His Royal Highness will be the chief judge today?”","Feng Wu said, “Are you sure?”","While they were talking, other people were already greeting Jun Linyuan.","The audience was thrilled.","Ye Han grabbed Ling Hao’s hand. “It’s His Royal Highness! It’s the crown prince!”","She didn’t dare make too much noise, so she controlled herself and lowered her voice.","Ling Hao was equally excited. “It’s him! It’s him! Gosh, I never thought I could be so close to His Royal Highness.”","Zi Ling was also excited. She held Chaoge’s hand and trembled with excitement.","“Chaoge! Chaoge! Look! It’s His Royal Highness! It’s the crown prince!” Just like all the other girls, Zi Ling was over the moon.","“Why aren’t you excited?”","After her initial excitement, Zi Ling was perplexed when she saw the look in Chaoge’s eyes.","Chaoge said, “Why are you so excited? It’s only the crown prince.”","Zi Ling’s eyes widened. “It’s only the crown prince? Chaoge, you’re so arrogant now! Why do you make it sound like you can see His Royal Highness all the time?”","Chaoge rolled her eyes.","She saw the crown prince all too often.","He seemed perfect, but all he wanted was to steal Xiao Wu away!","Chaoge pouted.","However, she didn’t dare say any of that out loud. When Jun Linyuan was around, she was as obedient as a lamb.","Hearing Zi Ling’s question, she thought, “I’ve seen the crown prince so many times. I even ate with him on several occasions.”","All the judges stood up and looked at Jun Linyuan.","Gongshu Hongzhu lifted his chin in an arrogant manner. He pushed Elder Wu out of the way and sat down in the seat that was the closest to the crown prince."]},{"number":2861,"title":"Chapter 2861 - Jun... (3)","paragraphs":["Jun Linyuan hadn’t come alone.","He had a few people with him.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi were by his side, followed by Feng and a few others.","Gongshu Hongzhu moved closer and wanted to greet Jun Linyuan, when Feng Xun frowned. “General Gongshu, outsiders must stay two meters away from His Royal Highness.”","Only people like Feng Xun and Xuan Yi could stay within a meter of him.","Gongshu Hongzhu’s smile stiffened.","He wasn’t discouraged. Instead, he took a step back and smiled at Feng Xun. “Thank you for your reminder, my lord. Your Royal Highness, this way, please.”","To the students, Gongshu Hongzhu was a supreme figure.","However, Gongshu Hongzhu was nothing compared with Jun Linyuan.","He hardly ever had a chance to meet Jun Linyuan, let alone approach him. Being a judge this time had given him a great opportunity.","From the moment he walked in, Jun Linyuan didn’t look at anybody.","He would only glance in a certain direction every now and then.","“Hey!” Chen Ziyun tugged at Feng Wu’s sleeve. “Do you think His Royal Highness has been looking in our direction?”","Feng Wu said decisively, “No!”","Chen Ziyun gave her a strange look. “No? Are you sure?”","Feng Wu repeated, “Definitely not!”","Chen Ziyun was confused. “I really don’t understand you.”","It was obvious that the crown prince had been looking this way.","Suddenly, he felt a chill run down his spine.","He looked up and was frozen on the spot.","OMG!","The crown prince was looking at him!","No. To be more precise, the crown prince was glaring at him.","“Captain, what’s wrong?” Sun Yu was perplexed.","“I, I...” Chen Ziyun couldn’t form a coherent sentence.","He was panic-stricken.","A thought struck him.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","He took a few steps away from Feng Wu.","The power that threatened to crush him suddenly disappeared.","He had guessed correctly.","The crown prince really had a thing for Feng Wu!","Feng Wu was perplexed. “Why are you moving away? Come over here.”","Chen Ziyun waved his hand in a fluster. “I’m sweating. I’ll just stand over here.”","Feng Wu was about to walk to his side, but Chen Ziyun waved his hands repeatedly. “Please don’t come near me! I can just stand here! Really!”","If Feng Wu moved any closer, he would burst into tears.","Feng Wu frowned and wondered what was wrong with the man.","Just then, Chu Qu jumped out of nowhere.","“Xiao Wu! Xiao Wu!”","He made a gesture, trying to put his arm around Feng Wu’s shoulder.","It was only a gesture because he knew Feng Wu would react quickly and dodge his arm.","Chen Ziyun watched in horror.","All he could think of was Chu Qu’s miserable death.","It was too late to stop him!","Chen Ziyun stuck out his foot and stuck it between Chu Qu’s legs.","With a thump, Chu Qu fell to the ground, face first.","Chu Qu was speechless.","He didn’t know how that had happened."]},{"number":2862,"title":"Chapter 2862 - Jun... (4)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun then looked in Jun Linyuan’s direction.","Jun Linyuan was talking to Elder Wu and wasn’t looking at him, but Feng Xun gave him the thumbs up.","Boss Feng was pleased! Chen Ziyun let out a breath of relief and grinned.","He understood everything now.","It was so obvious.","He couldn’t understand how Feng Wu could refuse to accept reality when it was obvious that the crown prince liked her.","“Wahh —”","Still lying facedown on the ground, Chu Qu wailed.","Only then did Chen Ziyun realize he had kicked Chu Qu to the ground, so he immediately helped his teammate up.","“Are you alright? Does it hurt?” Chen Ziyun feigned a concerned tone.","Chu Qu was perplexed. “Captain, was that you...”","Chen Ziyun said, “Chu Qu, you’re a big boy now, so be smart, or you’ll get yourself killed one day.”","Chu Qu said, “I...”","Chen Ziyun said, “You’re a boy, and she’s a girl. Keep your distance.","“And don’t call her Xiao Wu.”","Chu Qu was dumbfounded. “What should I call her?”","Chen Ziyun said, “Anything but Xiao Wu! You can even call her Boss Xiao Wu! Understood?!”","Chu Qu nodded.","Chen Ziyun reminded everybody how to address Feng Wu correctly so that all his teammates could stay alive.","Sun Yu was confused, “Captain, are you in love with F...”","The crown prince immediately shot a glance in their direction.","Chen Ziyun felt his hair stand up.","“No! I’m not!” Chen Ziyun glared at Sun Yu. “If I have inappropriate thoughts about her, let me be condemned forever!”","Sun Yu was frightened. He didn’t understand why his captain was so serious.","Chen Ziyun whispered, “Watch your mouth! You’ll get us in trouble!”","Sun Yu didn’t quite understand what he meant, but he had a clue and glanced at the crown prince.","By then, everything was ready.","Everybody fell silent.","Chu Yun had been trying to strike up a conversation with the crown prince, but Jun Linyuan stopped her with a harsh look.","Just then, Gongsun Mu said, “Shall we start the competition now?”","Jun Linyuan nodded.","Chu Yun glanced at him. “Shouldn’t His Royal Highness be the one to make that decision?”","Gongsun Mu looked at Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan looked at the crowd, but Feng Wu was the only one he could see. He didn’t look at Chu Yun and only said, “Gongsun, you can do it.”","He knew Gongsun Mu well. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have asked Gongsun Mu to look after Feng Wu.","Gongsun Mu nodded and made the announcement. The two teams were asked to go on stage.","Chu Yun threw a dirty look at Gongsun Mu and was determined to find an opportunity to talk to the crown prince.","The audience fell silent for a brief moment after the announcement.","Then everybody cheered and applauded.","The voices went through the roof.","The audience clapped for several minutes until the two teams were ready to go on stage.","The Military Team was led by Sheng Changtian.","Dynasty Team was led by Chen Ziyun."]},{"number":2863,"title":"Chapter 2863 - Jun... (5)","paragraphs":["Chen Ziyun was the first player, followed by Feng Wu, Sun Yu, Wang Nian and Li Shaochu.","Wang Xiao used to be one of the team members. For some reason, he didn’t make any progress this time, and had to sit on the bench instead.","The junior team members were substitutes for the varsity team.","The competition would sometimes go into overtime, and the substitutes would compete instead.","Sheng Changtian was filled with excitement.","He and Chen Ziyun stood very close to each other.","Sheng Changtian seemed pleased.","He glanced at Chen Ziyun. “His Royal Highness is the referee this time.”","Chen Ziyun nodded. “I know that.”","Sheng Changtian said, “He’s the honorary president of my school.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Alright.”","Sheng Changtian glanced at him. “Do you think your breakthroughs can affect us?”","Chen Ziyun said, “So?”","Sheng Changtian said, “With His Royal Highness here, my team will definitely win!”","Chen Ziyun said, “Are you suggesting His Royal Highness will be biased toward you?”","Sheng Changtian found the question idiotic. Wasn’t that obvious?","Chen Ziyun rolled his eyes at Sheng Changtian.","Sheng Changtian said, “What’s that supposed to mean?”","Chen Ziyun offered no explanation, but he looked quite pleased.","The last thing the crown prince would do was take the Military Academy’s side.","However, Chen Ziyun was going to keep that piece of information a secret.","He wanted to see the look on Sheng Changtian’s face when he finally found out about the relationship between Feng Wu and the crown prince. It would be incredible!","Sheng Changtian frowned.","Somehow, he felt Chen Ziyun was up to something, but he couldn’t put his finger on it.","Gongsun Mu’s face darkened when he saw Chen Ziyun and Sheng Changtian whispering to each other.","Without hesitation he said, “Dynasty Team, please announce the order of your players.”","While Jun Linyuan was the chief referee, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi didn’t have anything to do, so they went to sit with Chaoge.","Chaoge was sitting with Zi Ling, Ye Han and a few others.","There were some empty seats beside her, so she waved at Feng Xun and Xuan Yi when she saw that they were looking for seats. “Over here!”","At first, the others didn’t know who she was waving at, but then, they saw Feng Xun and Xuan Yi coming their way.","Zi Ling didn’t know what to say.","Ye Han was speechless.","The other people around them also stiffened.","Young Lord Feng Xun was coming here, and so was Young Lord Xuan Yi!","They weren’t just a pair of ordinary young lords. They were the only childhood friends of the crown prince!","Their words carried more weight than that of many government officials!","“What are you doing there?” Chaoge patted the seat next to her. “These seats haven’t been taken yet. Sit down! The competition is about to begin!”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi nodded and sat down.","They had come here at the last minute, and almost all the seats had been taken. It took them a while to find Chaoge.","The school had left seats for them, but Feng Xun didn’t want to sit there. He liked to blend in and listen to the voices of the ordinary students."]},{"number":2864,"title":"Chapter 2864 - Jun... (6)","paragraphs":["Everybody was astonished. Duan Chaoge just waved her hand, and Feng Xun came over. Were they very close?","But none of them asked anything. They remained straight in their seats and kept their gazes on the stage.","In fact, they had all pricked up their ears to listen.","“Why are you all here?” Chaoge asked Feng Xun.","Ye Han was amazed. By the sound of it, Duan Chaoge seemed to be very familiar with Young Lord Feng.","She kept listening.","Feng Xun said, “Somebody heard that somebody else was going to be in the competition. You know what I mean.”","Chaoge immediately got the hint. “I see.”","But the others were confused.","They heard everything, but they understood nothing.","Who was “somebody”?","Ye Han was dumbfounded. She glanced at Chaoge before looking at Jun Linyuan again.","His Royal Highness!","He was so handsome!","His every movement looked as beautiful as a picture.","Gongsun Mu said, “Dynasty Team will announce the order of the players on the Military Team.”","The Military Academy’s section of the audience erupted in rage.","“What? Why does Dynasty Team get to decide that? There must be a mistake!”","The Imperial College students were pleased.","“Of course there’s no mistake! Your school lost the junior competition!”","The Military Academy students said, “How is that possible?!”","The Imperial College students said, “Of course it’s possible. Why do you think we’re the ones announcing the order of the players?”","The atmosphere was tense even before the competition started.","Chen Ziyun then made the announcement.","“Tang Mingjiang will be the first to compete, followed by Xun Jinyuan, Lu Qinghe, Lv Haobei, and Sheng Changtian.”","The audience frowned.","That order was from the weakest player to the strongest.","Sheng Changtian had been the first player the year before, and he had single-handedly defeated Dynasty Team.","After a lengthy discussion, that was Imperial College’s plan this year.","Why?","The audience and judges were all confused.","Even Dynasty Team didn’t understand. All the team members looked at Chen Ziyun.","Chen Ziyun shrugged. “It’s Xiao Wu’s decision.”","Chu Qu said, “Xiao Wu, what’s the reasoning behind that order?”","Having been taught a lesson by Chen Ziyun, Chu Qu had almost called Feng Wu “Boss Wu,” but he decided “Xiao Wu” sounded better.","Feng Wu said, “I just want to give everybody a chance to take part in the competition.”","Chu Qu asked, “Is that all?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s all.”","The others were speechless. On second thought, they decided Xiao Wu was too wise to make such a simple decision.","There had to be something behind it.","Everybody’s eyes lit up when they thought about the possibility.","Both teams had three Spiritual Kings. Although Dynasty Team’s were newer and weaker, they still had a chance. The team was excited.","But right at that moment!","Buzz...?","They heard the sound of fluctuating spiritual essence. It was something that had happened to Sun Yu before.","The audience stirred.","Dynasty Team grew uneasy.","The sound came from the Military Team!"]},{"number":2865,"title":"Chapter 2865 - One vs. Five (1)","paragraphs":["Everybody looked at the Military Team.","It was Xun Jinyuan, the second player. He had just become a Spiritual King.","OMG!","This shouldn’t have happened.","The Military Academy now had four Spiritual Kings!","How did that happen?","The Imperial College students felt defeated.","That was such bad news!","They lost all hope!","Four Spiritual Kings! They wouldn’t stand a chance!","In contrast, people of the Military Academy were smiling in satisfaction.","“So what if you can decide the order of our players?”","“We’re so much more capable than you. No matter how you arrange our players, we can still crush you!”","“I knew it! There’s no way we’ll lose this competition. The Military Academy is invincible!”","Some of them even started singing.","Ling Hao and his friends were furious, but they didn’t know how to retort. They could only insist that three of them could defeat four opponents.","Needless to say, their opponents sneered at them.","Meanwhile —","The competition finally began.","Tang Mingjiang was the first player from the Military Academy.","Everybody was eager to see who the Imperial College would send first.","Were they going to send Chen Ziyun, their strongest member, or Wang Nian or Li Shaochu, their weakest?","Chen Ziyun looked at Feng Wu.","He still had some say in the team when the crown prince wasn’t here. However, His Royal Highness was here now, and he seemed very protective.","Chen Ziyun didn’t have a death wish, so he waited for Feng Wu to make the decision.","The other teammates were perplexed and didn’t know why their captain wouldn’t say anything.","Chen Ziyun ignored them and only looked at Feng Wu.","He would do whatever Feng Wu told him to.","Feng Wu looked at Chen Ziyun. “Are you sure about letting me command the team?”","Chen Ziyun nodded. “Yes! You can pick whoever you want!”","Feng Wu tilted her head. “I think if we want the maximum effect, we should use the fewest number of people to defeat the most number of opponents.”","Chen Ziyun said, “Of course.”","Feng Wu said, “In that case, I’m sorry, guys.”","The others were confused.","“Why are you apologizing?”","Feng Wu said, “The Military Team is yelling about how Sheng Changtian and Lv Haobei defeated our team last year, and they’re so pleased.”","Chen Ziyun and the others were embarrassed.","It was true...","It only took the Military Team two members to defeat the Dynasty Team the previous year. It was such a humiliation.","Feng Wu said, “How do you think we should return that favor and leave them with no excuse?”","Sun Yu said, “The only way to do that is to defeat all five of them with one player!”","He knew that wasn’t possible.","Feng Wu nodded. “You’re correct!”","What?","Everybody gave her strange looks. What was that supposed to mean?","Feng Wu said, “Only one of us will fight this time. We’ll rob them of all their confidence!”"]},{"number":2866,"title":"Chapter 2866 - One vs. Five (2)","paragraphs":["WHAT?!","Everybody stared at her in disbelief.","What was she talking about?","Was she even hearing herself?","Chen Ziyun was astonished.","“Feng Wu, aren’t you a little too confident?”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry about me. I’m only apologizing because you guys probably won’t get to compete this time.”","Sun Yu said, “It’s not that, Xiao Wu. We don’t mind whether we compete or not, all the better if it can help us win, but...”","He said gingerly, “His Royal Highness is up there, and I think the Military Academy is going to slaughter us. None of us want to get beaten in front of the crown prince.”","Wang Nian and Li Shaochu nodded as well.","Feng Wu said, “That’s good.”","If it could be avoided, she would rather stay out of this competition.","However, the Military Academy was too arrogant, and she had to teach them a lesson.","Countless people had looked down on Feng Wu and questioned her capability. They said she was a good doctor and formation master, but she couldn’t fight.","Really?","Feng Wu decided to demonstrate her capability in this competition.","Gongsun Mu was urging them. “Dynasty Team, please send your first player now.”","Everybody looked in their direction and wondered who would be the first to be defeated.","Feng Wu walked up the stage.","Her red dress set off her fair skin and bright eyes. When the lower hem of her dress flapped in the wind, she looked like a fairy. No one could take their eyes off her.","Feng Wu?!","She was the first player!","Ye Han cried out, “I thought she would come out much later. She’s about the second-best player on the team. Isn’t it a bit too early now?”","The Military Academy students asked, “Who’s that? A new Spiritual King? Never heard of her before, but she’s really pretty!”","Boys were very generous when it came to pretty girls.","Feng Wu and Tang Mingjiang were both on the stage now.","Tang Mingjiang was amazed by Feng Wu’s good looks, but he soon regained his posture.","He frowned. “Isn’t it a bit too early for you to come up?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","Tang Mingjiang said, “You should be fighting a Spiritual King. That’s the fair way to play.”","Feng Wu said, “Why should I be fair to you?”","Tang Mingjiang was taken aback, but he smirked. “Even if you’re a Spiritual King, I’m still better than you!”","Feng Wu said, “We’ll see!”","She didn’t give Tang Mingjiang any chance and immediately drew out her Fallen Star Sword.","“The first stance!","“Sword of the Other World!”","Thump!","She had practiced that stance countless times in the Secret Essence Mine.","Tang Mingjiang wanted to parry the strike.","But!","He never thought that Feng Wu’s strike would be so powerful.","It was like a tightly woven net that he couldn’t break free from. The sky went dark, and thunder rumbled.","Boom!","A streak of lightning struck Tang Mingjiang.","Whoosh —","The sword left a mark on him from the top of his head all the way to his waist."]},{"number":2867,"title":"Chapter 2867 - One vs. Five (3)","paragraphs":["If the cut was any deeper, it would slice him in half.","Tang Mingjiang stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","All the audience stared at Feng Wu as well.","“That was so fast!”","“I know Tang Mingjiang is a Level 9 Spiritual Lord and Feng Wu is a Spiritual King. He’s supposed to lose, but why did he lose so soon?”","“It only took Feng Wu one strike to defeat him!”","...","All the Imperial College students were shocked.","The Military Academy students were shaken as well, but they soon recovered.","“Don’t worry about it. That’s only the first round.”","“Feng Wu must be trying to destroy our confidence. That’s why she used her most powerful strike right away.”","“That’s right! Xun Jinyuan is next. He just became a Spiritual King!”","“He’ll teach Feng Wu a lesson!”","They were all trying to intimidate Feng Wu.","The Military Academy students found her quite pretty at first. However, after seeing how fierce she was, they didn’t like her so much anymore.","Meanwhile, on the other side, Chu Yun was displeased. “Feng Wu has always been an arrogant girl, and she’s getting worse! Gongsun Mu, is that how you’ve been teaching your students?”","Chu Yun was alarmed when she saw how the crown prince couldn’t keep his eyes off Feng Wu, so she tried to slander her.","Gongsun Mu only rolled his eyes at Chu Yun and wouldn’t reply.","Chu Yun got even more frustrated. “Feng Wu stole our meal in Star Cloud Tower, and she’s fighting like this now. Who does she think she is?”","Jun Linyuan hadn’t paid much attention to Chu Yun, but she wouldn’t stop talking.","He cast a stern glance at Chu Yun.","His eyes were so dark that they looked like bottomless pits.","Chu Yun felt a chill run down her spine.","A pair of invisible hands seemed to wrap around her neck to choke her.","She was overwhelmed with fear.","What was going on?","She tentatively raised her head and stole a glance at Jun Linyuan.","She had to be mistaken.","However!","She looked into a pair of cold eyes.","She felt her blood curdle.","Chu Yun was frightened. She turned away and lowered her head.","Her mind had gone completely blank.","She had never felt so terrified before.","By then, the second round had started.","Feng Wu vs Xun Jinyuan.","The Imperial College students were concerned because Feng Wu was a girl.","The Military Academy was very confident because Xun Jinyuan was a Spiritual King.","“Even if Xun Jinyuan can’t defeat Feng Wu, he’ll still badly injure her!” Lu Qinghe said in a sorry tone.","Lv Haobei rolled his eyes. “Then you’ll defeat her without an effort! Why are you sighing?”","Lu Qinghe shook her head. “I don’t want that. I want a fair game.”"]},{"number":2868,"title":"Chapter 2868 - One vs. Five (4)","paragraphs":["Lv Haobei said, “I don’t think you’ll get what you want.”","Lu Qinghe said, “I know. Xun Jinyuan and Feng Wu should be of the same level. It’ll take them a while to finish this battle.”","He then raised his eyebrows. “I actually hope Xun Jinyuan can lose because I want to see this girl up close.”","Lv Haobei said sternly, “Lu Qinghe, this is a competition between two colleges. Stop hitting on girls!”","Lu Qinghe stuck out his tongue. “What a pity. I’m sure Xun Jinyuan won’t give me that chance.”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and Xun Jinyuan’s battle had begun.","“Sword of the Other World!” Feng Wu used the same stance.","She only knew three stances because that was all her beautiful master had taught her.","Three stances were more than enough.","Xun Jinyuan couldn’t withstand even one of them.","As soon as Feng Wu struck, Xun Jinyuan was overwhelmed by the pressure.","The shockwave spread from Feng Wu toward him.","It was as if heaven and earth had changed color.","Lu Qinghe sprang to his feet and stared at Feng Wu.","Everybody held their breaths.","It was the same stance, but it was much more powerful than when Feng Wu fought Tang Mingjiang.","The sword’s energy filled the air.","There was killing intent between the two players.","Feng Wu’s sword arrived before Xun Jinyuan had time to react.","Run!","Sensing the danger, Xun Jinyuan tried to escape.","But!","The spiritual essence surrounded him, blocking his way.","Everybody clenched their fists.","The Imperial College wondered if Feng Wu could defeat Xun Jinyuan.","The Military Academy wondered if Xun Jinyuan could dodge the strike.","As it turned out, he couldn’t.","When he turned to run, the sword hit him in the back.","Whoosh!","The tip of the sword slid across his back.","No one knew what Xun Jinyuan was wearing, but they could tell it was made of metal.","They saw something when the tip of the sword slid down his back.","Buzz —","Sparks were created from the friction of metal colliding.","Xun Jinyuan’s robe was sliced open, revealing the metal armor below.","It was made of a special metal.","Even so, the armor was almost cut in half.","Xun Jinyuan touched his back, and the armor fell off in two halves.","His forehead was covered in cold sweat.","That was so terrifying!","If it hadn’t been for the armor, he would have been cut in half.","He turned around and glared at Feng Wu.","He had exerted the power of a Spiritual King.","He had thought the two of them should be of the same level, but Feng Wu obviously had the upper hand.","However —","“Feng Wu, is that all you’ve got?” Xun Jinyuan smirked.","“After the battle with Tang Mingjiang and that strike just then, you’ve used up your spiritual essence. It’s my turn now!”","Xun Jinyuan was going to use his most lethal strike.","Lu Qinghe shook his head. “Feng Wu is doomed. Even if she can survive this, she’ll still be severely injured. Xun Jinyuan is angry, and he’s going to use his most powerful strike: Shadow!”","That was the killing strike that Xun Jinyuan was the proudest of."]},{"number":2869,"title":"Chapter 2869 - Chosen One (1)","paragraphs":["That was the killing strike that Xun Jinyuan was the proudest of.","He had practiced it countless times.","Xun Jinyuan smirked.","He believed that Feng Wu’s spiritual essence had run out, and he was still in peak condition. He was going to show Feng Wu how capable he was.","“Shadow!","“Feng Wu, you’re going to die here today!” Xun Jinyuan growled. The next second, he disappeared from the spot.","Everybody had been watching Xun Jinyuan because he said Feng Wu was going to die.","They were astonished when Xun Jinyuan disappeared.","“Where’s Xun Jinyuan?”","“How did he do that?”","“Look! There’s Xun...”","Before that student could finish, Xun Jinyuan had reappeared behind Feng Wu.","Sensing this, Feng Wu suddenly turned around.","But Xun Jinyuan wasn’t there anymore.","“On your left!”","When Feng Wu looked to her left, Xun Jinyuan was gone once more.","Xun Jinyuan was moving faster and faster.","In the end, Feng Wu seemed to be surrounded by him.","They were all afterimages left by his fast movements.","Lu Qinghe sounded sorry. “I knew it. As soon as Xun Jinyuan uses Shadow, Feng Wu is finished.”","Lv Haobei nodded. “That’s right.”","Lu Qinghe said, “I was looking forward to fighting her. It’s too bad I won’t get that chance.”","Lv Haobei nodded. “She’s pretty. I don’t think Xun Jinyuan will kill her.”","Lu Qinghe agreed. “She’s so pretty. It’ll be a pity if she’s severely wounded. I would pity her.”","They didn’t try to keep their voices down.","“Why is it a little chilly?” Lu Qinghe crossed his arms and saw that his hair was standing up.","Lv Haobei frowned. “Does your neck feel cold?”","“Yes!” Lu Qinghe nodded. “My back is cold, like Death is on me.”","They looked around but couldn’t tell why they were feeling that way. Both saw fear and bewilderment in each other’s eyes.","Was it a ghost?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was in a disadvantageous position.","Xun Jinyuan kept changing directions and striking out with his blade.","Feng Wu was busy parrying his strikes.","“Captain, what do you think?” Sun Yu asked nervously.","Chen Ziyun said casually, “She won’t lose.”","The other team members were amazed. “Why are you so sure?”","Feng Wu was obviously losing.","Chen Ziyun leaned against a column and smiled. “Even if Xun Jinyuan is better than Feng Wu, he won’t dare defeat her. Don’t worry.”","He wouldn’t dare?","Everybody was speechless.","“Why is that? Is she some sort of Chosen One?” Chu Qu asked curiously.","Chen Ziyun looked at the man that couldn’t keep his eyes off Feng Wu.","He chuckled. “That’s right. She’s the Chosen One.”"]},{"number":2870,"title":"Chapter 2870 - Chosen One (2)","paragraphs":["The Chosen One?","Everybody looked at Chen Ziyun and shook their heads.","No one believed him.","They ignored the indifferent Chen Ziyun and discussed it among themselves.","“Captain Chen is too confident. I don’t believe him.”","“That’s right. I think he’s infatuated with Feng Wu. I don’t know where he gets that kind of confidence.”","“Don’t mind him. What do you think are the chances of Feng Wu winning?” Chu Qu asked.","Sun Yu said, “30%.”","Wang Nian said, “20%.”","Li Shaochu said, “I think lower than 10%.”","Chu Qu was speechless. “You don’t have any confidence at all.”","Li Shaochu rubbed his nose. “She already defeated Tang Mingjiang; I think she’s done her job.”","He had a point.","Hence, everybody agreed that Feng Wu was going to lose.","Once they accepted that, they didn’t feel so flustered anymore.","Even her teammates felt that way, so the audience had even lower expectations.","Ye Han rubbed her hands. “I only hope Feng Wu can badly injure Xun Jinyuan before she loses. That way, the next player can defeat Xun Jinyuan.”","Feng Xun gave her a strange glance.","Ye Han asked gingerly, “My lord, did I say something wrong?”","Her coy tone gave Chaoge the creeps, and she snapped at Ye Han, “Of course you’re wrong! Xiao Wu is invincible! She’s going to defeat all five of them!”","Ye Han was speechless.","She didn’t want to talk to Chaoge anymore.","She found her confidence insufferable.","Chaoge said, “I mean it. Xiao Wu is going to defeat all five of them! Just wait and see!”","Ye Han rolled her eyes and muttered, “Stop bragging already.”","Chaoge snorted and ignored her.","Up on the stage, Feng Wu stood still and narrowed her eyes.","Xun Jinyuan was fast, but he wasn’t nearly as fast as she was.","This battle had only lasted this long because it was part of her plan.","She couldn’t reveal her real strength all at once.","Sheng Changtian was a tough enemy.","She couldn’t raise his guard.","She would show her cards one at a time. That would be much more interesting.","By now, they had exchanged ten blows.","Feng Wu had given Xun Jinyuan enough time.","While Xun Jinyuan was still jumping around like a clown, Feng Wu flipped her hand.","The next second!","Xun Jinyuan froze on the spot.","His eyes widened in disbelief.","Feng Wu had caught him by the throat with her fair fingers.","“No! That’s not possible!”","Xun Jinyuan felt his mind go blank, and he couldn’t move a muscle.","Feng Wu had rendered him immobile!"]},{"number":2871,"title":"Chapter 2871 - Chosen One (3)","paragraphs":["He had lost all strength, and almost fell to his knees.","Everybody else was as shocked as he was, if not more.","Because!","They had thought Xun Jinyuan would win.","Hadn’t Xun Jinyuan cornered Feng Wu? Wasn’t she losing?","Why?","How did Feng Wu grab Xun Jinyuan’s neck and subdue him?","The Military Team, Dynasty Team and the students of both colleges were all speechless.","Everybody seemed dumbstruck and didn’t know what to say.","Ye Han pointed at Feng Wu. “Has she really won the battle?”","No one knew how conflicted Ye Han felt.","She ran into Feng Wu on the first day of school and saw Feng Wu as an enemy because Feng Wu was too pretty.","Unfortunately, the two of them ended up in the same dormitory and had a fight...","Ye Han put a hand to her chest.","She couldn’t understand how bold she had been then. She had once been hostile toward Feng Wu.","She used to be Feng Wu’s enemy and tried to set Feng Wu up.","Ye Han buried her face in her hands and wanted to erase all those memories.","It was so embarrassing!","Chaoge was very pleased.","When the others remained silent, she was the only one who said, “He’s just one Spiritual King. Xiao Wu can fight three more!”","Everybody stared at her in amazement.","Gosh...","Why did she have to say such a thing? The three remaining players wouldn’t be as easy to handle as Xun Jinyuan!","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “I didn’t know Feng Wu was so talented.”","The crown prince finally glanced at him.","Of course his girl was talented.","However, Gongshu Hongzhu didn’t stop there.","“But she’s too arrogant. She tried to hide her real capability when fighting Xun Jinyuan. She’ll die on a real battlefield!”","Of course, Gongshu Hongzhu wasn’t going to compliment his enemy. He would only say bad things about Imperial College students.","Feng Wu’s actual quality didn’t matter. She belonged to the other team.","Gongshu Hongzhu wouldn’t treat her any other way.","He was a member of the Military Academy, so he would discredit the Imperial College students in front of the crown prince in every possible way.","He didn’t notice that the little smile on Jun Linyuan’s face had disappeared as his eyes darkened.","Gongsun Mu knew better, so he interjected, “No, she won’t die. Concealing her true power is a good thing. It means she’s more than capable enough to defeat Xun Jinyuan!”","Gongshu Hongzhu smirked. “She’s only slightly better than Xun Jinyuan. We still have three more players.”","He then glanced at the crown prince.","He wanted the crown prince to know that the Military Academy still had much more capable fighters."]},{"number":2872,"title":"Chapter 2872 - Chosen One (4)","paragraphs":["Gongshu Hongzhu wanted the crown prince to become familiar with his team. That way, many of them would become the crown prince’s guards one day.","It would be a great honor for the Military Academy.","Gongsun Mu chuckled. “I think Feng Wu is going to keep fighting. Maybe she’ll defeat all five members of your team.”","Jun Linyuan glanced at Gongsun Mu, pleased by what he said.","However, Gongshu Hongzhu laughed. “That’s the funniest thing I’ve ever heard!”","The crown prince’s face darkened.","Feng Wu was standing casually on the stage when another Military Team member showed up.","“His Royal Highness, this is Lu Qinghe. He’s the third best student in the Military Academy.” Gongshu Hongzhu tried to introduce his student.","This was a great opportunity to let the crown prince know their faces.","Jun Linyuan said grimly, “Alright.”","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “His Royal Highness, Lu Qinghe is a slim boy, but he’s known for his great strength. Just wait and see. Feng Wu won’t withstand one punch from him!”","The crown prince’s expression was livid.","Gongshu Hongzhu wanted to say more good things about Lu Qinghe, but he felt the temperature drop, and the crown prince’s eyes glinted coldly.","He cringed and stopped talking.","He thought Lu Qinghe had offended the crown prince before, and he cursed the boy in his head.","Feng Wu and Lu Qinghe faced each other on stage.","Lu Qinghe looked Feng Wu up and down.","She was very beautiful from afar. Up close, she was stunning.","Lu Qinghe was infatuated for a moment.","Feng Wu didn’t like the look in his eyes, and she frowned. “Shall we begin?”","Lu Qinghe said arrogantly, “You should give in.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","She found Lu Qinghe’s request idiotic. “What did you say?”","Lu Qinghe said, “What are you waiting for? Surrender.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Was this man dumb?","Lv Haobei told Sheng Changtian, “I didn’t know Lu Qinghe had this gentle side. He knows Feng Wu can’t defeat him, so he asked her to give in to avoid possible injury. He’s usually a very upright man. He never shows girls such courtesy.”","Sheng Changtian chuckled. “She’s pretty. That’s understandable.”","They didn’t keep their voices down, and all the cultivators heard them.","So did Feng Wu.","If she could, she would curse them with all the swear words she knew.","Many people thought Feng Wu should surrender now because she had defeated two people already. Even if she gave in, she would still earn much respect.","Even the Imperial College students felt that way.","Sun Yu also thought Feng Wu should stop while she could."]},{"number":2873,"title":"Chapter 2873 - So Proud","paragraphs":["Both Gongshu Hongzhu and Chu Yun said that if Feng Wu didn’t give in now, she would be humiliated when Lu Qinghe kicked her off the stage.","Feng Wu smiled at Lu Qinghe. “Is that what you think will happen?”","Lu Qinghe said, “I’m already being very generous.”","Feng Wu said, “There’s something else you can do.”","Lu Qinghe asked, “What’s that?”","Feng Wu punched him in the stomach. “Get out of my sight!”","Everybody was astonished!","Because!","Lu Qinghe was the team member they were so proud of, and the one they didn’t think could possibly lose.","He had even told Feng Wu to give up.","After Feng Wu hit him, he flew backward like a broken kite.","It almost looked like something in a slow-motion video.","Everybody’s mouths fell open when they saw Lu Qinghe fly off the stage.","The Military Team, Dynasty Team, and the students of both schools were astonished.","They had been shocked when Xun Jinyuan lost; now, they didn’t know what to say.","All eyes were on Lu Qinghe.","They saw Lu Qinghe fly off the stage and over the audience toward the wall at the back.","Thump!","They only realized what had happened when Lu Qinghe smashed into the wall.","It really happened!","The battle was over!","Gongshu Hongzhu almost jumped to his feet.","Jun Linyuan casually said, “Did you say he’s the third best student in your school?”","Gongshu Hongzhu didn’t know what to say.","He froze on the spot and didn’t know if he should cry or not.","“He... He’s not...”","He was too astonished to respond to the crown prince’s sarcasm.","Only then did the students realize what had happened.","“OMG!”","“Feng Wu!”","“Am I seeing things? Did that really happen?”","“Lu Qinghe was defeated without making a move!”","Students of the Military Academy wanted to cry.","They had thought that Feng Wu would defeat Xun Jinyuan at most, and Lu Qinghe would win the battle without breaking a sweat.","They didn’t know how to react now.","It was as if Feng Wu had punched them in the face, too.","In contrast to their reactions, the screams of the Imperial College students went through the roof.","“ Roar — ”","They howled like wolves.","They were so excited!","It was so inspiring!","Unlike when she fought Xun Jinyuan, Feng Wu defeated Lu Qinghe with one punch!","“Bravo!”","“Feng Wu is the best!”","“Feng Wu is invincible!”","“Feng Wu...”","...","All the cheering wasn’t enough to express their excitement. They itched to run onto the stage and toss Feng Wu up and down in the air."]},{"number":2874,"title":"Chapter 2874 - Archenemy","paragraphs":["Gongsun Mu was so proud! Feng Wu did a great job!","Recalling how the Military Academy had humiliated them the year before, he smiled even more widely.","However, he feigned a modest tone. “That’s nothing, really. Xiao Wu’s punch came a little too fast, and your third-best student was half a second too late. If he had reacted a little faster, Xiao Wu wouldn’t have defeated him so easily. Right?”","Gongshu Hongzhu threw a dirty look at Gongsun Mu. That man was obviously showing off how fast and clever Feng Wu was!","Gongsun Mu cleared his throat. “Well, you still have more players. There’s no need to get upset.”","Chu Yun glared at him. “Gongsun Mu, you’re very talkative today! You’re so happy, aren’t you?!”","Gongsun Mu used to be terrified of Chu Yun when they were married, but this time, he grinned. “Well, I’m in a great mood today.”","Chu Yun ground her teeth. Gongsun Mu had changed! He wasn’t as obedient as before! Had he stopped loving her?","At that moment, someone jumped out of his seat and ran out of the arena.","It was none other than Qiu Zeyu.","No one knew how complicated his feelings were.","He hated his former teammates, especially Chen Ziyun. However, he also burned with jealousy when he saw how all the team members had made progress because of Feng Wu.","He had thought he would get his revenge when the competition started. He wanted Imperial College to lose. He wanted to see Feng Wu die.","Reality slapped him in the face over and over again.","He watched as Feng Wu defeated Tang Mingjiang, Xun Jinyuan and Lu Qinghe.","Qiu Zeyu couldn’t sit still anymore.","He needed to see Zuo Qingluan.","He knew Zuo Qingluan and Feng Wu were archenemies, and he believed that Zuo Qingluan had to know a way to handle Feng Wu.","He ran as fast as he could.","Finally, he found Zuo Qingluan in her garden.","“Miss Zuo! Miss Zuo!”","Qiu Zeyu was panting from all the running.","Zuo Qingluan frowned. She was cultivating, and no one was allowed to disturb her.","She was going to throw Qiu Zeyu out, when he shouted, “Feng Wu is going to win!”","What?","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened.","She knew the competition was taking place, but she didn’t have any interest in watching it.","She was a vice-chief of the academy and was too important to attend such a competition.","Moreover, Gongsun Mu hadn’t invited her, so she simply ignored the event.","“What did you say?” Zuo Qingluan opened the door with a wave of her sleeve.","Qiu Zeyu rushed in and shouted, “Miss Zuo, I have bad news! Feng Wu has defeated Tang Mingjiang, Xun Jinyuan, and Lu Qinghe! She’s getting all the attention!”","He knew how Zuo Qingluan would react since she was someone who got jealous over the smallest thing."]},{"number":2875,"title":"Chapter 2875 - Feng Wu Is Prettier","paragraphs":["As Feng Wu’s archenemy, of course Zuo Qingluan couldn’t live with that.","It was incredible!","Zuo Qingluan didn’t plan to intervene, but when she heard Feng Wu’s name, she became very displeased.","She stared at Qiu Zeyu. “Keep talking.”","Qiu Zeyu said, “Feng Wu has defeated Tang Mingjiang, Xun Jinyuan and Lu Qinghe!”","Zuo Qingluan rolled her eyes at him.","She knew the level of all three students and had some idea of Feng Wu’s level because she had fought her before. It didn’t surprise her that Feng Wu had defeated the three boys.","“Is that it?” Zuo Qingluan asked indifferently.","She didn’t watch the competition because she didn’t want to see Feng Wu win.","Qiu Zeyu was taken aback.","Was that news not enough to persuade Miss Zuo?","Fine!","Qiu Zeyu played his last card. “His Royal Highness is here, too!”","Zuo Qingluan paled.","“His Royal Highness? Are you sure?” Her face went livid.","She didn’t want to see Feng Wu win, but what if Jun Linyuan saw it? He already was... No! He didn’t like Feng Wu at all! Feng Wu just wouldn’t leave His Royal Highness alone!","What if His Royal Highness really fell in love with Feng Wu after seeing her fight? Zuo Qingluan had a bad feeling.","No!","She sprang to her feet, her face dark.","“When did His Royal Highness come?” she asked hurriedly.","Qiu Zeyu knew he had caught Zuo Qingluan’s attention.","“His Royal Highness has been there since Feng Wu’s first battle. His eyes lit up every time Feng Wu won!”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","Qiu Zeyu glanced at her and added, “What if she can defeat Lv Haobei and Sheng Changtian?","“Feng Wu bragged that she would defeat all five players of the Military Academy. If that really happens, she’ll be so popular among the students!","“Moreover, His Royal Highness is watching, too. He’s your fiance now, but what if he falls in love with Feng Wu?”","Qiu Zeyu tried to prod Zuo Qiangluan into action.","“I’m sorry to say this, but Feng Wu is prettier.”","“Shut up!”","Zuo Qingluan waved her hand, and Qiu Zeyu smashed into the wall. He fell to the ground and spat out a mouthful of blood.","Zuo Qingluan glared at Qiu Zeyu as if she was going to kill him.","The intimidating power made Qiu Zeyu’s heart beat fast, and he didn’t dare say a word.","Zuo Qingluan took out a dagger.","The blade glinted in the sunlight.","Qiu Zeyu paled.","He was terrified.","Was Zuo Qingluan going to kill him?","He had only been telling the truth. Zuo Qingluan wasn’t as pretty as Feng Wu.","No, he shouldn’t have said that.","Was he going to die?","He was about to beg for mercy, when Zuo Qingluan made her move.","Instead of attacking Qiu Zeyu, she slid the blade across her palm."]},{"number":2876,"title":"Chapter 2876 - You Must Lose","paragraphs":["Qiu Zeyu stared at Zuo Qingluan in astonishment.","She...","What was she doing?","Zuo Qingluan filled a small porcelain vial with her blood.","The vial was only the size of her pinkie.","The color of the blood could be seen through the walls of the vial. It was as if the vial was on fire.","It was such a strange scene that Qiu Zeyu felt uneasy.","“This is the True Phoenix Blood.” Zuo Qingluan handed the vial to Qiu Zeyu. “It’ll give the drinker a brief energy boost.","“Sheng Changtian knows how to use it.","“Give it to him. He’ll know what to do when the time comes.” Zuo Qingluan sounded both indifferent and confident.","Sheng Changtian knew how to use it. Had Zuo Qingluan always been in touch with Sheng Changtian? Did they have a deal?","Qiu Zeyu felt he had been brought in on a secret.","Zuo Qingluan glanced at Qiu Zeyu. “If a fourth person knows about this...”","Qiu Zeyu raised his hand. “I swear on my life, I won’t tell anybody!”","Zuo Qingluan nodded and said proudly, “You know what will happen.”","Qiu Zeyu’s stomach fell.","He regretted his decision and wondered if he had done the right thing by coming to Zuo Qingluan.","Somehow, he felt he had gotten himself into trouble.","He was going to leave, when Zuo Qingluan’s voice rang out behind him.","“Stop!”","Qiu Zeyu froze.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t say anything at first, as if she was weighing something in her mind. Finally, she made up her mind.","She took a phoenix-shaped jade pendant out of her pocket and gave it to Qiu Zeyu.","Qiu Zeyu was perplexed.","Zuo Qingluan said, “Tell Sheng Changtian that he owes me a big favor!”","Was this pendant so powerful? Qiu Zeyu looked at it in bewilderment. It looked like an ordinary object. Why was it a big favor?","“Put a drop of True Phoenix Blood on the pendant, and it’ll wake the thing inside,” Zuo Qingluan explained.","Qiu Zeyu nodded and left right away.","He wanted to get back before the battle ended.","Zuo Qingluan smiled as she watched Qiu Zeyu leave.","“Jun Linyuan, you care about Feng Wu so much.","“In that case, you can watch her die!","“It won’t feel so good unless you’re there when it happens!”","Zuo Qingluan closed the door behind her and strolled toward the arena.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and Lv Haobei were standing on the stage.","Lv Haobei had a stern look on his face.","“I didn’t see this coming. I never thought you could defeat three people in a row.”","Feng Wu nodded. “You’re going to be even more surprised.”","Lv Haobei grinned. “No, you will definitely lose this time.”","Feng Wu said, “Is that so?”"]},{"number":2877,"title":"Chapter 2877 - What a Shame","paragraphs":["Lv Haobei said, “I became a Spiritual King last year. I don’t think you’ve been a Spiritual King for that long.”","Feng Wu said, “Less than three days.”","Lv Haobei said, “Have you learned the skills yet?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","Lv Haobei said, “Have you stabilized your cultivation level yet?”","Feng Wu said, “No.”","Lv Haobei said, “How are you going to win against me, then?”","Feng Wu said, “Are you here to talk or to fight?”","The audience laughed.","“Feng Wu seems impatient.”","“She must be. I would be impatient, too, if Lv Haobei keeps on nagging.”","“Shut up! He’s a Spiritual King!”","“That’s right. How strange! I used to think Spiritual Kings are so powerful, but after Feng Wu defeated three Spiritual Kings from the Military Academy, I don’t respect them as much as before.”","“Didn’t they say the Military Academy was going to win? I think Imperial College has a better chance of winning now.”","The audience didn’t try to keep their voices down.","Lv Haobei heard them.","He used to be treated like a genius, and his face turned scarlet red when he heard those words.","He stared at Feng Wu with eyes filled with hatred.","Feng Wu shrugged. “I’m not laughing at you.”","Lv Haobei was furious. She wasn’t laughing, but her indifference was worse.","“Feng Wu, I was going to show you some mercy, but if you have a death wish, I’ll give you what you want!” Lv Haobei then made his move.","He was good at swordplay.","His sword was called Thunder, and he had mastered the sword energy.","The sky was filled with rampant lightning.","Lv Haobei pointed the sword at Feng Wu.","“The thunder element!” Ye Han put a hand to her chest. “It’s the most useful element in battle and the hardest to master. Is Feng Wu going to be alright?”","Although Feng Wu had won three battles in a row, the others all attributed it to luck.","They didn’t think Feng Wu could defeat Lv Haobei.","The Dynasty Team had lost miserably to Lv Haobei’s Thunder the year before. It was so humiliating.","The memory was still fresh.","They would never forget it!","“Feng Wu, watch out!”","Seeing the lightning rush toward Feng Wu, the students were so nervous that they held their breaths.","Some even shouted, “Feng Wu, you’ve already done a great job! Just give up! You’re not Lv Haobei’s match!”","Many Imperial College students chimed in.","They weren’t shooting Feng Wu down, but were worried about her.","Chu Yun rubbed her chin and nodded. “I knew it. Feng Wu will lose as soon as Lv Haobei attacks. She’s so much weaker than Lv Haobei.”","Jun Linyuan smirked inwardly.","Chu Yun went on, having no idea what the crown prince was thinking. “Three strikes. Feng Wu will be defeated within three strikes, and Lv Haobei will leave some marks on her.”","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “Feng Wu should consider herself lucky if she can come out of this alive. What a shame. Her pretty face is going to be destroyed by Thunder.”","He glanced at Jun Linyuan as he spoke."]},{"number":2878,"title":"Chapter 2878 - Why?!","paragraphs":["“Your Royal Highness, don’t you agree with me?”","Jun Linyuan looked at Gongshu Hongzhu as if he was looking at a dead man.","The energy in his dark eyes was as lethal as the sharpest blade.","Gongshu Hongzhu didn’t know what to say.","He rubbed his neck, feeling uneasy.","When he looked at the crown prince, he thought that he saw a smirk on his face.","An idea suddenly struck Gongshu Hongzhu.","Was His Royal Highness in love with Feng Wu?","No...","No!","Gongshu Hongzhu then recalled the rumor he had heard before. His Royal Highness was supposed to be madly in love with Zuo Qingluan, the sacred lady of the Firmament Palace. Feng Wu was just a nobody.","He calmed down and wiped off the cold sweat on his forehead.","When he looked at the battle again, he thought he was going to have a heart attack.","Because!","Lv Haobei was losing!","Feng Wu was attacking!","When Gongshu Hongzhu looked up, Feng Wu just happened to strike out.","“Star and Moon!","“Thunder and Soul!","“Die!”","The thunder element?","What Feng Wu used was the real thunder element.","The Fallen Star Sword struck Lv Haobei while everybody watched.","Shit!","Sheng Changtian had been sitting idly in his seat, but he sprang to his feet when he saw this.","He wasn’t the only one who had that reaction.","Even Chu Yun jumped to her feet.","Her face went very pale.","Because they were more capable, they knew the result earlier than the others.","The audience were all looking nervously at the Fallen Star Sword.","They wondered if it would hit Lv Haobei.","Lv Haobei looked astonished.","He then panicked.","Yes, he did.","The sword energy was terrifying.","Where did Feng Wu learn her skills? Why were there streaks of lightning around her sword?","The rumbling sound suffocated Lv Haobei.","He couldn’t believe it!","Feng Wu had been using the fire element before this.","If Lv Haobei were to lose, he had expected to be defeated by fire.","However, Feng Wu suddenly switched to the thunder element, and was even stronger than Lv Haobei.","Run!","That was his first reaction.","However, the lightning had formed a web in the air.","The crackling noise filled the air.","Lv Haobei looked up and was terrified.","That was a scary lightning web!","The web grew bigger, but it wasn’t coming down.","Lv Haobei looked at Feng Wu.","Amidst the lightning flashes, she looked very fair.","Her dress flapped in the air.","She closed her eyes and pointed her sword at the sky.","The energy surged and was injected into the lightning web. Even the sky shook.","So did the air and the ground.","Lv Haobei was no longer panicking, only because he was terrified.","It felt like a sword was hanging above his head, and he didn’t know when it would fall.","“How is that even possible?!”","Chu Yun smacked the table, her lips trembling. “Why? Why can she do that?! She...”"]},{"number":2879,"title":"Chapter 2879 - Gongsun Mu, You’re Dead","paragraphs":["Chu Yun smacked the table, her lips trembling. “Why? Why can she do that?! She...”","Why could she do that?","How could she force Lv Haobei’s hand? That was Lv Haobei!","One of the best students of the Military Academy!","He was the second-best student in the academy.","“No, Lv Haobei must have more cards up his sleeve. He can turn things around! I’m sure of it!” Chu Yun tried to cheer herself up.","Gongshu Hongzhu also nodded. “Don’t worry. This is only temporary. Lv Haobei won’t lose! How can he lose to such a girl?”","“Such a girl? What girl?” The crown prince had kept silent until now.","He spoke in an indifferent tone, as if he didn’t care about anything they were talking about.","Indifferent?","Behind the crown prince, Feng rolled his eyes.","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “Your Royal Highness, I remember who the girl is!","“She’s Feng Wu, the girl who destroyed her own cultivation because she was too greedy!","“I don’t know what happened, but she’s cultivating again. It doesn’t matter because her character won’t take her very far.","“Even if she begs us to become a student of the Military Academy, we won’t take her. Right?”","Feng rolled his eyes again.","This Gongshu Hongzhu had no idea how much danger he was in.","The crown prince stared at Gongshu Hongzhu and smiled coldly.","Gongshu Hongzhu was confused. Somehow, he felt the crown prince didn’t like him very much.","He had been trying so hard to please the crown prince. What should he do now?","He was still trying to figure out his next move, when a loud thump made him jump.","He looked in the direction of the noise.","Holy crap!","A streak of lightning struck right down at Lv Haobei.","“This can’t be happening!” Gongshu Hongzhu smacked the table. “It’s not that fast! Why couldn’t Lv Haobei get away?”","Gongsun Mu offered a kind reminder. “Our Xiao Wu used Ground Control so that Lv Haobei can’t move. He can only watch the lightning fall on him.”","Ground Control?","Gongshu Hongzhu’s stomach lurched. “Isn’t that a lost skill? Why does she know it? Doesn’t Ground Control use the earth element? Isn’t she fire and thunder? How...”","Gongsun Mu couldn’t hide the satisfaction in his voice. “The earth element is nothing. If our Xiao Wu wants to, she can master all the elements!”","Gongshu Hongzhu didn’t believe a word of it.","Just then, the crown prince glanced at Gongsun Mu. “Your Xiao Wu?”","Gongsun Mu burst out in a cold sweat.","He had been careless!","He was over the moon after seeing Feng Wu win four times in a row, and he had forgotten a certain thing.","He immediately said, “No, yours.”","Feng gave Gongsun Mu the thumbs up for his fast reaction.","Gongshu Hongzhu, who had no idea what was going on, smirked. “Gongsun Mu, you’re dead!”"]},{"number":2880,"title":"Chapter 2880 - Is Feng Wu His Royal Highness’s","paragraphs":["Gongshu Hongzhu was so loud that everybody nearby looked at him instead of Feng Wu.","“I’m dead?”","Gongsun Mu looked at Gongshu Hongzhu in bewilderment.","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “What did you say? You said Feng Wu is His Royal Highness’s? Gongsun Mu, you’ve just committed a capital crime!”","Gongsun Mu said, “What did I do?”","Gongshu Hongzhu said righteously, “Don’t you know that her engagement to His Royal Highness was annulled?”","Gongsun Mu said, “I do, but...”","Gongshu Hongzhu cut him off. “Do you know what that means? It means His Royal Highness doesn’t like Feng Wu! No, he detests her!”","The crown prince was furious!","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “Moreover, have you thought about the other young lady? She’s going to be the crown prince’s future wife!”","The crown prince himself had no idea what he was talking about.","Gongshu Hongzhu said arrogantly, “You just said Feng Wu belongs to His Royal Highness. You should kneel and apologize!”","Gongsun Mu was speechless.","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “His Royal Highness hasn’t killed you because he’s noble and lenient, but I can’t let this go!”","Jun Linyuan was astonished!","There was no expression on his face, but he felt like an erupting volcano inside.","Feng wanted to give Gongshu Hongzhu the thumbs up.","That sycophant was surprisingly unyielding now.","Normally, Feng would have intervened and kicked Gongshu Hongzhu out, but he didn’t do so.","He pretended he hadn’t heard anything.","He wanted to see if the proud crown prince would finally admit that Feng Wu was his fiancee.","Feng couldn’t see Jun Linyuan’s face from his angle, so he quietly moved around until he could see Jun Linyuan’s profile.","Meanwhile, Jun Linyuan gave Feng a stern look.","Feng was speechless.","He thought, “Your Royal Highness, why is it so hard for you to openly admit who the girl is to you?”","Jun Linyuan’s earlobes turned pink, and his lips parted.","Feng was thrilled.","Yes!","Finally, he was going to say something!","Do it!","Feng could hardly control his excitement when he heard footsteps.","He ignored them and kept his gaze on the crown prince. It would be such a shame to let this opportunity go to waste.","Nobody as dumb as Gongshu Hongzhu would appear again!","The footsteps moved closer and closer.","“Miss Qingluan is here!”","“Is she here to watch the competition?”","“I heard she’s the real fiancee of His Royal Highness!”","“She’s going to humiliate Feng Wu! I’m so nervous!”","Gongshu Hongzhu looked up to find Zuo Qingluan strutting toward them.","“Miss Zuo! Sacred lady Qingluan!” He waved at Zuo Qingluan in excitement.","Zuo Qingluan couldn’t take her eyes off Jun Linyuan, and moved toward him without knowing it.","Gongshu Hongzhu asked the question everybody wanted to ask.","“Miss Qingluan, is Feng Wu His Royal Highness’s fiancee?”"]},{"number":2881,"title":"Chapter 2881 - I Don’t Believe You","paragraphs":["The entire arena became dead silent.","Everybody on and off the stage turned to look at Zuo Qingluan.","Even the crown prince gave Zuo Qingluan a grim look.","Feng was secretly amused.","His Royal Highness had been too shy to answer that question when he had the chance. Now that Miss Zuo was here, things would become very interesting.","Feng sighed inwardly that Granny Gong wasn’t here to watch it.","Many students of the Military Academy in the audience looked at Zuo Qingluan and were amazed by her ethereal beauty.","“She has perfect posture. No wonder she’s the sacred lady of Firmament Palace!”","“Feng Wu has been calling herself the fiancee of His Royal Highness. The real one is here now, and she’s going to be humiliated!”","“Yes, she might have won four battles in a row, but it doesn’t matter how capable she is. His Royal Highness’s wife is the real winner!”","Tang Mingjiang, Xun Jinyuan, Lv Haobei and Lu Qinghe had been so upset that they wanted to cry, but now, they all cheered up.","Yes, it was a humiliation to lose all the battles, but they wouldn’t feel so ashamed if Feng Wu suffered a bigger humiliation.","They all gave Zuo Qingluan eager looks.","“Say it! Turn Feng Wu into a joke!”","Zuo Qingluan only stood there and seemed embarrassed.","Fans of the Dynasty Team reacted differently.","Chu Qu said, “Why is she here now? She sure knows how to pick her timing!”","Sun Yu said with a grimace, “Xiao Wu finally won four battles, and she’s never been as popular as at this moment. If Zuo Qingluan tells the truth, it’ll destroy Feng Wu’s confidence.”","Other people were also worried about Feng Wu’s feelings.","Only Chen Ziyun gave them a strange look.","“Why are you whining? Xiao Wu is obviously going to be the winner in the end.” He was rather looking forward to Zuo Qingluan’s reply.","The others glanced at their captain and turned away.","Their captain was so naive that none of them would believe him.","In the audience, Ye Han put a hand to her chest. “I’m so nervous! What should we do now? Chaoge, what should we do?!”","Chaoge glanced at her. “What do you mean?”","“The engagement!” Ye Han panicked. “Isn’t the rumor that Feng Wu is His Royal Highness’s fiancee? Zuo Qingluan is here to clear things up, and His Royal Highness is here, too! They’re going to turn Feng Wu into a laughingstock!”","Chaoge wanted to roll her eyes. “And where did you get that idea?”","Ye Han said, “Feng Wu isn’t His Royal Highness’s fiancee!”","Chaoge said, “She is.”","Ye Han said, “Zuo Qingluan is the fiancee!”","Chaoge said, “No, she isn’t.”","Ye Han said, “Are you sure? Are you saying that Feng Wu is the fiancee? Is that true?”","Chaoge said, “Yes.”","Ye Han said, “Like I’m going to believe you.”"]},{"number":2882,"title":"Chapter 2882 - His Royal Highness’s Thoughts","paragraphs":["Chaoge was speechless.","Ye Han said, “I’m so nervous. Why is Zuo Qingluan here? Can’t she say it in private? Xiao Wu will be so embarrassed!”","Chaoge was speechless.","Meanwhile, Gongshu Hongzhu felt he had waited long enough, so he asked Zuo Qingluan again, “Miss Qingluan, what’s the matter? Do you have some scruples?”","He thought, “Please tell everybody you’re the crown prince’s fiancee!”","While all the people were looking at Zuo Qingluan, she was looking at Jun Linyuan.","Would he tell the truth?","If he made that announcement...","But he hadn’t said anything.","Did that mean he wasn’t sure about Feng Wu?","I still have a chance! Yes! That must be it!","At that thought, Zuo Qingluan smiled at Gongshu Hongzhu. “How about we wait until the competition is over?”","Gongshu Hongzhu could only smile wryly. “Miss Qingluan, you’re such a kind woman. That’s so rare these days.”","Kind? Feng Wu shook her head.","Zuo Qingluan had drawn the most attention, so few people were watching Feng Wu.","They all thought Zuo Qingluan was the crown prince’s fiancee, a title everybody envied.","Feng Wu turned to Sheng Changtian. “Your turn.”","Sheng Changtian sat quietly in his seat.","He had been trying to figure out how Feng Wu had won four battles in a row.","After replaying everything in his head, he still couldn’t come up with an answer.","Hence...","He raised his hand. “I request a time-out for an hour.”","The audience murmured.","A time-out?","Last year, Imperial College had asked for a time-out after each battle just to throw Military Academy into confusion, but it still couldn’t change the outcome. What was Sheng Changtian doing now?","The chief referee would decide if the request was granted.","Usually, there wouldn’t be any problem, so Gongshu Hongzhu wasn’t worried at all.","He looked at Jun Linyuan in expectation. “Your Royal Highness, since Sheng Changtian...”","Asking for the crown prince’s opinion was only a formality. When the crown prince gave permission, Gongshu Hongzhu would announce the time-out.","To Gongshu Hongzhu’s astonishment, the crown prince suddenly snorted and spoke.","“Denied.”","What?","The other people were as surprised as Gongshu Hongzhu was.","Denied?","Why?","They didn’t even know that was possible.","Only Feng knew the answer.","He thought, “You fools have no idea what’s going on in His Royal Highness’s head.”","He knew, but he wouldn’t tell anybody.","He had a feeling that the engagement wouldn’t be a secret for much longer.","Gongshu Hongzhu was dazed and gave the crown prince a pleading look. However, he knew there was no room for negotiation once the crown prince made up his mind.","Gongshu Hongzhu turned to Sheng Changtian and said sternly, “Let the last round begin.”","He believed Sheng Changtian was capable enough to defeat all five opponents, and starting the battle earlier wouldn’t change anything.","Sheng Changtian clenched the object in his hand.","Qiu Zeyu had given it to him when everybody was looking at Zuo Qingluan."]},{"number":2883,"title":"Chapter 2883","paragraphs":["He had wanted to communicate with Zuo Qingluan, but it seemed he wouldn’t get that chance.","Realizing he was working with the future wife of the crown prince, Sheng Changtian was very pleased.","In that case...","He rose to his feet and walked onto the stage.","He had so many cards up his sleeve that he felt he could easily defeat Feng Wu.","He replayed all of Feng Wu’s moves in his head and he believed he could win the battle without breaking a sweat.","“Sheng Changtian, take them down, all five of them!”","While Sheng Changtian was walking up to the stage, the Military Academy students cheered loudly.","Sheng Changtian was full of confidence.","He raised his hand and gestured downward. Immediately, the Military Academy students quieted down.","Not everybody could do that.","The next second!","Sheng Changtian raised his fist. “Victory belongs to the Military Academy!”","Wow!","The silence was broken by the excited Military Academy students. They applauded and roared at the top of their lungs.","“Victory belongs to the Military Academy!”","“Victory belongs to the Military Academy!”","“Victory belongs to the Military Academy!”","Confidence was written all over their faces.","They believed Sheng Changtian would lead their school to victory.","He would bring glory to them all.","Gongshu Hongzhu was also thrilled.","He turned to Jun Linyuan and said excitedly, “Your Royal Highness, that’s Sheng Changtian, our top student! He’s amazing! Last year, he crushed Imperial College’s team and brought glory to our school!”","“Our school?” Gongsun Mu didn’t like the sound of that. The crown prince was a graduate of Imperial College, not the Military Academy!","Jun Linyuan’s face remained expressionless.","Gongshu Hongzhu went on. “Sheng Changtian is a peak Level 1 Spiritual King and can rise to Level 2 at any moment.","“Last year on the battlefield, he took down ten cultivators of his level all at once.","“After a year, he’s much stronger than before!","“Your Royal Highness, Sheng Changtian will bring victory to the Military Academy once more! Feng Wu will never be his match!","“I have a request!”","Everybody looked at him.","What request?","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “One never knows what will happen in a fight. Anyone can get injured easily, especially now!”","Jun Linyuan said, “Shut up!”","Gongshu Hongzhu said, “Your Royal Highness, I...” He hadn’t said what the request was yet.","Feng cast a stern look at him. “Elder Gongshu, you want them to sign a disclaimer so that neither is responsible for killing the other, don’t you?”","Gongshu Hongzhu was shocked. How did the man know?","Feng was very direct. “Sheng Changtian can die, but if anything happens to Miss Feng Wu, well...”","Gongshu Hongzhu was furious. What did he mean by that? Of course Sheng Changtian couldn’t die! He was the treasure of the Military Academy!","Feng said, “Elder Gongshu, I think you should talk less.”","Gongshu Hongzhu was speechless. What was happening? Why were all his requests turned down? It was so humiliating!","He rubbed his head and felt something was off. What was it?"]},{"number":2884,"title":"Chapter 2884 - Killing Moves","paragraphs":["He carefully recalled everything that had happened today.","He was sure he would be able to find out what went wrong.","Meanwhile, Sheng Changtian was talking to Feng Wu and didn’t notice what was going on with the referees.","He stretched out his hands and clapped.","“Good job, Miss Feng Wu, I’m impressed,” he said in a condescending tone. “I thought you were only a junior member at first. I guess everybody makes mistakes sometimes.”","Feng Wu said, “You make a lot more mistakes than that.”","Sheng Changtian stared at Feng Wu for a while before he suddenly chuckled and shook his head. “They were right. You don’t take compliments well.”","Feng Wu said, “They?”","Sheng Changtian said, “Did you think I was just sitting there while you were fighting? In fact, I’ve found out everything about you.”","Feng Wu asked, “Is that so?”","Sheng Changtian said, “I’ve collected all the information on you. I know your most powerful stances, the elements you excel in, your defense ability, and your other fields of specialty.”","He felt very satisfied.","Zuo Qingluan was an excellent partner.","She had gotten Qiu Zeyu to deliver all that information.","A person who knew their enemy well was invincible.","Sheng Changtian thought he had seen through Feng Wu and could easily defeat her.","Feng Wu looked at him. “What information can you possibly collect in such a short time? Don’t make me laugh.”","Sheng Changtian said, “Young lady, I know a lot more than you think. For instance, I know the formations and medicines you’re good at.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “Who told you that?”","Sheng Changtian lowered his voice. “Take a wild guess.”","Zuo Qingluan frowned and thought, “Sheng Changtian, do you have a death wish?”","Sheng Changtian felt a chill run down his spine. It suddenly occurred to him that Zuo Qingluan was the crown prince’s future wife, which meant he could get to know the crown prince through her.","At that thought, he stared at Feng Wu, the girl Zuo Qingluan hated.","“You’re very brave,” he said. “You know you’re going to lose, but you’re still going to fight me. I admire your courage.”","Feng Wu said, “You talk too much. Let’s begin!”","She charged at him right after that.","Striking first would help her gain the upper hand.","“Will Feng Wu win?” Chu Qu asked Sun Yu nervously.","Sun Yu said, “What do you think?”","Chu Qu shook his head. “I think there’s no hope at all.”","Everybody turned to Chen Ziyun. “Ziyun, what about you? Do you think Feng Wu will win?”","Chen Ziyun had always been the most optimistic one, but even he hesitated this time. “Maybe?”","Sun Yu said, “If even you aren’t sure, then she’s definitely going to lose.”","Chu Qu said, “Feng Wu is only a junior Level 1 Spiritual King, but Sheng Changtian is a peak Level 1 Spiritual King. There’s almost an entire level between them.”","By then, Feng Wu had exchanged 99 blows with Sheng Changtian.","All her stances were killing moves.","Feng Wu’s face was cold and stern, whereas Sheng Changtian was fighting with just one hand.","Even then, his movements looked unhurried. One hand was enough to fend off his opponent."]},{"number":2885,"title":"Chapter 2885 - Did She Lose? (1)","paragraphs":["100 blows.","200.","300!","Sheng Changtian still kept a hand behind his back and showed no sign of losing ground.","That was how capable he was.","“Sheng Changtian is going to win!” Sun Yu said anxiously. “He’s only using half of his power, while Feng Wu is giving all she has. Even so, Sheng Changtian still has the upper hand.”","The others realized that as well.","Chen Ziyun nodded. “Who’s going up there when Feng Wu comes back?”","Sun Yu said, “They only have Sheng Changtian left, and we still have four players. I think the strongest should go first to stall him, then...”","Chu Qu said, “That won’t work. Sheng Changtian is too powerful to be stalled. We can’t exhaust him that way.”","They all fell silent.","That was right...","Winning this battle was next to impossible.","Defeating the Military Academy was much harder than that.","Feng Wu was still losing ground, and Sheng Changtian was trying to corner her.","Everybody thought Feng Wu was going to lose.","Chu Yun was gloating, and Gongshu Hongzhu was extremely excited.","They all waited to see Sheng Changtian kick Feng Wu off the stage and end her winning streak.","However...","They waited and waited, but that still didn’t happen.","Feng Wu was still fighting.","Although her opponent had the upper hand, she was faster and nimbler. Sheng Changtian barely left any marks on her.","He couldn’t kick her off the stage either.","The audience was surprised.","Feng Wu was so persistent!","Ye Han was amazed. “She’s still standing! How did she dodge all those attacks?”","For the last hour, no one had looked away from the pair that was fighting.","They finally realized a stunning fact.","Although Feng Wu was weaker than Sheng Changtian, she could always spot an opportunity.","Whenever she had the chance, she would attack. After that, she would go back to dodging his blows.","Was she stalling?","Sheng Changtian felt so annoyed.","He said, “You know you’re going to lose, but you just won’t give up. I don’t know where you find that courage.”","Feng Wu said firmly, “I’m going to win.”","Sheng Changtian laughed. “That’s the funniest thing I’ve ever heard. Feng Wu, if you win, you can have my head!”","He made his move after that.","A ball of fire appeared in his hand, and it soon spread on the ground.","He and Feng Wu were then trapped inside a ring of fire.","Sheng Changtian said, “This is a fighting ring. You have nowhere to run now – let the real battle begin!”","He opened his palm, and a sword landed in his right palm.","“It’s White Flame!”","That was one of the Military Academy students.","“Feng Wu has forced Sheng Changtian to use White Flame. I’m impressed.” Lv Haobei said arrogantly, “Feng Wu is dead!”","Lu Qinghe nodded as well. “Changtian is finally getting serious.”","Tang Mingjiang said, “Once the ring is drawn, Feng Wu can’t jump around like a flea anymore. She has to stay in the ring. There’s nowhere to go!”","The Imperial College students grew anxious."]},{"number":2886,"title":"Chapter 2886 - Did She Lose? (2)","paragraphs":["Had Sheng Changtian been playing with Feng Wu until now?","He had the upper hand earlier when he played around with Feng Wu. What would happen to her when he turned serious?","It was so scary!","Sheng Changtian had indeed turned serious.","White flames spurted out from the tip of his sword.","They surged into the sky like a shooting star.","“Anything can happen during a battle. I won’t say sorry if I destroy your pretty face.” Sheng Changtian finally realized how capable Feng Wu was.","He no longer treated her as a weak girl, but as a real opponent.","He took her seriously now.","“Nine Wings!” He struck out with his sword.","Endless sword energy charged at Feng Wu, so ferocious that it seemed to tear the space open.","Many people were filled with terror.","The crown prince had been casually leaning back in his chair, but he narrowed his eyes a little.","No one could describe that burst of energy.","So far, Feng Wu had never met such a formidable opponent.","She was a junior Level 1 Spiritual King, while Sheng Changtian was a peak Level 1 Spiritual King.","She had just become a Spiritual King, but he had been one for years.","There was a huge gap between their power, but so what?","Feng Wu’s eyes burned with fighting spirit.","Everybody thought she couldn’t do it.","Everybody thought she would lose.","No one had any hope.","Feng Wu smiled, and her dress flapped in the wind.","“I’m standing here today.","“I’ll let the world hear my voice!”","She took a deep breath, and the Fallen Star Sword appeared in her hand.","“Gaping Ground!","“Cracking Ground!","“Ground Control!”","...","“Icy Ground!","“Thunder Ground!","“Fire Ground!”","Feng Wu used the skills from the Guardian of the Earth. She had been practicing them for a long time.","These were from a secret script that she had found in the tombs of the Senal Grassland a while ago. Before today, she had only used the first stance, but now, she used all nine of them.","Daze, reduce speed, and freeze!","The Fallen Star Sword was ready to destroy.","It took Sheng Changtian a long time to activate his most lethal move.","He wanted to end the battle with one stance and enjoy the glory and admiration afterward.","What he didn’t know was that he hadn’t learned enough about Feng Wu’s skills from Zuo Qingluan.","The real Feng Wu was much tougher.","He had never seen a junior Level 1 Spiritual King exert such power!","Thump!","Feng Wu’s strike nearly cut the sky in half.","It didn’t stop there but kept moving forward until it clashed with Sheng Changtian’s sword.","Lightning filled the sky, and the clashing blades gave off a blinding light.","The audience thought they were going blind.","The scene was beyond description.","Everybody watched with wide-open eyes.","Who would win?","Who would lose?","It all depended on this strike!","They saw spiritual essence ripple out from where the two blades clashed.","It was as if a volcano had erupted.","Boom!?","The collision set off an explosion.","Everybody’s face turned yellow-orange in the light.","The spiritual essence was like tidal waves.","White Flame couldn’t withstand the pressure. It shattered, and the shards fell to the ground."]},{"number":2887,"title":"Chapter 2887 - Did She Lose? (3)","paragraphs":["As everybody watched, the Fallen Star Sword flew back to Feng Wu’s hand.","Her long red dress flapped in the wind.","She looked as pretty as a picture.","Her skin was as white as snow.","She looked like a fairy descending to this world.","Time seemed to freeze for a moment.","No one made a sound.","Holy crap!","Everybody was astonished when they finally realized what had happened.","The Military Academy students sat there, looking like they had been struck by lightning.","The Imperial College students howled in excitement.","“OMG! I can’t believe it!!!”","“Did Feng Wu win? Did Feng Wu really win?!”","“Sheng Changtian’s White Flame was destroyed, right? Please tell me that I didn’t imagine that!”","“Did someone say White Flame would slaughter her and that forcing Sheng Changtian to use White Flame was the best she could do?”","“Not only did she force his hand, she also destroyed his sword!”","The Imperial College students were so excited that they seemed to lose their minds.","All the past humiliation was gone.","Members of Dynasty Team looked at one another.","They didn’t dare cheer loudly because they feared this wasn’t real.","Members of the Military Academy were speechless.","No words could describe how shocked and devastated they were.","Of the referees, Chu Yun was speechless.","Gongshu Hongzhu didn’t know what to say.","They also looked like they had been struck by lightning.","“This isn’t real! It can’t be! How can this happen?” Gongshu Hongzhu murmured. “That’s not possible...”","Gongsun Mu raised his chin and glanced at Chu Yun. “How did Xiao Wu do?”","After all these years, he could finally get back at her.","“How did she do? You saw it!” Chu Yun cursed inwardly.","Who taught that girl?","“God Mu, please take her away!” thought Chu Yun.","God Mu was the deity of this continent. Mu, as in Mu Jiuzhou.","The smoke finally cleared.","That ring of fire had disappeared.","Shards of White Flame were scattered on the ground.","Sheng Changtian looked at Feng Wu with glassy eyes.","His hair band was broken, and his long hair had fallen to his shoulders, giving him a grim look.","Feng Wu held the Fallen Star Sword behind her and nodded at Sheng Changtian. “You fought well.”","Those words woke Sheng Changtian up.","His brain started working again, and his eyes focused on Feng Wu’s face.","“You broke my ring of fire.","“You destroyed my White Flame.","“You’ve humiliated me in the worst possible way.","“That’s just great!” Sheng Changtian suddenly laughed wildly.","“I’ve never lost to anyone my age. Today is the first time.” He stared at Feng Wu.","His eyes lit up once more with fighting spirit."]},{"number":2888,"title":"Chapter 2888 - Did She Lose? (4)","paragraphs":["Sheng Changtian stared at Feng Wu, his eyes frighteningly bright.","White Flame was gone, but he wasn’t going to give up just yet.","People reacted differently to this.","The Military Academy students were excited and nervously waited to see what would happen next.","The Imperial College students began to panic.","Sheng Changtian looked like he had more cards up his sleeve. What would Feng Wu do? Would she lose?","They wanted to cry when they imagined that they were going to lose the advantage again.","Everybody kept their eyes on the stage, too nervous to breathe.","Who was going to win?","Sun Yu and Chen Ziyun had the same question.","Chen Ziyun said, “I think it’s a 50-50 chance.”","That was to say, the Imperial College still had a 50% chance of winning this competition.","“Feng Wu, you have to win!”","Many people clenched their fists and gritted their teeth.","Sheng Changtian grinned at Feng Wu. “You should give up now.”","Feng Wu shook her head.","Sheng Changtian said, “I’m not joking. If you don’t surrender now, I won’t give you another chance.”","Feng Wu just smirked.","Sheng Changtian feigned a sorry tone. “Why don’t you cherish your life? Don’t you want to live?”","The Imperial College students responded with loud boos.","“You’re the one who’s going to lose, and you’re asking Feng Wu to surrender. You’re shameless!”","“Bring it on! Xiao Wu will kick your ass!”","“All you can do is talk! Show us some moves!”","“Make a breakthrough now if you’re really that capable!” Ye Han cupped her hands around her mouth and shouted in Sheng Changtian’s direction.","Feng Wu said in amusement, “Did you hear that?”","Normally, Sheng Changtian would have lost his temper, but he was very calm now.","There was an eerie smile on his face.","Feng Wu was on guard. Was Sheng Changtian finally going to show his cards? She couldn’t wait to see what it was.","The next moment...","Rumble —","Unrestrained spiritual essence filled the air.","What was...","“Shit! Look at Sheng Changtian!” Sun Yu cried out.","He was loud enough for everybody to hear.","They all looked at Sheng Changtian.","To their astonishment, Sheng Changtian had made a breakthrough.","He was a peak Level 1 Spiritual King, and he had just risen to Level 2.","Everyone was speechless.","Ye Han, who had been shouting at Sheng Changtian a moment ago, didn’t know what to say.","She wanted to cut off her own tongue.","Everybody around her gave her sympathetic looks.","Chaoge said, “Are you sure you’re not from the Military Academy?”","Ye Han said, “I...”","Sheng Changtian sat on the ground with his legs crossed and absorbed all the spiritual essence.","He was a Level 2 Spiritual King now.","Feng Wu was only a junior Level 1 Spiritual King.","The gap between their powers had just increased.","It was unbelievable!","“Feng Wu is invincible when she fights people of her own level, but Sheng Changtian is no longer on that level.” Those who knew Feng Wu well were worried."]},{"number":2889,"title":"Chapter 2889 - Did She Lose? (5)","paragraphs":["Gongsun Mu was very concerned.","What should he do?","Feng Wu was going to lose!","Chu Qu was exasperated. “What are our chances now? Still 50-50?”","Everybody looked at Chen Ziyun.","He was the most capable cultivator here, so the others all wanted his opinion.","Chen Ziyun rubbed his nose and hesitated before saying, “Of course not, unless Feng Wu makes a breakthrough, too.”","The others rolled their eyes at him.","Chu Qu snapped, “Ziyun, stop dreaming! Can you say something about what Feng Wu can actually do?”","Sun Yu said, “That’s right. She’s only just become a Level 1 Spiritual King. She’s a junior!”","Chen Ziyun rubbed his nose again. “In that case, we can only hope His Royal Highness will give her a hand.”","The others rolled their eyes once more.","“That’s even more impossible! We might as well hope that Feng Wu can rise to Level 2!”","Chen Ziyun said calmly, “Don’t worry. It may be a bumpy road, but the outcome will be amazing.”","Sun Yu said, “I don’t believe a single word you said. Judging by the energy Sheng Changtian is giving off, once Feng Wu loses, the four of us won’t stand a chance even if we fight together.”","The others didn’t believe Chen Ziyun either.","Chen Ziyun didn’t know what to say.","What would it take for them to believe that the crown prince was on their side? He simply knew too much.","Up on the stage, Sheng Changtian opened his eyes.","He stared at Feng Wu with a cold smile on his face.","“If you kneel and apologize, I can give you a chance to surrender,” he said arrogantly as he looked down on her as if she were an ant.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Sheng Changtian said, “Are you not going to do it? Fine. Just remember I gave you a chance, but you threw it away.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She shook her head and sat down.","Everyone stared at Feng Wu in astonishment.","They all thought she should surrender.","He was a level higher than her. This was an impossible fight.","However...","“Why did she sit down? What’s she doing?” Gongshu Hongzhu finally calmed down from Sheng Changtian’s breakthrough and was astonished when he saw Feng Wu sitting down.","Jun Linyuan’s eyes were twinkling like the night sky.","“She’s making a breakthrough, obviously.” He glanced at Gongshu Hongzhu as if the latter were an idiot.","Obviously?","Other people might not think much of his tone, but Feng knew the crown prince too well to miss it.","The crown prince couldn’t sound any prouder.","He seemed to be saying, “You idiots should open your eyes and look carefully. My girl can make a breakthrough at will!”","Feng shook his head. Despite that satisfied look, the crown prince just wouldn’t say those words.","A breakthrough?","Gongshu Hongzhu felt he had heard the funniest thing in his life.","He wanted to guffaw, but realized those words had come from the crown prince, so he forced back his laughter.","“ Ahem... ” His face went scarlet red."]},{"number":2890,"title":"Chapter 2890 - Frustrated Zuo Qingluan","paragraphs":["Gongshu Hongzhu turned to the crown prince and tried to change the subject. “Your Royal Highness, isn’t Sheng Changtian amazing? He has just become a Level 2 Spiritual King.”","However, he didn’t get the reaction he wanted.","The crown prince said, “Such a good-for-nothing!”","Gongshu Hongzhu didn’t hear him clearly, so he looked at Jun Linyuan in confusion.","But the crown prince had turned away.","On stage, Sheng Changtian was staring at Feng Wu in astonishment, because she really was making a breakthrough.","She had switched to cultivation mode as soon as she sat down, shutting off all her senses.","Sheng Changtian forgot to blink.","Breakthrough or not, most people couldn’t switch to that mode and start cultivating right away.","Sheng Changtian needed to clear his mind, concentrate, and make other moves before he could cultivate.","All the students from both schools were amazed by what Feng Wu was doing.","“A breakthrough?”","“Is Feng Wu making a breakthrough?”","“She just mentioned a breakthrough, and she’s doing it now. Is that even possible?”","However, the familiar rumbling noise forced them to face reality.","Amidst the audience, someone had stiffened.","It was Zuo Qingluan.","She was still a Level 1 Spiritual King.","Although she was at the peak of Level 1, it didn’t change the fact that she was still at Level 1.","However, Feng Wu had just reached Level 2.","For a moment, Zuo Qingluan wanted to stand up and leave.","She couldn’t accept that fact.","She couldn’t help but recall her childhood.","Feng Wu had been a genius since she was three years old, and she could easily defeat anybody at the same cultivation level as her.","Besides Feng Liu, Zuo Qingluan had also lived in Feng Wu’s shadow.","Feng Wu was everything a parent wanted their child to be.","“Zuo Qingluan, how dumb can you be? Feng Wu has mastered it. Why can’t you?”","“Zuo Qingluan, you’re such an idiot! Feng Wu can recite it after reading it once. You’ve read it three times, but you still can’t read fluently!”","“Zuo Qingluan, you both have the True Phoenix Blood. Feng Wu is younger than you, but she’s already a few levels higher than you!”","...","When she was growing up, Zuo Qingluan’s parents had told her such things all the time.","She could see the disappointment on her grandfather’s face. Her parents were displeased, her siblings teased her, and even the servants looked down on her.","Back then, Feng Wu was the only sun in the sky.","Everybody wanted a daughter like her.","The master of Firmament Palace wanted Feng Wu to become her disciple!","Back then...","Zuo Qingluan racked her brain and set up that trap to destroy Feng Wu. Everything Feng Wu used to have became Zuo Qingluan’s.","In the last five years, she had gotten used to how people treated her. She enjoyed the compliments, the privileges, and the way she treated others.","However, Failure Wu, the cripple, had surpassed her once more!","Feng Wu was a Level 2 Spiritual King.","Zuo Qingluan was only a Level 1 Spiritual King.","Ah!!!","Zuo Qingluan clenched her fists, and her face went livid. She thought she was going to have a nervous breakdown.","“Feng Wu, you’re dead!”"]},{"number":2891,"title":"Chapter 2891 - What Was There to Say?","paragraphs":["Zuo Qingluan hated Feng Wu to the core.","She closed her eyes and told herself that with what she had given Sheng Changtian, he would win.","He would kill Feng Wu in front of Jun Linyuan.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu opened her eyes.","Her eyes were so black that they looked like bottomless pits.","When Sheng Changtian met her gaze, he felt panic-stricken.","No! Don’t panic!","When two capable fighters met, the first who panicked would lose.","Sheng Changtian forced himself to calm down and have some faith.","Feng Wu smiled a little. “Let’s begin.”","Sheng Changtian said, “Let’s!”","They charged at each other immediately after that.","In an instance, they exchanged hundreds of blows.","Sheng Changtian’s twisted face looked terrifying.","He was giving it all he had.","In contrast, Feng Wu was quite at ease.","This time, Feng Wu had the upper hand.","“How is this possible? This isn’t happening!”","Sheng Changtian tried to calm down, but it was an impossible task. His opponent was insanely talented.","Thump!","Their palms met, and they brushed past each other in the air.","Feng Wu landed steadily on her feet with a smile on her face.","Sheng Changtian flew backward until he fell to the ground with a loud thump.","It was such a loud noise.","The ground beneath him cracked.","Unable to stop himself, Sheng Changtian kept skidding backward.","He was about to fall off the stage.","The Military Academy students were torn by anxiety.","“No!!!”","“Sheng Changtian, hold on! You can’t fall!”","“You’re the last player we have! If you lose, we’re done for!”","...","They shouted at the top of their lungs.","They couldn’t sit still.","Everybody jumped to their feet, and their eyes were bloodshot.","They knew how they had humiliated Imperial College the year before. If they lost, the same thing would happen to them.","The idea was unbearable.","The moment before Sheng Changtian fell off, he finally grabbed the edge of the stage.","He raised his head and looked at Feng Wu in the distance.","He couldn’t hide the fear in his eyes.","What on earth was going on?","“God Mu, are you protecting Feng Wu?”","Meanwhile, the Imperial College students all had strange looks on their faces.","They didn’t know what to say.","“Feng Wu has...”","“And...”","“I didn’t know she was so awesome...”","Sun Yu and the other team members realized how little faith they had in Feng Wu; they had been so sure that she would lose. How they wished the ground would crack open under their feet and swallow them up!","It was so embarrassing!","They were mortified!","However, they didn’t mind being humiliated in this way.","“Was she hiding her true strength before?” Chu Qu asked weakly.","He remembered how he was the one who had greeted Feng Wu when she joined the team.","Back then, she had appeared to be on Qiu Zeyu’s level.","Chen Ziyun shook his head. “No, she wasn’t. She’s just making daily progress which you can see with your own eyes. She’s different from the person that she was yesterday.”","What else could the others say?"]},{"number":2892,"title":"Chapter 2892 - True Phoenix Blood (1)","paragraphs":["“I don’t get it! How can Feng Wu make a breakthrough at will?!” Chu Yun ground her teeth.","Jun Linyuan actually knew the answer.","Back then, when he tried to protect Feng Wu from the Magic Soul Vine, he had switched souls with her to refine the vine for her. Feng Wu then rose a whole stage.","Not one level, but one stage.","Feng Wu had made breakthroughs at this unbelievable speed since then.","Of course, the proud crown prince wouldn’t tell anyone else that.","Zuo Qingluan smiled coldly.","Feng Wu, do you really think you’re going to win?","Have you forgotten about my Shadow Phoenix?","All eyes were on Sheng Changtian and Feng Wu.","They wanted to know if Sheng Changtian had more cards up his sleeve.","Cards?","Sheng Changtian wiped away the blood at the corner of his mouth and lowered his eyes to hide his smirk.","When he looked up again, he poured the small bottle of True Phoenix Blood down his throat.","“Do you think you’ll win? No, Feng Wu, the game has only just begun!” Sheng Changtian smeared some blood on his cheeks.","It gave him an even more eerie look.","Formidable energy rose out of his body.","The audience wasn’t capable enough to feel it.","However, Feng Wu immediately noticed it.","True Phoenix Blood?","She had been born with it, so she was familiar with that energy.","She smirked when she looked from Sheng Changtian to Zuo Qingluan in the audience.","“Sheng Changtian, do you think drinking True Phoenix Blood will help you win this competition? You’re so naive!”","True Phoenix Blood?!","Everybody was watching them.","They were all very focused.","Therefore, they almost jumped when they heard the name “True Phoenix Blood.”","Zuo Qingluan’s eyes widened.","Sh*t!","Feng Wu recognized it!","What kind of nose did she have?","Sheng Changtian had only taken one sip of True Phoenix Blood, and Feng Wu had picked up the smell!","To make matters worse for Zuo Qingluan, Feng Wu made it known to everybody!","Zuo Qingluan thought,? Everybody will think I’m helping Sheng Changtian!","They will all see me as a traitor!","Zuo Qingluan’s expression remained calm, but one could see the anxiety in her eyes.","Sheng Changtian, you better keep your mouth shut!","All eyes were on Sheng Changtian.","“Is it really True Phoenix Blood?”","“I heard that two people in the imperial capital have True Phoenix Blood.”","“No, it used to be two people, Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan. However, Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood was destroyed, and only Zuo Qingluan has it now.”","“Where did Sheng Changtian get his?”","“Did Zuo Qingluan give it to him?”","“No, I don’t believe it!”","“How else could he have gotten it? Did the Military Academy get it by force?”","...","The audience was intimidated by Zuo Qingluan’s superior status and didn’t dare raise their voices.","They discussed the matter under their breaths and glanced at Zuo Qingluan from time to time.","On any other day, they wouldn’t have cared less whom Zuo Qingluan gave the True Phoenix Blood to.","But today was a special day!"]},{"number":2893,"title":"Chapter 2893 - True Phoenix Blood (2)","paragraphs":["This was a competition, and if Zuo Qingluan gave the True Phoenix Blood to their opponent, she would be a traitor!","The students’ opinion of Zuo Qingluan changed.","Qiu Zeyu knew where the True Phoenix Blood had come from, so when he detected tension in the audience, he lowered his head and tried not to be noticed.","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan was glaring at Sheng Changtian.","If Sheng Changtian dared tell the truth, she would kill him!","Sheng Changtian could sense the tension in the crowd and was satisfied to see what was happening to the future wife of the crown prince.","He now had something on the lady.","Does that mean I can get what I want through Zuo Qingluan in the future?","Sheng Changtian was excited by the thought.","Feng Wu didn’t miss the changing expressions on his face.","She rolled her eyes at him. “I’m asking you: Where did you get the True Phoenix Blood?”","Sheng Changtian smirked. “What True Phoenix Blood? I don’t know what you’re talking about.”","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t you just drink it?”","Sheng Changtian laughed. “True Phoenix Blood? Who told you I drank that? What’s the matter with you?","“I see!” Sheng Changtian snorted. “You’re jealous of the person who owns the True Phoenix Blood. You’re jealous of her talent, beauty, and the person she’s engaged to!","“That’s why you’re saying I drank the True Phoenix Blood. You want to ruin her reputation!","“For someone as pretty as you, you have such an evil mind!”","What?","Huh?","Everybody was listening.","Zuo Qingluan was the only one who had the True Phoenix Blood now.","Was Feng Wu jealous of her?","That seemed to make sense!","Many people believed what Sheng Changtian said.","Only a few people, like Duan Chaoge, Feng Xun and Chen Ziyun, knew the truth.","Most people had no idea what happened, so they started giving Feng Wu judgmental looks.","Zuo Qingluan forced herself not to burst out laughing.","Sheng Changtian was an excellent partner, and she was very pleased with what he said.","Feng Wu, I bet you didn’t see this coming! I’d like to see you talk yourself out of this!","Zuo Qingluan thought Feng Wu would become flustered, but she was wrong.","Feng Wu still had that calm smile on her face.","“Not the True Phoenix Blood, you say?","“And you didn’t get it from Zuo Qingluan?","“I’ll start collecting evidence, then!”","Feng Wu charged at Sheng Changtian before he had time to react.","As a Level 1 Spiritual King, she had already been a formidable fighter.","Having risen to Level 2, she was even more capable now.","By the time Sheng Changtian realized what Feng Wu was doing, he had already been lifted off the ground.","Feng Wu picked him up like he was a chicken.","Sheng Changtian was completely baffled.","Before he could figure out how to react, Feng Wu started collecting evidence."]},{"number":2894,"title":"Chapter 2894 - True Phoenix Blood (3)","paragraphs":["She held Sheng Changtian in one hand while her other hand clenched into a fist.","She then punched him in the stomach.","Her strength was too formidable for words to describe.","Boom!","Her fist landed in Sheng Changtian’s stomach.","Time seemed to freeze.","Everybody gave Sheng Changtian sympathetic looks.","Sheng Changtian immediately knew what it felt like to be punched by Feng Wu.","He thought she had punctured his stomach.","He instantly spat out a mouthful of blood.","Zuo Qingluan almost jumped to her feet.","The blood he spat out was her True Phoenix Blood!","Feng Wu’s friends were equally shocked.","They heard Feng Wu say she was going to find the evidence, but they never expected her to use such an approach.","That was very efficient.","Sheng Changtian was too shocked to utter a word.","Was Feng Wu even human?","They had become Level 2 Spiritual Kings around the same time.","He expected them to have similar levels of power.","How could she crush him so easily?","“Are you really a Level 2 Spiritual King?” Sheng Changtian gritted his teeth. “Are you sure you’re not a Level 3 Spiritual King?”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Didn’t your work partner tell you? I’m invincible when fighting against people of the same level.”","“She didn’t! She only said...” Sheng Changtian almost mentioned Zuo Qingluan’s name.","He realized his carelessness and stopped talking before he made another mistake.","Feng Wu shook her head.","She didn’t feel sorry for him for long because she had hard evidence now.","She turned to Gongsun Mu. “I’m asking for a time-out! Please examine this blood!”","Sheng Changtian was anxious.","If that happened...","He glanced at Zuo Qingluan.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to eat him alive.","Crossing her arms, Feng Wu looked from Sheng Changtian to Zuo Qingluan with a smile on her face. She had seen through these two people.","Seeing the threatening look in Zuo Qingluan’s eyes, Sheng Changtian immediately objected.","“I object!”","He glared at Feng Wu. “We’re still in a competition. A time-out will disrupt my rhythm. I’ll hold you responsible if I lose!”","“Oh, shut up!”","“Shhh —”","The audience booed and hooted.","Sheng Changtian’s face darkened.","A moment ago, they had still respected and feared him, but now, his image had been destroyed.","Gongsun Mu wanted to grant Feng Wu’s request, but Chu Yun objected.","“This is a competition. Don’t make it so complicated!” Chu Yun snorted. “Sheng Changtian is right. If his rhythm is disrupted, who’s going to take responsibility?”","Gongsun Mu said, “That’s not the case. Sheng Changtian drank True Phoenix Blood.”","Chu Yun smirked. “True Phoenix Blood? Who can tell if it’s true? Are you taking Feng Wu’s word for it?”","Gongsun Mu frowned. “I’m not, and Feng Wu asked for the blood to be examined because she also needs the physical evidence!”","Of course, Chu Yun knew examining the evidence was the right thing to do, but she wouldn’t let that happen.","Gongsun Mu was furious. “You’re an impossible woman!”","Chu Yun said, “What did you just say?!”"]},{"number":2895,"title":"Chapter 2895 - True Phoenix Blood (4)","paragraphs":["Seeing that an argument was about to break out, Elder Wu frowned. “Silence! Both of you!”","Gongshu Hongzhu smirked. “There’s no need to argue. His Royal Highness is right here, and he’ll tell us if we should pause the game and examine the evidence!”","He then turned to Jun Linyuan and said attentively, “Your Royal Highness, what do you think?”","Deep down, Gongshu Hongzhu was very pleased.","Why?","Jun Linyuan was the Military Academy’s honorary president, so it was only natural that he would take the Military Academy’s side.","Moreover, Zuo Qingluan was said to be his fiancee. He would protect her and choose not to examine the evidence.","The Imperial College would never get what it wanted!","Gongshu Hongzhu glanced at Chu Yun.","Chu Yun realized the connection as well.","Yes! Zuo Qingluan wasn’t someone Feng Wu could slander!","At that thought, she gave Gongsun Mu an arrogant look, pleased with having chosen the right side.","All eyes were on Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything.","He was annoyed.","How blind was Gongshu Hongzhu? He actually thought the crown prince would help Zuo Qingyun!","“Your Royal Highness?” Gongshu Hongzhu fought back his smile and reminded the crown prince in a low voice.","The crown prince said, “Get to the bottom of it!”","What?","That command was so unexpected that Gongshu Hongzhu almost banged his forehead on the table.","He stared at Jun Linyuan in disbelief.","Many other people did the same.","In the end, somebody said, “His Royal Highness is so unbiased, even when his beloved fiancee is involved.”","The others agreed with him.","Yes! He was such a just ruler!","One couldn’t wish more for a future emperor!","“Good!”","“Do it!”","“Find out the truth!”","“Such a wise decision!”","Everybody applauded and cheered, feeling proud to have such a crown prince.","Feng Xun and Chaoge looked at each other.","Chaoge said, “Why are they so surprised? Of course His Royal Highness will support Xiao Wu.”","Ye Han rested her hands on her waist and glared at Chaoge. “How can you say that? His Royal Highness isn’t a superficial person!”","Chaoge was speechless.","Of course he was!","He hid outside Xiao Wu’s window in the middle of the night!","Meanwhile, Gongsun Mu already got to work. He smiled at Chu Yun. “Would you like to join me, in case you decide Imperial College has cheated when the result comes out?”","Chu Yun smirked. “Of course not. I don’t want to get my hands dirty!”","Either way, she would insist that the evidence wasn’t to be trusted.","Just then, they heard a trustworthy voice behind them.","“Your Royal Highness, may I join them?”","It was none other than Feng himself.","Chu Yun stared at Feng in disbelief.","Feng was such a proud man, and he never took orders from anyone but the crown prince. However, he had just offered to help.","Why was he so nice to Feng Wu? He wasn’t her steward!","Zuo Qingluan’s pupils contracted, and a chill ran down her spine.","She gave Feng a warning look.","Feng didn’t even glance at her.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t know what to say.","She was so angry,"]},{"number":2896,"title":"Chapter 2896 - Shadow Phoenix (1)","paragraphs":["Since Feng had joined the team, Gongsun Mu could only work as his assistant.","With Feng here, the Military Academy wouldn’t dare make any false accusations.","If they refused to believe the evidence, the crown prince would teach them a lesson.","After Feng went off to examine the evidence, Feng Wu saw that Sheng Changtian’s face had turned livid.","She grinned. “Shall we continue?”","Sheng Changtian was listening to Zuo Qingluan’s warning in his head.","Zuo Qingluan was panic-stricken.","She could find an excuse for the True Phoenix Blood and talk herself out of it. However, things wouldn’t be so easy if Feng Wu recognized the Shadow Phoenix.","She then realized in frustration that she had used the Shadow Phoenix in the Secret Essence Mine before.","It had caused the collapse of the mine.","Elder Wu had also been there.","If Sheng Changtian activated it later, and people made the connection between the Shadow Phoenix and her True Phoenix Blood...","The thought almost gave her a heart attack.","Therefore, she gave Sheng Changtian a warning look.","Don’t activate the Shadow Phoenix!","Don’t use it!","Sheng Changtian knew what Zuo Qingluan was saying, but he wasn’t going to take orders from her.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t care if the Military Academy lost, but Sheng Changtian did.","Therefore, he grinned at Feng Wu. “Bring it on!”","Zuo Qingluan wished she could run up to the stage and throttle Sheng Changtian right now.","Damn it!","The battle resumed.","Terrifying energy filled the air.","Feng Wu didn’t give Sheng Changtian any chance. She believed battles should be finished as soon as possible.","Thump! Thump! Thump!","They exchanged rapid blows in mid-air.","Feng Wu had the upper hand.","Sheng Changtian was struck several times in the chest and kept falling back until he was at the edge of the stage.","At that critical moment, he finally used the last card up his sleeve.","The phoenix jade pendant!","Zuo Qingluan lost her last bit of hope.","Would she sit around passively on her end?","Of course not!","She was going to shoot a concealed weapon toward the stage.","She wanted to kill Sheng Changtian with it and blame it on Feng Wu. After that, the Military Academy would aim all its rage at her.","Feng Wu would never be able to rid herself of that stain.","The best way to cover up something was to create something even louder.","Zuo Qingluan wanted to save herself by killing Sheng Changtian.","However!","She was too naive.","As soon as she flipped her hand, she felt a pair of eyes on her.","She looked in that direction and met Jun Linyuan’s eyes.","They looked like bottomless pits.","She couldn’t tell what he was thinking.","There was no warmth in those eyes.","The man was ruthless.","She felt as though a sharp blade had cut her in half.","Those eyes!","Zuo Qingluan panicked.","At that moment, Sheng Changtian finally turned to his last resort.","He dropped the last drop of True Phoenix Blood onto the pendant before grinning at Feng Wu.","Inside the pendant, a phoenix woke up.","The grumpy bird didn’t like waking up.","Somebody had woken it up from a deep sleep, and it was annoyed.","Roar!","The phoenix rose from the pendant and hovered around Sheng Changtian’s head.","Fire burned in its eyes.","It wasn’t an ordinary fire.","That magical fire could burn a person to ash."]},{"number":2897,"title":"Chapter 2897 - Shadow Phoenix (2)","paragraphs":["Sheng Changtian was pleased.","Zuo Qingluan’s face went ghastly pale.","If the crown prince looked into it, he would definitely find out she was behind this.","However, she also had a crazy thought.","What if Sheng Changtian was right, and he could kill Feng Wu today?","If Feng Wu died, would the crown prince still come after her?","She would become the only owner of the True Phoenix Blood, and the royal family would definitely want her as a member.","Zuo Qingluan was both worried and filled with anticipation.","The only thing she wanted to see now was Sheng Changtian killing Feng Wu.","Everybody quieted down when the Shadow Phoenix appeared.","It was a terrifying being.","Its body was covered in dancing flames.","Each feather was a cluster of flames.","Flames came out of its eyes and its claws.","From afar, it was a big ball of fire.","Roarrr!","The Shadow Phoenix bellowed.","It wanted to lash out in frustration.","No one would be in a good mood when they were woken up from a sound sleep.","The Shadow Phoenix spat out a ball of fire, which was aimed at the audience.","The speed was incredible, and so was the damage it could cause.","The audience could feel the incredible heat long before the fire reached them.","Whoosh!","Elder Wu immediately created a shield in front of the audience.","However, even that couldn’t stop the fire. The shield was shattered in a matter of seconds.","In the end, it was Feng who saved the day.","“Phew —”","Everybody let out breaths of relief.","That had been so close.","Who would have thought that they would almost lose their lives by watching a game?","The people in the front rows had been so close to getting burnt, but those at the back didn’t feel much better.","They had almost died as well.","No one made a sound.","That Shadow Phoenix was terrifying!","What kind of power did it have?","It could kill someone by breathing on them!","Everyone looked at Feng Wu.","If the Shadow Phoenix could kill everyone in the audience by breathing, what should Feng Wu do?","Sun Yu and the others lost all hope.","“That’s so scary!” Chu Qu sucked in his breath.","Sun Yu patted his chest. “I’m still shaking...”","Chu Qu said, “This is an impossible battle!”","Sun Yu nodded. “The battles so far all happened between cultivators of similar levels. Although Xiao Wu is a little bit better, it was still within acceptable range.","“But this bird isn’t in that range! Where did it come from?!”","The others all shook their heads.","Elder Wu turned pale.","He had seen it before!","It had been in the Secret Essence Mine!","That Shadow Phoenix had chased them!","“It was that bird!” Elder Wu bellowed! “The Military Academy destroyed the Secret Essence Mine!”","Gongshu Hongzhu was perplexed. “I don’t know what you’re talking about.”","Elder Wu was already sending out messages.","The Military Academy would pay for what they did!","Meanwhile, Sheng Changtian was looking at Feng Wu with a ferocious grin on his face."]},{"number":2898,"title":"Chapter 2898 - Shadow Phoenix (3)","paragraphs":["Sheng Changtian said, “Feng Wu, do you see how fierce I am now?”","Feng Wu only smirked.","Someone in the Dynasty Team shouted anxiously, “Feng Wu, just give up!”","It was Sun Yu.","Chu Qu said, “Yes, just give up! We can’t defeat that thing. Just surrender.”","The other team members all said, “Yes, please do. You’ve already done an amazing job. No one will blame you, and no one will think you lost the battle.”","Chen Ziyun said earnestly, “Feng Wu, this isn’t your battle anymore. Just come back.”","It wasn’t Feng Wu’s fault. Their opponent had something so terrifying that it was beyond their imagination.","Even Elder Wu’s shield couldn’t stop the Shadow Phoenix. Feng Wu should come back before she lost her life.","Although the Imperial College students felt frustrated, they still asked Feng Wu to give up and to come back.","Feng Wu turned around to look at her teammates and fellow students from Imperial College.","They were all very lovely people.","However —","Not her battle?","Feng Wu didn’t believe that.","Her eyes met Zuo Qingluan’s, and Zuo Qingluan gloated.","Feng Wu suddenly smiled, too.","Her smile was as bright as the sun.","Zuo Qingluan’s stomach lurched.","Why did it feel like Feng Wu still had more tricks to play?","No! That wasn’t possible!","What more could she possibly know?","Zuo Qingluan involuntarily turned to Jun Linyuan and wondered how he would react.","It was incredible!","The crown prince rose to his feet.","Zuo Qingluan turned pale and began to panic.","Was His Royal Highness going to protect Feng Wu?","Did he have feelings for her? No! That couldn’t be happening!","The crown prince was about to walk to Feng Wu, when she beamed at the Shadow Phoenix.","Why did she do that?","Sheng Changtian snorted. She wouldn’t be smiling for much longer!","“Shadow Phoenix, kill Feng Wu!”","The Shadow Phoenix was furious.","How dare a human being order it around?!","Just then, Feng Wu smiled and waved at the Shadow Phoenix. “Shadow Phoenix, come to me.”","Nobody understood what she was doing.","Even the crown prince paused and looked at her in bewilderment.","Feng was also surprised.","She shouldn’t underestimate that bird.","Sheng Changtian laughed so hard that he was in tears.","“Do you think you own this Shadow Phoenix?","“How dare you order it around like it’s a pet?","“Feng Wu, how stupid are you?!”","...","Feng Wu ignored Sheng Changtian and only smiled at the Shadow Phoenix. “Are you sure you don’t want to come here and drink my blood?”","She took out a dagger and sliced it across her palm.","Blood oozed out.","The crown prince’s pupils contracted.","If he didn’t have great self-control, he would have torn the stage apart.","Sheng Changtian smirked. “Your blood? Do you really think your blood is more precious than the True Phoenix Blood?”","Everybody started talking.","“True Phoenix Blood?”"]},{"number":2899,"title":"Chapter 2899 - Shadow Phoenix (4)","paragraphs":["“Is it really True Phoenix Blood?”","“So, Sheng Changtian got his hands on some True Phoenix Blood?”","Most people had been so focused on the Shadow Phoenix that they forgot about the True Phoenix Blood.","Feng Wu grinned at Sheng Changtian. “Are you sure there’s no blood rarer than the True Phoenix Blood?”","Sheng Changtian said arrogantly, “Is there?”","Everybody thought the same.","Was there?","Zuo Qingluan’s stomach lurched.","She had a very bad feeling.","Had Feng Wu recovered her True Phoenix Blood?","No, that couldn’t happen!","That wasn’t possible!","She had personally destroyed Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood.","Why did she feel so nervous?","She felt like a giant hand was gripping her heart; it was beating so fast, like it would jump out of her mouth.","“Yes, there is.” Feng Wu beamed at Sheng Changtian, looking as pretty as a picture.","Sheng Changtian didn’t believe her.","However, the Shadow Phoenix did.","It didn’t believe what Feng Wu said, but it trusted its nose.","The bird identified with Feng Wu’s blood, as if it belonged there.","That was something that had been branded in its name.","The Shadow Phoenix had tasted Feng Wu’s blood once, and could never forget that taste.","Hence...","It flew toward Feng Wu.","“Watch out!”","“Feng Wu, come back!”","“Feng Wu, run!”","The people who didn’t know what was happening shouted at Feng Wu, telling her to run.","Those who knew what was happening watched Feng Wu in amazement.","The Shadow Phoenix wasn’t big. It was about the size of an adult.","It hovered in the air in front of Feng Wu and stared at her with its cold eyes.","It didn’t trust Feng Wu completely.","Feng Wu hadn’t been the first person it saw when it woke up.","Someone had put a spell on the bird.","When it was activated by the True Phoenix Blood, it would pledge loyalty to the first person it saw.","It didn’t like that hypocritical girl, but it still fought for her.","The Shadow Phoenix stared grimly at Feng Wu, while Feng Wu smiled at it and waved her left hand.","There —","Fresh blood was dripping.","The smell was so alluring that the Shadow Phoenix couldn’t control itself anymore.","It tried to fight back the longing in its head.","The smell was so attractive!","The Shadow Phoenix couldn’t hold on for much longer.","Zuo Qingluan was really panicking now.","“Back!” She glared at the Shadow Phoenix. “Go back to the pendant!”","Everybody looked at her.","Why did she jump out?","Feng Xun asked loudly, “Zuo Qingluan, why are you giving the Shadow Phoenix orders? Do you have something to do with it?”","Did she have something to do with it?","Of course she did!","Would she admit it here?","Definitely not!","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth and clenched her fists.","Why was everybody against her?","Why were they all on Feng Wu’s side?","Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t accept that!","However, given the circumstances, she could only sit back down.","The Shadow Phoenix felt conflicted.","Should it drink the blood?","It couldn’t decide!","It suddenly had an idea."]},{"number":2900,"title":"Chapter 2900 - Divine Phoenix Blood (1)","paragraphs":["Why should I feel conflicted? That blood is obviously better! I’m not switching masters. Why should I overthink it?","No, I can’t do that!","I’ve drunk this girl’s blood before, which means I’ve already betrayed my master once. I can’t drink it again!","The Shadow Phoenix turned its head away.","Zuo Qingluan was relieved.","At the end of the day, the Shadow Phoenix still followed her orders.","“Why does that yummy smell keep floating my way?!” The Shadow Phoenix was frustrated.","Sheng Changtian also opened his palm.","He still had a little True Phoenix Blood that Zuo Qingluan had given to him.","He said, “Come here! I have some True Phoenix Blood!”","The audience watched with curiosity.","The competition had somehow become a game of wooing a pet, but no one cared about that. They only wanted to know how the Shadow Phoenix would choose.","Hearing what Sheng Changtian said, the Shadow Phoenix turned its head and rolled its eyes at him.","That was a look of disdain.","Disdain...","No one expected to see such a look.","That was the True Phoenix Blood!","“Is it me, or does the Shadow Phoenix actually look disgusted?” Ye Han asked Chaoge.","She hadn’t believed Chaoge before, but Chaoge had been right every single time. Ye Han still wouldn’t openly agree with Chaoge, but she couldn’t help but look to Chaoge for answers.","Chaoge said grumpily, “I thought you didn’t believe me. Why are you asking?”","Ye Han pouted. “It’s just a random question... Do you really think I’m asking for your opinion?”","Chaoge was speechless.","Ye Han asked curiously, “So, is Feng Wu’s blood more precious than Zuo Qingluan’s?”","Chaoge said, “Of course!”","Ye Han said, “I don’t believe you!”","Chaoge was speechless.","The rest of the audience was also excited and intrigued.","This proved that the blood which Sheng Changtian had was Zuo Qingluan’s True Phoenix Blood. How would the Shadow Phoenix choose?","This was so exciting!","At the center of attention, the Shadow Phoenix felt agitated.","Zuo Qingluan gave it a warning look.","The Shadow Phoenix was angry at both Zuo Qingluan and itself.","Why is my master so weak?","Her blood used to be acceptable, but why do I feel so attracted to better blood?","Is this an immoral thing to do?","I don’t know what to do! This is so hard!","The next second, the conflicted Shadow Phoenix licked the blood on Feng Wu’s palm.","All eyes were on the Shadow Phoenix.","It raised its head and closed its eyes to savor it. It was so delicious!","The crowd was speechless.","Zuo Qingluan felt like she had just been slapped.","Sheng Changtian was shaken to the core.","He looked at his palm. There was still some blood there, but...","He looked at Zuo Qingluan and saw the mixture of rage, bewilderment, and astonishment on her face.","Sheng Changtian was dumbfounded.","He still didn’t know what was happening."]}]);
